"title": "Golden Chickens Deploy TerraStealerV2 to Steal Browser Credentials and Crypto Wallet Data",,
"url": "https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/golden-chickens-deploy-terrastealerv2.html",,
"summary": "Golden Chickens, also known as Venom Spider, have developed two new malware families called TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger. TerraStealerV2 targets browser credentials and cryptocurrency wallet data, while TerraLogger logs keystrokes. The malware does not bypass Chrome's latest security updates, indicating either outdated or developing code. The malicious payloads are distributed through various formats and leverage trusted Windows utilities to evade detection. The threat group continues to refine their arsenal while operating under a malware-as-a-service model. Active exploitation of these tools is observed in the wild.",,
