"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/aispm-for-dummies.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/ai-security-posture-management-ai-spm-for-dummies?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY26Q1_INB_FORM_AI-SPM-for-Dummies-eBook&sfcid=701Py00000KWgAHIA1&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AI-SPMDummies)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * OpenAI document explains when to use each ChatGPT model\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/)\n\n\n# OpenAI document explains when to use each ChatGPT model\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * May 4, 2025\n  * 01:59 PM\n  * [1](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/#comments)\n\n\n![OpenAI](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2023\/03\/24\/ChatGPT-logo.jpg)\nOpenAI model names have been confusing, but the company is finally taking steps to make it easier for users to understand the different ChatGPT models.\nOpenAI quietly [posted](https:\/\/help.openai.com\/en\/articles\/11165333-chatgpt-enterprise-models-limits) an article titled \"ChatGPT Enterprise - Models & Limits\" on May 3.\nWhile it provides an overview of all the available models and when to use one over another for enterprises, these advices are also applicable to regular users.\n![GPT](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/Tech\/ChatGPT-models.jpg)\nRight now, ChatGPT offers five models - GPT-4o, o3, o4-mini, o4-mini-high, and GPT-4.5.\n## What to choose between GPT 4o and 4.5?\nAccording to the document, GPT 4o is the \"omni model\" with real-time information, and it should be used for summarizing content, brainstorming ideas or emails.\nSince it's a full-fledged multimodal, you can use nearly all the features, ranging from custom GPTs to image generation, canvas, advanced audio, and data analysis.\nOn the other hand, GPT-4.5 is your \"creative\" powerhouse, and it offers better emotional intelligence, communication and a creative approach to brainstorming.\nIt's a lot like the GPT-4o, but if you prefer more creativity, GPT-4.5 should be your first choice.\n## What to choose between o4-mini, o4-mini-high and o3?\nChatGPT offers three reasoning models to regular users, but which one should you be using?\nAs per the document, o4-mini is fast for technical tasks, such as quick STEM-related queries, programming, visual reasoning.\nOn the other hand, o4-mini-high is best at detailed technical tasks, such as advanced coding, math, scientific explanations and higher accuracy.\nUnlike these two models, o3 stands out in complex or multi step tasks, such as strategic planning, detailed analyses, extensive coding, advanced math, science, coding, and visual reasoning.\nYou'll be able to choose between these models only when you pay $20 for ChatGPT Plus.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg)](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[OpenAI's $20 ChatGPT Plus is now free for students until the end of May](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-20-chatgpt-plus-is-now-free-for-students-until-the-end-of-may\/)\n[ChatGPT is down worldwide with something went wrong error](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-down-worldwide-with-something-went-wrong-error\/)\n[OpenAI says Deep Research is coming to ChatGPT free \"very soon\"](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-says-deep-research-is-coming-to-chatgpt-free-very-soon\/)\n[Google takes on Cursor with Firebase Studio, its AI builder for vibe coding](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-takes-on-cursor-with-firebase-studio-its-ai-builder-for-vibe-coding\/)\n[OpenAI tests watermarking for ChatGPT-4o Image Generation model](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-tests-watermarking-for-chatgpt-4o-image-generation-model\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * [ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chatgpt\/)\n  * [GPT o3](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/gpt-o3\/)\n  * [OpenAI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/openai\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/stealc-malware-enhanced-with-stealth-upgrades-and-data-theft-tools\/)\n  * [Next Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-windows-11-24h2-now-ready-to-rollout-to-everyone\/)\n\n\n### Comments\n  * ![EugeneForster Photo](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/)\n######  [EugeneForster](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/u\/1344118\/eugeneforster\/) - 5 hours ago\n    * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/ \"Report\")\n    * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/#cid36116 \"Link\")\nThanks for the article, I'd missed this in the news. If anyone can tell me why ChatGPT doesn't have an additional chargeable service to monitor your usage and apply the right model in context for complex matters, I'd love to hear it. Or better yet orchestrate them. I believe fixed pricing is causing a resources war (even for Pro users) meaning that the system must find new and innovative ways to frustrate your productivity and work. OpenAI has recreated the Facebook algorithm to keep you on the hook (working simultaneously for and against you), and like Facebook, that mindset helped them grow in a closed market, but now it's clear that it will be the reason they will ultimately fail. \n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Delivery Chains](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/delivery-chains.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/advancements-in-delivery-scripting-with-nietzsche\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trun-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Microsoft](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/) Microsoft ends Authenticator password autofill, moves users to Edge ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/microsoft-ends-authenticator-password-autofill-moves-users-to-edge\/)\n  * [ ![Microsoft passwordless](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/) Microsoft makes all new accounts passwordless by default ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-makes-all-new-accounts-passwordless-by-default\/)\n  * [ ![Co-op](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/) Co-op confirms data theft after DragonForce ransomware claims attack ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/co-op-confirms-data-theft-after-dragonforce-ransomware-claims-attack\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/) Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024 ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/resources\/2024-identity-attacks?utm_campaign=12100141-FY25Q2_Bleeping-Computer-Article&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_content=external-article)\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Enhancing your DevSecOps with Wazuh, the open source XDR platform](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/) Enhancing your DevSecOps with Wazuh, the open source XDR platform ](https:\/\/wazuh.com?utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_medium=sidebar_referral&utm_campaign=wazuh_bleepingcomputer)\n  * [ ![View your organization's attack surface & digital frauds - at no cost. Register now for CTM360's Community Edition](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/) View your organization's attack surface & digital frauds - at no cost. Register now for CTM360's Community Edition ](https:\/\/www.ctm360.com\/free-access?utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_medium=sidebar&utm_campaign=ctm360_bleepingcomputer)\n  * [ ![Rethinking Automated Penetration Testing: Why Validation Changes Everything](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/) Rethinking Automated Penetration Testing: Why Validation Changes Everything ](https:\/\/www.picussecurity.com\/resource\/blog\/rethinking-automated-penetration-testing?utm_campaign=7149959-Red%20Report%202025&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_content=blog)\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.6009689847528177)\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/a