"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/devsecops-playbook.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/getting-started-with-devsecops?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY25Q4_INB_FORM_DevSecOps-Getting-Started-Playbook&sfcid=701Py00000HwiF6IAJ&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=DevSecOpsPlaybook)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * Google NotebookLM is now using Gemini 2.5 Flash\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/)\n\n\n# Google NotebookLM is now using Gemini 2.5 Flash\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * May 3, 2025\n  * 05:21 PM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Google NotebookLM](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2023\/06\/16\/Google.jpg)\nGoogle NotebookLM, which is a research and note-taking AI tool, is getting upgraded to Gemini 2.5 Flash.\nNotebookLM research tool is specifically famous for the Audio Overviews feature, which is a podcast-style generative audio feature.\nWhile the Audio Overviews feature isn't getting a big overhaul today, Google has confirmed that the research tool in NotebookLM is now powered by Gemini 2.5 Flash.\nFor those unaware, 2.5 models are thinking models, which means NotebookLM can now generate better responses because it can now think \"deeper.\"\nGemini 2.5 Flash is one of the significant upgrades in the 2.5 reasoning series. It offers better reasoning with improved speed and reduced cost.\nWith Gemini 2.5 Flash support, you can expect more comprehensive answers in NotebookLM, particularly to complex, multi-step reasoning questions.\nHowever, as I mentioned, this change will not improve Audio Overviews.\nIn a on X, Google noted that Gemini 2.5 Flash integration applies only to the text side of NotebookLM.\n\"Great question! This will currently only impact the Q&A but great feedback for our audio overviews team Thank you,\" Google NotebookLM team wrote in a post.\n![NotebookLM](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/Google\/NotebookLM.jpg)\nIn addition, Google confirmed that it's working on a new NotebookLM app for [Android ](https:\/\/apps.apple.com\/us\/app\/notebooklm\/id6737527615)and [iOS ](https:\/\/apps.apple.com\/us\/app\/notebooklm\/id6737527615)with a release date scheduled for May 20.\nNotebookLM isn't getting integrated into the Gemini app, which remains an independent assistant.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[Google takes on Cursor with Firebase Studio, its AI builder for vibe coding](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-takes-on-cursor-with-firebase-studio-its-ai-builder-for-vibe-coding\/)\n[Google Gemini AI is getting ChatGPT-like Scheduled Actions feature](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-gemini-ai-is-getting-chatgpt-like-scheduled-actions-feature\/)\n[Google Gemini's Astra (screen sharing) rolls out on Android for some users](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-geminis-astra-screen-sharing-rolls-out-on-android-for-some-users\/)\n[OpenAI document explains when to use each ChatGPT model](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/)\n[WhatsApp unveils 'Private Processing' for cloud-based AI features](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/whatsapp-unveils-private-processing-for-cloud-based-ai-features\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * [Gemini](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/gemini\/)\n  * [Google](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/google\/)\n  * [NotebookLM](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/notebooklm\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/microsoft-ends-authenticator-password-autofill-moves-users-to-edge\/)\n  * [Next Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/offer\/deals\/this-microsoft-azure-course-deal-helps-you-study-for-it-certifications\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Delivery Chains](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/delivery-chains.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/advancements-in-delivery-scripting-with-nietzsche\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trun-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Microsoft](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/) Microsoft ends Authenticator password autofill, moves users to Edge ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/microsoft-ends-authenticator-password-autofill-moves-users-to-edge\/)\n  * [ ![Microsoft passwordless](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/) Microsoft makes all new accounts passwordless by default ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-makes-all-new-accounts-passwordless-by-default\/)\n  * [ ![ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/) OpenAI document explains when to use each ChatGPT model ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/) Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024 ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/resources\/2024-identity-attacks?utm_campaign=12100141-FY25Q2_Bleeping-Computer-Article&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_content=external-article)\n  * [ ![Enhancing your DevSecOps with Wazuh, the open source XDR platform](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/) Enhancing your DevSecOps with Wazuh, the open source XDR platform ](https:\/\/wazuh.com?utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_medium=sidebar_referral&utm_campaign=wazuh_bleepingcomputer)\n  * [ ![View your organization's attack surface & digital frauds - at no cost. Register now for CTM360's Community Edition](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/) View your organization's attack surface & digital frauds - at no cost. Register now for CTM360's Community Edition ](https:\/\/www.ctm360.com\/free-access?utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_medium=sidebar&utm_campaign=ctm360_bleepingcomputer)\n  * [ ![Rethinking Automated Penetration Testing: Why Validation Changes Everything](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/) Rethinking Automated Penetration Testing: Why Validation Changes Everything ](https:\/\/www.picussecurity.com\/resource\/blog\/rethinking-automated-penetration-testing?utm_campaign=7149959-Red%20Report%202025&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_content=blog)\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/