"title": "Microsoft ends Authenticator password autofill, moves users to Edge",,
"url": "https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/microsoft-ends-authenticator-password-autofill-moves-users-to-edge\/",,
"summary": "Microsoft announced the discontinuation of the password storage and autofill feature in the Authenticator app to streamline credential management under Microsoft Edge. Affected users need to export their passwords from Authenticator before August 1, 2025, or lose them. Edge will become the platform for autofill functionality, necessitating users to install Edge on their devices. Passkeys will still be supported in Authenticator. There are no new vulnerabilities, malware, or threat actors mentioned specific to this change.",,
