"title": "Ransomware attacks on food and agriculture industry have doubled in 2025",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/ransomware-attacks-food-and-ag-double-2025",,
"summary": "In 2025, ransomware attacks on the food and agriculture industry have seen a significant increase, doubling compared to the previous year. The attacks are largely attributed to groups like Clop, RansomHub, and Akira, with a focus on exploiting vulnerabilities in legacy equipment and industrial control systems that are prevalent in these sectors. The Food and Ag-ISAC identified a total of 84 attacks in the first quarter of 2025, with major incidents impacting large producers in South Africa and Siberia. Tight supply chains and just-in-time delivery models make these organizations appealing targets for ransomware.",,
