"summary": "On election day in Romania, a Russian-linked hacktivist group named NoName057(16) launched distributed denial-of-service (DDoS) attacks against several Romanian government websites including the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the Romanian government, the Constitutional Court, and various presidential candidates. These attacks occurred during the rerun of Romania's presidential election, following the annulment of the first round due to prior Russian interference. The Romanian National Directorate for Cyber Security confirmed that the websites had been restored after the attacks.",,
