"summary": "Multiple school districts and a university in New Mexico are experiencing cyberattacks, causing operational issues for thousands of students. Cyberattacks on Georgia\u2019s Coweta County School System and Western New Mexico University have resulted in operational disruptions, with critical exams approaching. The attacks, suspected to be ransomware-related, have led to systems being taken offline as investigations continue. The school districts are working with authorities to determine the extent of data breaches concerning student and employee information.",,
