"markdown": "[_\ue80a_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\nContact\/Tip Us\n[ _\uf0e0_ Reach out to get featured\u2014contact us to send your exclusive story idea, research, hacks, or ask us a question or leave a comment\/feedback! ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/p\/submit-news.html)\nFollow Us On Social Media\n[_\uf167_](https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/c\/thehackernews?sub_confirmation=1)\n[_\uf09e_ RSS Feeds](https:\/\/feeds.feedburner.com\/TheHackersNews) [_\uf0f3_ Email Alerts](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/google-fixes-actively-exploited-android.html#email-outer) [_\uf2c6_ Telegram Channel](https:\/\/t.me\/+wKrQxniFO1Q1OTRk)\n[![AI Security Report](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEiS3-N1dwbpW7jXMhyphenhyphen7_p0Q8s9OQpjbWqTZnBlYaqu9QuZ_QI95w6k63h9N3aySEjPfW-HRm2OF_sZXTaHFzoXUl0YRkOrNcN1ZJborZ4gVo_b_UycMQNROnrvtttC82SSaeuCqQPGbL2UH6rigwqJ2AVAgo-Ul8Gv58IK5OlxXTdWZT8HYPXB3aC-NX_a5\/s728-rw-e30\/f5e18cb2ed9e429ab490b482f9e990a8.png)](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/threatlabz-ai-report-d)\n# [Update ASAP: Google Fixes Android Flaw (CVE-2025-27363) Exploited by Attackers](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/google-fixes-actively-exploited-android.html)\n_\ue802_ May 06, 2025 _\ue804_ Ravie LakshmananVulnerability \/ Mobile Security\n[![Android System Flaw in May 2025 Security Update](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEi9wNxXmRZB157E2BLzz0UZCkOTnRBWLC5FJjKtD7qLupugQ-POSkFKe1c9mK7ZiA9mZ5njsy8yPpOw4tCmkyhO1BXj14PARwW7e_k9Br-yWOwg0PHz9P640n318qfNcPGciQe_ar7b9G5ZpRN9tVL77Kwp_upQXqJ7aZOhB7FrvkHL-MS2wagBfF7gtQ1m\/s728-rw-e365\/android.jpg)](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEi9wNxXmRZB157E2BLzz0UZCkOTnRBWLC5FJjKtD7qLupugQ-POSkFKe1c9mK7ZiA9mZ5njsy8yPpOw4tCmkyhO1BXj14PARwW7e_k9Br-yWOwg0PHz9P640n318qfNcPGciQe_ar7b9G5ZpRN9tVL77Kwp_upQXqJ7aZOhB7FrvkHL-MS2wagBfF7gtQ1m\/s728-rw-e365\/android.jpg)\nGoogle has [released](https:\/\/source.android.com\/docs\/security\/bulletin\/2025-05-01) its monthly security updates for Android with fixes for 46 security flaws, including one vulnerability that it said has been exploited in the wild.\nThe vulnerability in question is CVE-2025-27363 (CVSS score: 8.1), a high-severity flaw in the System component that could lead to local code execution without requiring any additional execution privileges.\n\"The most severe of these issues is a high security vulnerability in the System component that could lead to local code execution with no additional execution privileges needed,\" Google said in a Monday advisory. \"User interaction is not needed for exploitation.\"\nIt's worth noting that CVE-2025-27363 is [rooted](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/03\/meta-warns-of-freetype-vulnerability.html) in the FreeType open-source font rendering library. It was first disclosed by Facebook in March 2025 as having been exploited in the wild.\n[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/google-fixes-actively-exploited-android.html)](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/nudge-eliminate-d \"Cybersecurity\")\nThe shortcoming has been described as an out-of-bounds write flaw that could result in code execution when parsing TrueType GX and variable font files. The issue has been remediated in FreeType versions higher than 2.13.0.\n\"There are indications that CVE-2025-27363 may be under limited, targeted exploitation,\" Google acknowledged in its security bulletin. The exact specifics of the attacks are presently unknown.\nGoogle's May update also resolves eight other flaws in the Android System and 15 flaws in the Framework module that could be abused to facilitate privilege escalation, information disclosure, and denial-of-service.\n\"Exploitation for many issues on Android is made more difficult by enhancements in newer versions of the Android platform,\" the company said. \"We encourage all users to update to the latest version of Android where possible.\"\nFound this article interesting? Follow us on and to read more exclusive content we post.\nSHARE [_\uf1e0_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\n_\uf1e0_ Share\n[_\ue80a_](javascript:void\\(0\\)) [_\uf1d4_ Share on Hacker News](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F05%2Fgoogle-fixes-actively-exploited-android.html&t=Update%20ASAP%3A%20Google%20Fixes%20Android%20Flaw%20\\(CVE-2025-27363\\)%20Exploited%20by%20Attackers) _\uf0e0_ Share on Email [_\uf232_ Share on WhatsApp](https:\/\/api.whatsapp.com\/send?text=Update%20ASAP%3A%20Google%20Fixes%20Android%20Flaw%20\\(CVE-2025-27363\\)%20Exploited%20by%20Attackers \u2014 https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F05%2Fgoogle-fixes-actively-exploited-android.html) [![Facebook Messenger](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/google-fixes-actively-exploited-android.html)Share on Facebook Messenger](fb-messenger:\/\/share\/?link=https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F05%2Fgoogle-fixes-actively-exploited-android.html&app_id=280117418781535) [_\uf2c6_ Share on Telegram](https:\/\/telegram.me\/share\/url?url=https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F05%2Fgoogle-fixes-actively-exploited-android.html&text=Update%20ASAP%3A%20Google%20Fixes%20Android%20Flaw%20\\(CVE-2025-27363\\)%20Exploited%20by%20Attackers)\n[SHARE _\uf1e0_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\n[Android](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Android)[cybersecurity](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/cybersecurity)[FreeType](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/FreeType)[mobile security](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/mobile%20security)[privilege escalation](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/privilege%20escalation)[system security](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/system%20security)[Vulnerability](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Vulnerability)\n[![c](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEipPJ-RDZPiSFyQaYgFV8WRuTbSKO9e6Y3LNezLfUhw-rhnR7wErUeM2AwrIEqjZKKDoZALBbfScKxiGBBXEqYul9nWZBKtfh11hbOq_3ZYS8GnFovgJ-OlOdvdDzYqX0AJwe_VYp3h