s:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/04\/sap-confirms-critical-netweaver-flaw.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/new-investment-scams-use-facebook-ads.html) Microsoft Sets Passkeys Default for New Accounts; 15 Billion Users Gain Passwordless Support ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/microsoft-sets-passkeys-default-for-new.html)\nMore Stories \u25bc\nPopular Resources\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/new-investment-scams-use-facebook-ads.html) This Visual Map Is Changing How Security Teams See Non-Human Identity Risk \u2014 Get a Demo ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/gitguardian-demo)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/new-investment-scams-use-facebook-ads.html) Get the Checklist Security Teams Use to Stop Lateral Movement Attacks ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/microsegmentation-guide-checklist)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/new-investment-scams-use-facebook-ads.html) Get a Demo \u2014 Why CISOs Call Wing a 'Game-Changer' for SaaS Threat Detection ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/wing-security-demo)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/new-investment-scams-use-facebook-ads.html) From AI Data Leaks to Phishing Funnels\u2014This Report Exposes the Real Browser Risks ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/browser-security-report-2025)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ Secure Faster, Smarter, Together Redesign Security on Your Terms\u2014From Code to Cloud to SOC Cloud attacks move fast\u2014fixes lag. Unite app, cloud, and SOC security to respond quicker and stop breaches early. Reserve Your Seat ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/code-cloud-soc?source=below) [ Control AI Before It Controls You Discover the Smartest Way to Secure AI Agents\u2014Before They're Exploited AI agents boost business\u2014but create risks. Learn to prevent leaks, secure AI, and stay protected with expert tips. Reserve Your Seat ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-security?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybers