"summary": "Microsoft has announced the integration of AI agents within Windows to streamline the process of modifying settings on PCs. These agents leverage AI to understand user intentions from natural language inputs and can make changes with user permission. Initially, this will be available for English speakers and primarily for Windows Insiders on Snapdragon-powered devices, followed by AMD- and Intel-powered devices. The article does not focus on cybersecurity vulnerabilities or threats, but rather highlights enhancements in user experience through AI.",,
