valuating-sses-technical-gap.html) 2025 Microsoft Vulnerabilities Report\u2014Download Before the Next Patch Cycle ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/microsoft-vuln-report)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html) From AI Data Leaks to Phishing Funnels\u2014This Report Exposes the Real Browser Risks ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/browser-security-report-2025)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html) Get a Demo \u2014 Why CISOs Call Wing a 'Game-Changer' for SaaS Threat Detection ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/wing-security-demo)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html) This Visual Map Is Changing How Security Teams See Non-Human Identity Risk \u2014 Get a Demo ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/gitguardian-demo)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ Secure Faster, Smarter, Together Redesign Security on Your Terms\u2014From Code to Cloud to SOC Cloud attacks move fast\u2014fixes lag. Unite app, cloud, and SOC security to respond quicker and stop breaches early. Join the Webinar ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/code-cloud-soc?source=below) [ Control AI Before It Controls You Discover the Smartest Way to Secure AI Agents\u2014Before They're Exploited AI agents boost business\u2014but create risks. Learn to prevent leaks, secure AI, and stay protected with expert tips. Sign Up for the Webinar ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-security?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybersecurity Resources\n[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgd_MnxPpQmrmAssYNnhDReESftbJ0IYVVE2JTMZhDAMmdj8TbzBYLv2RhMLaUf1ZsfYCMg4Jc5bpFT7CCdFlD4i00ghnt5eKfghy5W0NVeJ_LBbbiHyNt0r5tfWIAA2AZ_IDaFeNiyU9irbY4R7pbOE3WgZkibStdHReF0FDwuS3KXxe0p6v8U7YrqowBA\/s400-e100\/wiz-native.png)Unite Dev and Sec with ASPMRedefining Secure Development with Application Security Posture Management (ASPM). Unlock the tools and processes that will help developers ship fast and fix fast.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/wiz-devsec-aspm)[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html)The Definitive Guide to SaaS Security\u2014Trusted by Security LeadersA clear, practical guide to help CISOs and IT teams secure SaaS apps, reduce risks, and protect data.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/appomni-saas-guide-light)[![Cybersecurity with Georgetown](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html)Earn a Master's in Cybersecurity Risk ManagementLead the future of cybersecurity risk management with an online Master's from Georgetown.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/master-cyber-risk-1)[![Exposure Management Course](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEjvTyEjrOOp2YwKJOVBa1Xg010e8uW4Kbi8cVO7JWexbmA9zGyqTCQSJydl_CqbjlAs2Rj86okm8zcVY8X4D15Z5ion1fLjIRdpufM15aQKZdO5njq0vDzyG0NjeLI9cybXhU9PmkCqGAumMXc8JCnGQhFHzJaj_1RqISlNLs4beAJn7F6f6XTYUJyXvs0M\/s400-rw-e365\/exposure-management-course-xm-native.gif)Don't Miss Out! Our FREE Exposure Management Course is a Game-ChangerMaster Exposure Management, from the fundamentals to advanced tips and strategies. Here\u2019s what industry leaders are saying about our course.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/exposure-management-course-xm-native-2)\nExpert Insights [Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/) [Videos](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/videos\/)\n[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html) AI, the Access-Trust Gap and The Droids We're Looking For _\ue802_ May 5, 2025 Read \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/05\/ai-access-trust-gap-droids-were-looking.html)[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html) Dissecting the 2025 Microsoft Vulnerabilities Report: Key Trends and Insights _\ue802_ May 5, 2025 Read \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/05\/dissecting-2025-microsoft.html)[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html) It's Time To Rethink Your Security for the AI Era _\ue802_ April 28, 2025 Read \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/04\/its-time-to-rethink-your-security-for.html)[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html) How AI and IoT are Supercharging the DDoS Threat _\ue802_ April 21, 2025 Watch \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/04\/how-ai-and-iot-are-supercharging-ddos.html)\n",,
