"summary": "The OttoKit WordPress plugin, formerly known as SureTriggers, is under attack due to a critical privilege escalation vulnerability, tracked as CVE-2025-27007, with a CVSS score of 9.8. It impacts all plugin versions up to 1.0.82. The main issue arises from insufficient verification of user authentication credentials, allowing unauthenticated attackers to gain privilege escalation. The exploitation is active under specific circumstances and aligns with another vulnerability, CVE-2025-3102, within the same plugin. This attack involves creating an administrative user account on vulnerable sites, emphasizing the need for users to update to version 1.0.83 immediately.",,
