"title": "Trump picks private sector veteran for Pentagon CIO",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/trump-picks-private-sector-veteran-for-dod-cio-position",,
"summary": "President Donald Trump nominated Kirsten Davies, an experienced private sector cybersecurity executive, for the role of Chief Information Officer at the Pentagon. Although the article is not primarily focused on cybersecurity incidents, it highlights a personnel change in the defense sector with potential implications for digital and software capabilities within the Department of Defense. There is no mention of specific cybersecurity threats, threat groups, vulnerabilities, or impacted products.",,
