"title": "Exclusive: Top FBI cyber official Bryan Vorndran expected to leave the bureau",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/bryan-vorndran-leaving-fbi",,
"summary": "The article discusses the expected departure of Bryan Vorndran, Assistant Director of the FBI\u2019s Cyber Division, due to retirement eligibility. Vorndran has been instrumental in evolving the FBI's approach to combat cybercrime, moving beyond traditional prosecution to adopting tactics like dismantling adversary infrastructures and conducting joint operations globally. Key operations under his tenure included responses to ransomware and collaborations with federal partners to issue joint cyber threat advisories. No specific vulnerabilities, malware, threat groups, or impacted products and services are directly detailed in relation to his departure.",,
