"markdown": "[_\ue80a_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\nContact\/Tip Us\n[ _\uf0e0_ Reach out to get featured\u2014contact us to send your exclusive story idea, research, hacks, or ask us a question or leave a comment\/feedback! ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/p\/submit-news.html)\nFollow Us On Social Media\n[_\uf167_](https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/c\/thehackernews?sub_confirmation=1)\n[_\uf09e_ RSS Feeds](https:\/\/feeds.feedburner.com\/TheHackersNews) [_\uf0f3_ Email Alerts](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/deploying-ai-agents-learn-to-secure.html#email-outer) [_\uf2c6_ Telegram Channel](https:\/\/t.me\/+wKrQxniFO1Q1OTRk)\n[![Zenith Live 2025](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEiKLqdTf2BnL4fIex_Fj-HhjsQU6HOZ_ao_WyUZ0ELrxsZ4ezufQqD8JfJabnIMeCtgdwKU-y948oMzHGFOP_Ox3vMW1Ymki-zmY4bSHWFP-m4zwD42-Huw3q9eM8VAY9_mL9yzihdsF1YygoUH-dDrY8EzKJb4dslf03xMaGFlYgAy0bA6p7gZ5vr5GHHb\/s728-e300\/team-d.jpg)](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/team-d)\n# [Deploying AI Agents? Learn to Secure Them Before Hackers Strike Your Business](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/deploying-ai-agents-learn-to-secure.html)\n_\ue802_ May 09, 2025 _\ue804_ The Hacker NewsArtificial Intelligence \/ Software Security\n[![Building AI Agents Securely](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEhaAr-ODkENMRRiiBwfV9GtFxa1emsJie3APXXWwZu7nqbI9jYzWzVhXRLMCURFahNNfJvV4JsmmSziHk_EBvQ0SuJsxiRz9FTTC7iDW0Ma0KvHl8teYTKpWvaqQtu9ax3b-1mBkc5JH2udGTTcTudGNbKIn7ks38g7yIJXB-WjFaIAYCQfJ71au2giGVR8\/s728-rw-e365\/webinar.jpg)](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-security?source=article)\nAI agents are changing the way businesses work. They can answer questions, automate tasks, and create better user experiences. But with this power comes new risks \u2014 like data leaks, identity theft, and malicious misuse.\nIf your company is exploring or already using AI agents, you need to ask: **Are they secure?**\nAI agents work with sensitive data and make real-time decisions. If they're not protected, attackers can exploit them to steal information, spread misinformation, or take control of systems.\nJoin Michelle Agroskin, Product Marketing Manager at **Auth0** , for a free, expert-led webinar \u2014 [Building AI Agents Securely](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-security?source=article) \u2014 that breaks down the most important AI security issues and what you can do about them.\n### **What You'll Learn:**[#](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/deploying-ai-agents-learn-to-secure.html#what-you-ll-learn-)\n  * **What AI Agents Are:** Understand how AI agents work and why they're different from chatbots or traditional apps.\n  * **What Can Go Wrong:** Learn about real risks \u2014 like adversarial attacks, data leakage, and identity misuse.\n  * **How to Secure Them:** Discover proven methods and tools to protect your AI agents and earn user trust.\n\n[Watch this Webinar](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/untracked-ai-tools?source=article)\nThis is not a sales pitch. It's a practical, no-fluff session with real strategies you can use today. Whether you're already building with AI or just getting started, this webinar will help you stay ahead of threats.\n[![Building AI Agents Securely](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/deploying-ai-agents-learn-to-secure.html)](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-security?source=article)\n[Secure your free registration](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-security?source=article) \u279c\nFound this article interesting? This article is a contributed piece from one of our valued partners. Follow us on and to read more exclusive content we post.\nSHARE [_\uf1e0_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\n_\uf1e0_ Share\n[_\ue80a_](javascript:void\\(0\\)) [_\uf1d4_ Share on Hacker News](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F05%2Fdeploying-ai-agents-learn-to-secure.html&t=Deploying%20AI%20Agents%3F%20Learn%20to%20Secure%20Them%20Before%20Hackers%20Strike%20Your%20Business) _\uf0e0_ Share