"title": "4 Questions To Ask Before Investing In EDR",,
"url": "https:\/\/www.security.com\/product-insights\/4-questions-ask-investing-edr",,
"summary": "The article highlights the importance of selecting the right Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR) solution to safeguard against evolving cybersecurity threats such as ransomware and other malware. It provides four key questions to consider when evaluating an EDR solution: visibility across endpoints, integration with existing security stacks, comprehensive protection capabilities, and ease of deployment and management. Notably, the use of AI and machine learning by ransomware groups, including Ransomware-as-a-Service operators like Medusa, is emphasized as a growing concern. The article also discusses how companies like Carbon Black, part of Broadcom\u2019s Enterprise Security Group, offer robust EDR solutions with proven track records.",,
