ess for Attackers ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/fake-security-plugin-on-wordpress.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) Wormable AirPlay Flaws Enable Zero-Click RCE on Apple Devices via Public Wi-Fi ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/wormable-airplay-flaws-enable-zero.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) TikTok Slammed With \u20ac530 Million GDPR Fine for Sending E.U. Data to China ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/tiktok-slammed-with-530-million-gdpr.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) Why top SOC teams are shifting to Network Detection and Response ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/why-top-soc-teams-are-shifting-to.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) Malicious Go Modules Deliver Disk-Wiping Linux Malware in Advanced Supply Chain Attack ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/malicious-go-modules-deliver-disk.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) Linux io_uring PoC Rootkit Bypasses System Call-Based Threat Detection Tools ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/04\/linux-iouring-poc-rootkit-bypasses.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) Microsoft Sets Passkeys Default for New Accounts; 15 Billion Users Gain Passwordless Support ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/microsoft-sets-passkeys-default-for-new.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) \u26a1 Weekly Recap: Nation-State Hacks, Spyware Alerts, Deepfake Malware, Supply Chain Backdoors ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-nation-state-hacks-spyware.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) How to Automate CVE and Vulnerability Advisory Response with Tines ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/how-to-automate-cve-and-vulnerability.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) Update ASAP: Google Fixes Android Flaw (CVE-2025-27363) Exploited by Attackers ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/google-fixes-actively-exploited-android.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) Apple Patches Two Actively Exploited iOS Flaws Used in Sophisticated Targeted Attacks ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/04\/apple-patches-two-actively-exploited.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) SuperCard X Android Malware Enables Contactless ATM and PoS Fraud via NFC Relay Attacks ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/04\/supercard-x-android-malware-enables.html)\nPopular Resources\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) This Visual Map Is Changing How Security Teams See Non-Human Identity Risk \u2014 Get a Demo ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/gitguardian-demo)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) 2025 Microsoft Vulnerabilities Report\u2014Download Before the Next Patch Cycle ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/microsoft-vuln-report)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) Get a Demo \u2014 Why CISOs Call Wing a 'Game-Changer' for SaaS Threat Detection ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/wing-security-demo)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) From AI Data Leaks to Phishing Funnels\u2014This Report Exposes the Real Browser Risks ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/browser