ce risks, and protect data.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/appomni-saas-guide-light)[![Cybersecurity with Georgetown](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html)Earn a Master's in Cybersecurity Risk ManagementLead the future of cybersecurity risk management with an online Master's from Georgetown.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/master-cyber-risk-1)\nExpert Insights [Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/) [Videos](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/videos\/)\n[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) AI, the Access-Trust Gap and The Droids We're Looking For _\ue802_ May 5, 2025 Read \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/05\/ai-access-trust-gap-droids-were-looking.html)[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) Dissecting the 2025 Microsoft Vulnerabilities Report: Key Trends and Insights _\ue802_ May 5, 2025 Read \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/05\/dissecting-2025-microsoft.html)[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) It's Time To Rethink Your Security for the AI Era _\ue802_ April 28, 2025 Read \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/04\/its-time-to-rethink-your-security-for.html)[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ottercookie-v4-adds-vm-detection-and.html) How AI and IoT are Supercharging the DDoS Threat _\ue802_ April 21, 2025 Watch \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/04\/how-ai-and-iot-are-supercharging-ddos.html)\n",,
