"summary": "Chinese hackers have been linked to attacks targeting SAP NetWeaver servers by exploiting a maximum severity vulnerability CVE-2025-31324. This vulnerability allows unauthenticated attackers to upload malicious files, leading to potential system compromise. The attacks have been associated with a group tracked as Chaya_004, indicating possible state-sponsored espionage motives. ReliaQuest and other cybersecurity firms confirmed the breach of multiple systems, including Fortune 500 companies. SAP has released an emergency patch to address this issue.",,
