"title": "Microsoft Teams will soon block screen capture during meetings",,
"url": "https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/",,
"summary": "Microsoft is adding a feature to Microsoft Teams to block screen captures during meetings to protect sensitive information. The feature will be available on Android, desktop, iOS, and web platforms starting July 2025. While screen captures will be blocked, taking physical photos of the conversation will remain possible. The article notes similarities with WhatsApp's 'Advanced Chat Privacy' feature. There are no direct mentions of vulnerabilities, malware, specific threat groups, or victims impacted.",,
