"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/aispm-for-dummies.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/ai-security-posture-management-ai-spm-for-dummies?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY26Q1_INB_FORM_AI-SPM-for-Dummies-eBook&sfcid=701Py00000KWgAHIA1&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AI-SPMDummies)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Microsoft](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/)\n  * Microsoft Teams will soon block screen capture during meetings\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/)\n\n\n# Microsoft Teams will soon block screen capture during meetings\nBy \n###### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n  * May 10, 2025\n  * 11:22 AM\n  * [1](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/#comments)\n\n\n![Teams](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2024\/08\/20\/Microsoft-Teams.jpg)\nMicrosoft is working on adding a new Teams feature that will prevent users from capturing screenshots of sensitive information shared during meetings.\nThose joining from unsupported platforms will be automatically placed in audio-only mode to protect shared content. The company plans to start rolling out this new Teams feature to Android, desktop, iOS, and web users worldwide in July 2025.\n\"To address the issue of unauthorized screen captures during meetings, the Prevent Screen Capture feature ensures that if a user attempts to take a screen capture, the meeting window will turn black, thereby protecting sensitive information,\" [Microsoft shared](https:\/\/www.microsoft.com\/ro-ro\/microsoft-365\/roadmap?id=490051) in a new Microsoft 365 roadmap entry.\n\"This feature will be available on Teams desktop applications (both Windows and Mac) and Teams mobile applications (both iOS and Android).\"\nHowever, it should be noted that, even if screenshots are blocked, sensitive media and information shared in Teams meetings can still be captured by taking a photo of the conversation.\nLast month, Meta introduced a similar WhatsApp feature named \"[Advanced Chat Privacy](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/whatsapps-new-advanced-chat-privacy-protects-sensitive-messages\/),\" which protects sensitive information exchanged in private chats and group conversations by blocking attempts to save shared media and export chat content.\nRedmond will also roll out a [town hall screen privilege management update](https:\/\/www.microsoft.com\/ro-ro\/microsoft-365\/roadmap?id=490050) in Teams Rooms on Windows, [interactive BizChat\/Copilot Studio agents](https:\/\/www.microsoft.com\/ro-ro\/microsoft-365\/roadmap?id=490564) in meetings and 1-on-1 calls, and a Copilot feature to help [generate audio overviews](https:\/\/www.microsoft.com\/ro-ro\/microsoft-365\/roadmap?id=488807) of transcribed meetings in June.\nAnother Copilot feature to help [generate audio overviews](https:\/\/www.microsoft.com\/ro-ro\/microsoft-365\/roadmap?id=488807) of transcribed meetings is also under development and will let users choose the speakers, adjust the tone, and tailor the length.\nIn January, the company [reminded Microsoft 365 admins](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/microsoft-teams-phishing-attack-alerts-coming-to-everyone-next-month\/) that its new Teams Chat brand impersonation protection feature, which alerts users when detecting phishing attacks targeting organizations with external Teams access toggled on, will be made generally available for all customers by mid-February 2025.\nAt last year's Enterprise Connect enterprise communications and collaboration conference, Microsoft [announced](https:\/\/techcommunity.microsoft.com\/blog\/microsoftteamsblog\/microsoft-teams-building-a-foundation-for-the-future\/4090393) that the Teams platform had reached over 320 million monthly active users across 181 markets and 44 languages.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[New Microsoft 365 outage impacts Teams and other services](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/new-microsoft-365-outage-impacts-teams-and-other-services\/)\n[Windows 11's Recall AI is now rolling out on Copilot+ PCs](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11s-recall-ai-is-now-rolling-out-on-copilot-plus-pcs\/)\n[Microsoft: Licensing issue blocks Microsoft 365 Family for some users](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-licensing-issue-blocks-microsoft-365-family-for-some-users\/)\n[Microsoft: New Windows scheduled task will launch Office apps faster](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-new-windows-scheduled-ta***REMOVED***\/)\n[Microsoft: Exchange Online bug mistakenly quarantines user emails](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-exchange-online-bug-mistakenly-quarantines-user-emails\/)\n  * [Microsoft](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/microsoft\/)\n  * [Microsoft 365](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/microsoft-365\/)\n  * [Microsoft Teams](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/microsoft-teams\/)\n  * [Privacy](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/privacy\/)\n  * [Screenshot](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/screenshot\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n##### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\nSergiu is a news reporter who has covered the latest cybersecurity and technology developments for over a decade. Email or Twitter DMs for tips. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/fake-ai-video-generators-drop-new-noodlophile-infostealer-malware\/)\n\n\n### Comments\n  * ![Toqom Photo](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/public\/style_images\/mobile\/profile\/default_large.png)\n######  [Toqom](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/u\/1304973\/toqom\/) - 23 minutes ago\n    * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/ \"Report\")\n    * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/#cid36158 \"Link\")\nUnfortunately, if someone wants to screen capture, they can, all they have to do is run the copy of windows using teams in a virtual PC. You can screen grab with the exterior OS. Game cheaters use the same trick having the exterior OS have the cheats installed watching the window of the game on a virtual PC that can't see the software used to cheat.\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Sharp Rhino story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/sharp-rhino.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/sharprhino-an-old-new-threat\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trur-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![LockBit](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/) LockBit ransomware gang hacked, victim negotiations exposed ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/lockbit-ransomware-gang-hacked-victim-negotiations-exposed\/)\n  * [ ![Pearson](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/) Education giant Pearson hit by cyberattack exposing customer data ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/education-giant-pearson-hit-by-cyberattack-exposing-customer-data\/)\n  * [ ![Windows Server](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/) Microsoft: April updates cause Windows Server auth issues ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-april-updates-cause-windows-server-auth-issues\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Rethinking Automated Penetration Testing: Why Validation Changes Everything](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/) Rethinking Automated Penetration Testing: Why Validation Changes Everything ](https:\/\/www.picussecurity.com\/resource\/blog\/rethinking-automated-penetration-testing?utm_campaign=7149959-Red%20Report%202025&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_content=blog)\n  * [ ![Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/) Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024 ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/resources\/2024-identity-attacks?utm_campaign=12100141-FY25Q2_Bleeping-Computer-Article&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_content=external-article)\n  * [ ![View your organization's attack surface & digital frauds - at no cost. Register now for CTM360's Community Edition](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/) View your organization's attack surface & digital frauds - at no cost. Register now for CTM360's Community Edition ](https:\/\/www.ctm360.com\/free-access?utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_medium=sidebar&utm_campaign=ctm360_bleepingcomputer)\n  * [ ![Cybersecurity Lock World](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/) How to tell if your organization\u2019s credentials have been involved in a breach? ](https:\/\/outpost24.com\/blog\/find-credentials-involved-breach\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=referral_content)\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_