r.com.sg\/alt\/category\/giveaways\/)\n    * [Giveaways](http:\/\/www.weekender.com.sg\/category\/giveaways\/)\n  * [ABOUT](http:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/about-weekender\/)\n    * [About Us](http:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/about-weekender\/)\n    * [Privacy Policy](http:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/weekender-personal-data-protection-policy\/)\n  * [CONTACT](http:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/contact-info\/)\n\n\n\u00a9 2020 All-Rights Reserved Weekender Group Pte Ltd \n[ ![](data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20728%2090'%3E%3C\/svg%3E)](http:\/\/goo.gl\/KOQXTE)\n[About Weekender](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/about-weekender\/) | [Careers](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/careers\/) | [Distribution Points](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/distribution\/) | [Terms & Conditions](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/terms-of-use\/) | [Contact Us](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/contact-info\/)\nShares\nREAD NEXT\n[ ![](data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20280%20210'%3E%3C\/svg%3E) ](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/dining\/mothers-day-cake\/)\n######  [Mother\u2019s Day Cakes In Singapore That Deserve A Standing Ovation](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/dining\/mothers-day-cake\/)\n## Lights, Goals, Action! Football fans, your ultimate match night will get a dazzling upgrade.\nStarHub\u2019s \u201cFootball for All\u201d Carnival is returning on Sunday, 25 May 2025, promising a thrilling grand finale to the Premier League season \u2014 and this time, it\u2019s going big at Resorts World Sentosa.\n### 10 Matches. 2 Legends. 1 Epic Night.\nGet ready as all 10 final Premier League matches kick off simultaneously at 11pm, streamed live on big screens under one electrifying roof. From title-chasing drama to last-gasp relegation battles, every goal, twist, and cheer will unfold in real-time at the Resorts World Convention Centre.\n### A Carnival for the Beautiful Game\nCome early \u2014 the celebrations start at 7pm with a football-themed carnival packed with family-friendly fun, games, and giveaways. Whether you\u2019re a seasoned supporter or new to the sport, there\u2019s something for everyone.\n### Legends on the Lineup\nRubbing shoulders with the stars? You just might. Premier League icons Joe Hart and John Barnes will be making guest appearances to meet fans, sign autographs, and share stories from the pitch.\n### Exclusive Goodies & Giveaways\nArrive early and you might snag a limited-edition goodie bag \u2014 available on a first-come, first-served basis. Plus, look out for live contests and surprise prizes throughout the night.\nStarHub even takes care of your ride home. Complimentary shuttles will ferry fans from Sentosa to HarbourFront MRT between 11:30pm and 2:30am.\nCelebrating 25 years of connecting fans, StarHub invites all its subscribers to bring up to four guests at no charge. Register for your spot [here](http:\/\/starhub.com\/football-for-all-carnival).\nWhether you\u2019re red, blue, or neutral, this is more than just football. It\u2019s community, culture, and celebration. Don\u2019t miss this spectacular send-off to an unforgettable Premier League season.\nADVERTISEMENTS \nTags: [resorts world sentosa](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/tag\/resorts-world-sentosa\/ \"resorts world sentosa\") [showcase](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/tag\/showcase\/ \"showcase\") [starhub](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/tag\/starhub\/ \"starhub\") [StarHub\u2019s \u201cFootball for All\u201d Carnival](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/tag\/starhubs-football-for-all-carnival\/ \"StarHub\u2019s \u201cFootball for All\u201d Carnival\") [wahttodo](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/tag\/wahttodo\/ \"wahttodo\") [wahttowatch](https:\/\/weekender.com.sg\/tag\/wahttowatch\/ \"wahttowatch\")\nShares\nShare on Email\nBen Lee May 7, 2025\n[](http:\/\/bit.ly\/2k2ioa1) [](http:\/\/www.weibo.com\/u\/5731073249) [](http:\/\/eepurl.com\/c0vulr)\nSponsored:\n[ ![](data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg'