"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/aispm-for-dummies.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/ai-security-posture-management-ai-spm-for-dummies?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY26Q1_INB_FORM_AI-SPM-for-Dummies-eBook&sfcid=701Py00000KWgAHIA1&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AI-SPMDummies)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * ChatGPT is finally adding Download as PDF for Deep Research\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/)\n\n\n# ChatGPT is finally adding Download as PDF for Deep Research\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * May 11, 2025\n  * 11:17 AM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2023\/11\/08\/ChatGPT.jpg)\nChatGPT's Deep Research, which allows you to conduct multi-step research for complex tasks, is finally getting an option to save the report as a PDF.\nWith ChatGPT's Deep Research, you can allow the AI agent to do the work for you independently.\nChatGPT takes your prompt, scans the internet, and reads hundreds of websites to create a comprehensive report.\nOnce a report has been generated, you have the option to copy it, but the issue with the 'copy' button is that it doesn't retain the formatting.\nIn our tests, BleepingComputer found that copying ChatGPT's deep research report into a Word document distorts the formatting.\nThis could be fixed with a new \"Download as PDF.\"\nAs spotted by on X, ChatGPT's Download as PDF option is finally being tested on the web app.\nIt's unclear when it will begin rolling out to everyone, and we also don't know if the option will appear for regular queries.\nAn option to export the report as a PDF would help keep the original layout, and it might appear next to the copy button after a Deep Research report has been generated.\nIn addition, OpenAI is rolling out a new GitHub connector for ChatGPT deep research for those with the Teams subscription.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[OpenAI document explains when to use each ChatGPT model](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/)\n[OpenAI tests watermarking for ChatGPT-4o Image Generation model](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-tests-watermarking-for-chatgpt-4o-image-generation-model\/)\n[Google Gemini AI is getting ChatGPT-like Scheduled Actions feature](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-gemini-ai-is-getting-chatgpt-like-scheduled-actions-feature\/)\n[ChatGPT 4.1 early benchmarks compared against Google Gemini](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-41-early-benchmarks-compared-against-google-gemini\/)\n[OpenAI's GPT-4.1, 4.1 nano, and 4.1 mini models release imminent](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-gpt-41-41-nano-and-41-mini-models-release-imminent\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [Chat-GPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chat-gpt\/)\n  * [ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chatgpt\/)\n  * [OpenAI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/openai\/)\n  * [PDF](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/pdf\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/iclicker-hack-targeted-students-with-malware-via-fake-captcha\/)\n  * [Next Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/bluetooth-61-enhances-privacy-with-randomized-rpa-timing\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Astaroth Unleashed story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/Astaroth-unleashed.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/astaroth-unleashed\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trua-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Microsoft Teams](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/) Microsoft Teams will soon block screen capture during meetings ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/)\n  * [ ![Pearson](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/) Education giant Pearson hit by cyberattack exposing customer data ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/education-giant-pearson-hit-by-cyberattack-exposing-customer-data\/)\n  * [ ![NPM supply chain](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/) Supply chain attack hits npm package with 45,000 weekly downloads ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/supply-chain-attack-hits-npm-package-with-45-000-weekly-downloads\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![View your organization's attack surface & digital frauds - at no cost. Register now for CTM360's Community Edition](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/) View your organization's attack surface & digital frauds - at no cost. Register now for CTM360's Community Edition ](https:\/\/www.ctm360.com\/free-access?utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_medium=sidebar&utm_campaign=ctm360_bleepingcomputer)\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/) Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024 ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/resources\/2024-identity-attacks?utm_campaign=12100141-FY25Q2_Bleeping-Computer-Article&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_content=external-article)\n  * [ ![Rethinking Automated Penetration Testing: Why Validation Changes Everything](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/) Rethinking Automated Penetration Testing: Why Validation Changes Everything ](https:\/\/www.picussecurity.com\/resource\/blog\/rethinking-automated-penetration-testing?utm_campaign=7149959-Red%20Report%202025&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_content=blog)\n  * [ ![Cybersecurity Lock World](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/) How to tell if your organization\u2019s credentials have been involved in a breach? ](https:\/\/outpost24.com\/blog\/find-credentials-involved-breach\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=referral_content)\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.749729020140837)\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_