"title": "Moldova arrests suspect in ransomware attacks targeting Dutch firms",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/moldova-arrest-suspect-ransomware-attacks-netherlands",,
"summary": "Moldovan authorities arrested a 45-year-old man suspected of involvement in ransomware attacks on Dutch companies in 2021. The suspect, wanted internationally for cyber offenses such as blackmail and money laundering, was found with cash, electronics, and data storage devices. He is allegedly linked to an attack on the Netherlands Organization for Scientific Research (NWO) causing damages of 4.5 million euros. Extradition to the Netherlands is underway. This arrest is part of a European-wide crackdown on cybercrime.",,
