"https:\/\/www.cve.org\/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-2775",,
"https:\/\/www.cve.org\/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-2776",,
"https:\/\/www.cve.org\/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-2777",,
