"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/aispm-for-dummies.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/ai-security-posture-management-ai-spm-for-dummies?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY26Q1_INB_FORM_AI-SPM-for-Dummies-eBook&sfcid=701Py00000KWgAHIA1&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AI-SPMDummies)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Microsoft](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/)\n  * Windows 11 upgrade block lifted after Safe Exam Browser fix\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-upgrade-block-lifted-after-safe-exam-browser-fix\/)\n\n\n# Windows 11 upgrade block lifted after Safe Exam Browser fix\nBy \n###### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n  * May 12, 2025\n  * 04:42 PM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-upgrade-block-lifted-after-safe-exam-browser-fix\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2025\/02\/07\/Windows_11.jpg)\nMicrosoft has removed an upgrade block that prevented some Safe Exam Browser users from installing the Windows 11 2024 Update due to incompatibility issues.\nSafe Exam Browser is an open-source software used by schools, professional certification bodies, and enterprises to transform computers into secure workstations during online exams, preventing cheating by restricting access to unauthorized resources, apps, and websites.\nThe compatibility hold was added in September to prevent issues affecting Windows 11, version 24H2 users when opening Safe Exam Browser version 3.7 or lower.\nMicrosoft says the developers have solved this known issue and advises customers to install the latest Safe Exam Browser version (3.8 or later). Affected users should update the Safe Exam Browser app before upgrading their systems to Windows 11 24H2.\n\"If your device still encounters this safeguard hold 48 hours after updating to the latest version of the application, you will need to contact Safe Exam Browser Support for more information on the resolution,\" Microsoft [said](https:\/\/learn.microsoft.com\/en-us\/windows\/release-health\/status-windows-11-24h2#safe-exam-browser-application-might-fail-to-open) in a Windows release health update.\n\"If you are trying to install Windows 11, version 24H2 through the media creation tool, you will be able to proceed with the installation after you follow the instructions in the UI that pops up during the installation.\"\n## Windows 11 24H2 rolling out to everyone, still blocked on some PCs\nLast week, \u200bMicrosoft announced that the Windows 11 24H2 feature update is [ready to roll out to all compatible PCs](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-windows-11-24h2-now-ready-to-rollout-to-everyone\/), excluding those with safeguard holds, and fixed a known issue [blocking it](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-pushes-fix-for-windows-11-update-0x80240069-errors\/) from being delivered via Windows Server Update Services (WSUS) after installing the April 2025 security updates.\nThe company also mitigated a \"latent code issue\" [causing some PCs to be upgraded to Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-some-devices-offered-windows-11-upgrades-despite-intune-blocks\/) despite Intune policies that should've blocked Windows 11 upgrades.\nIn recent months, Microsoft has lifted other compatibility holds, blocking Windows 11 24H2 upgrades [on ASUS devices](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-rolls-out-bios-update-that-fixes-asus-blue-screen-issues\/) with very specific hardware components\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b and for [some AutoCAD users](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-24h2-upgrades-now-blocked-for-some-autocad-users\/) and [Asphalt 8: Airborne players](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-lifts-windows-11-upgrade-block-after-asphalt-8-crash-fix\/).\nOther [upgrade blocks](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/safeguard-hold\/) prompted by incompatible hardware and software that still stand have also been applied to computers with [integrated cameras](https:\/\/learn.microsoft.com\/en-us\/windows\/release-health\/status-windows-11-24h2#3412msgdesc), [Dirac audio improvement software](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-24h2-upgrades-blocked-on-some-pcs-due-to-audio-issues\/), or the [Easy Anti-Cheat](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-warns-of-windows-11-24h2-gaming-performance-issues\/) application.\nWindows 11 24H2 [started rolling out in May 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-releases-windows-11-23h2-as-an-enablement-package\/) for enterprise testing to enterprise customers enrolled in the Windows Insider Release Preview Channel and was released to eligible devices running Windows 11 22H2\/23H2 [in October](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-24h2-now-rolling-out-here-are-the-new-features\/).\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[Microsoft lifts Windows 11 upgrade block after Asphalt 8 crash fix](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-lifts-windows-11-upgrade-block-after-asphalt-8-crash-fix\/)\n[Microsoft lifts Windows 11 update block for some AutoCAD users](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-lifts-windows-11-update-block-for-some-autocad-users\/)\n[Windows 11 24H2 blocked on PCs with code-obfuscation driver BSODs](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/windows-11-24h2-blocked-on-pcs-with-code-obfuscation-driver-bsods\/)\n[Microsoft fixes Remote Desktop issues caused by Windows updates](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-fixes-remote-desktop-issues-caused-by-windows-updates\/)\n[Windows 11 update breaks Veeam recovery, causes connection errors](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-update-breaks-veeam-recovery-causes-connection-errors\/)\n  * [Compatibility Hold](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/compatibility-hold\/)\n  * [Known Issue](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/known-issue\/)\n  * [Safe Exam Browser](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/safe-exam-browser\/)\n  * [Safeguard Hold](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/safeguard-hold\/)\n  * [Windows](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/windows\/)\n  * [Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/windows-11\/)\n  * [Windows 11 24H2](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/windows-11-24h2\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-upgrade-block-lifted-after-safe-exam-browser-fix\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n##### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\nSergiu is a news reporter who has covered the latest cybersecurity and technology developments for over a decade. Email or Twitter DMs for tips. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/hackers-now-testing-clickfix-attacks-against-linux-targets\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Astaroth Unleashed story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/Astaroth-unleashed.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/astaroth-unleashed\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trua-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Microsoft Teams](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-upgrade-block-lifted-after-safe-exam-browser-fix\/) Microsoft Teams will soon block screen capture during meetings ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-teams-will-soon-block-screen-capture-during-meetings\/)\n  * [ ![Hospital](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-upgrade-block-lifted-after-safe-exam-browser-fix\/) Ascension says recent data breach affects over 430,000 patients ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/ascension-says-recent-data-breach-affects-over-430-000-patients\/)\n  * [ ![AI Hacker Robot Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-upgrade-block-lifted-after-safe-exam-browser-fix\/) Fake AI video generators drop new Noodlophile infostealer malware ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/fake-ai-video-generators-drop-new-noodlophile-infostealer-malware\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Cybersecurity Lock World](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-upgrade-block-lifted-after-safe-exam-browser-fix\/) How to tell if your organization\u2019s credentials have been involved in a breach? ](https:\/\/outpost24.com\/blog\/find-credentials-involved-breach\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=referral_content)\n  * [ ![View your organization's attack surface & digital frauds - at no cost. Register now for CTM360's Community Edition](https:\/\/www.bl