"title": "North Korean hackers target Ukrainian government in new espionage campaign",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/north-korea-hackers-target-ukraine-to-understand-russian-war-efforts",,
"summary": "North Korean state-backed hackers, tracked as TA406, have targeted Ukrainian government entities in a new espionage campaign. This campaign is aimed at gathering intelligence on Russia\u2019s war efforts and understanding Ukraine's stance and the ongoing conflict's medium-term outlook. The hackers employ spear-phishing attacks, impersonate think tank members, and use tools like PowerShell to carry out data collection. They have previously used fake Microsoft alerts to harvest credentials. The campaign targets political intelligence rather than tactical battlefield information.",,
