"title": "Marks & Spencer confirms customer data stolen in cyberattack",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/marks-spencer-confirms-customer-data-breach",,
"summary": "British retailer Marks & Spencer has confirmed a data breach following a cyberattack. Customers' personal data, including names, addresses, and phone numbers, were compromised, although no payment details or passwords were affected. The DragonForce ransomware group has claimed responsibility, but this claim has not been independently verified. The attack has led to operational disruptions including unavailable online shopping, while physical stores face product shortages. The UK National Cyber Security Centre is investigating the situation.",,
