your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Cybersecurity Lock World](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-will-update-office-apps-on-windows-10-until-2028\/) How to tell if your organization\u2019s credentials have been involved in a breach? ](https:\/\/outpost24.com\/blog\/find-credentials-involved-breach\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=referral_content)\n  * [ ![Identity Cybersecurity Framework passwords authentication](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-will-update-office-apps-on-windows-10-until-2028\/) Majority of browser extensions pose critical security risk - learn how to control it ](https:\/\/go.layerxsecurity.com\/enterprise-browser-extension-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=browser_extension_08052025)\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-will-update-office-apps-on-windows-10-until-2028\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n  * [ ![Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-will-update-office-apps-on-windows-10-until-2028\/) Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024 ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/resources\/2024-identity-attacks?utm_campaign=12100141-FY25Q2_Bleeping-Computer-Article&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_content=external-article)\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/image