"title": "EU launches vulnerability database to tackle cybersecurity threats",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/eu-launches-vulnerability-database",,
"summary": "The European Union has launched a new vulnerability database aimed at providing aggregated cybersecurity information affecting various products and services. Although called a database, it serves more as a notification platform akin to MITRE's Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVE) Program. There are ongoing concerns regarding the funding of the CVE Program, but currently, MITRE will continue its operation. The EU's move signifies a step towards enhancing digital security within EU boundaries by monitoring vulnerabilities without holding exploit data.",,
