pdate ASAP: Google Fixes Android Flaw (CVE-2025-27363) Exploited by Attackers ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/google-fixes-actively-exploited-android.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ivanti-patches-epmm-vulnerabilities.html) Why top SOC teams are shifting to Network Detection and Response ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/why-top-soc-teams-are-shifting-to.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ivanti-patches-epmm-vulnerabilities.html) TikTok Slammed With \u20ac530 Million GDPR Fine for Sending E.U. Data to China ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/tiktok-slammed-with-530-million-gdpr.html)\n[ ![NSO Group Fined $168M for Targeting 1,400 WhatsApp Users With Pegasus Spyware](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ivanti-patches-epmm-vulnerabilities.html) NSO Group Fined $168M for Targeting 1,400 WhatsApp Users With Pegasus Spyware ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/nso-group-fined-168m-for-targeting-1400.html)\nMore Stories \u25bc\nPopular Resources\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ivanti-patches-epmm-vulnerabilities.html) Every Second Counts: Learn How Corelight Detects and Disrupts Threats Before They Escalate ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/corelight-ndr-platform)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ivanti-patches-epmm-vulnerabilities.html) Drowning in AppSec Alerts? This Report Shows How to Fix the Alert Overload ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/app-security-benchmark)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ivanti-patches-epmm-vulnerabilities.html) Struggling With AI Data Leaks? This Guide Shows Security Teams What to Fix First. ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/saas-ai-best-practices)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/ivanti-patches-epmm-vulnerabilities.html) Take Control of Account Takeovers \u2014 Flare Lets You See and Stop Them Instantly ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/session-takeover-prevention)\n## Cybersecu