"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/aispm-for-dummies.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/ai-security-posture-management-ai-spm-for-dummies?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY26Q1_INB_FORM_AI-SPM-for-Dummies-eBook&sfcid=701Py00000KWgAHIA1&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AI-SPMDummies)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Security](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/)\n  * Steel giant Nucor Corporation facing disruptions after cyberattack\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/)\n\n\n# Steel giant Nucor Corporation facing disruptions after cyberattack\nBy \n###### [Bill Toulas](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/bill-toulas\/)\n  * May 14, 2025\n  * 10:39 AM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Steel giant Nucor Corporation facing disruptions after cyberattack](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2025\/05\/14\/racking.jpg)\nA cybersecurity incident on Nucor Corporation's systems, the largest steel producer in the U.S., forced the company to take offline parts of its networks and implement containment measures.\nThe incident caused the company to temporarily suspend production at multiple locations, although the full impact on Nucor\u2019s business remains unclear.\nNucor is a major steel producer in the U.S. and scrap recycler in the North America. It is a primary supplier of reinforcing bar that is used extensively in the country\u2019s buildings, bridges, roads, and infrastructure.\nThe company employs more than 32,000 people across numerous mills across the U.S., Mexico, and Canada, and reported a [$7.83 billion](https:\/\/nucor.com\/news-release\/nucor-reports-results-for-the-first-quarter-of-2025-122971) revenue in the first quarter of the year.\nThe cybersecurity incident was disclosed via an 8-K filing the firm submitted earlier today to the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC).\n\u201cNucor Corporation recently identified a cybersecurity incident involving unauthorized third party access to certain information technology systems used by the Company,\u201d [reads the SEC filing](https:\/\/www.sec.gov\/Archives\/edgar\/data\/73309\/000119312525119311\/d795264d8k.htm).\n\u201cUpon detecting the incident, the Company began promptly taking steps to contain and respond to the incident, including activating its incident response plan, proactively taking potentially affected systems offline and implementing other containment, remediation, or recovery measures.\u201d\nNucor also stated that it has notified law enforcement authorities and engaged with external cybersecurity experts to assist with the investigation.\nMeanwhile, certain production operations at various locations were halted, though Nucor notes it is in the process of gradually restarting them.\nNo details about the date or type of the attack were provided, so it\u2019s unknown if the incident involved data theft or encryption.\nAt the time of writing, no ransomware groups have assumed responsibility for the attack at Nucor, so the perpetrators are unknown.\nBleepingComputer has contacted the company to ask more information about the incident, but we are still waiting for a response.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[Medical device maker Masimo warns of cyberattack, manufacturing delays](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/medical-device-maker-masimo-warns-of-cyberattack-manufacturing-delays\/)\n[Western Sydney University discloses security breaches, data leak](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/western-sydney-university-discloses-security-breaches-data-leak\/)\n[Education giant Pearson hit by cyberattack exposing customer data](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/education-giant-pearson-hit-by-cyberattack-exposing-customer-data\/)\n[VC giant Insight Partners confirms investor data stolen in breach](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/vc-giant-insight-partners-confirms-investor-data-stolen-in-breach\/)\n[UK Legal Aid Agency investigates cybersecurity incident](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/uk-legal-aid-agency-investigates-cybersecurity-incident\/)\n  * [Business Disruption](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/business-disruption\/)\n  * [Cyberattack](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/cyberattack\/)\n  * [Nucor](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/nucor\/)\n  * [Security Breach](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/security-breach\/)\n  * [Steel](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/steel\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/bill-toulas\/)\n##### [Bill Toulas](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/bill-toulas\/)\nBill Toulas is a tech writer and infosec news reporter with over a decade of experience working on various online publications, covering open-source, Linux, malware, data breach incidents, and hacks. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/focused-phishing-attack-targets-victims-with-trusted-sites-and-live-validation\/)\n  * [Next Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-fixes-linux-boot-issues-on-dual-boot-windows-systems\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Sharp Rhino story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/sharp-rhino.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/sharprhino-an-old-new-threat\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trur-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Patch Tuesday](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/) Microsoft May 2025 Patch Tuesday fixes 5 exploited zero-days, 72 flaws ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-may-2025-patch-tuesday-fixes-5-exploited-zero-days-72-flaws\/)\n  * [ ![iClicker](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/) iClicker site hack targeted students with malware via fake CAPTCHA ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/iclicker-hack-targeted-students-with-malware-via-fake-captcha\/)\n  * [ ![Linux](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/) Hackers now testing ClickFix attacks against Linux targets ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/hackers-now-testing-clickfix-attacks-against-linux-targets\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/) Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024 ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/resources\/2024-identity-attacks?utm_campaign=12100141-FY25Q2_Bleeping-Computer-Article&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_content=external-article)\n  * [ ![Identity Cybersecurity Framework passwords authentication](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/) Majority of browser extensions pose critical security risk - learn how to control it ](https:\/\/go.layerxsecurity.com\/enterprise-browser-extension-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=browser_extension_08052025)\n  * [ ![Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers?](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/) Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers? ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/demo\/generative-ai-monitoring?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=validated_phishing_may)\n  * [ ![Cybersecurity Lock World](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/) How to tell if your organization\u2019s credentials have been involved in a breach? ](https:\/\/outpost24.com\/blog\/find-credentials-involved-breach\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=referral_content)\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/steel-giant-nucor-corporation-facing-disruptions-after-cyberattack\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.062218577102550854)\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n",,
