"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/ai-security-risk-ebook.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/getting-started-with-ai-security-ai-risks-how-to-prevent-them-and-ai-for-defender?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY25Q3_INB_FORM_Getting-Started-with-AI-Security-AI-Risks-How-to-Prevent-Them&sfcid=701Py00000DP3ZaIAL&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AISecurityeBook)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Security](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/)\n  * Kosovo extradites BlackDB admin to face US cybercrime charges\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/)\n\n\n# Kosovo extradites BlackDB admin to face US cybercrime charges\nBy \n###### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n  * May 14, 2025\n  * 09:22 AM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Hacker in prison](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2024\/01\/25\/Hacker_prison_black_white.jpg)\nA Kosovo national has been extradited to the United States to face charges of running an online cybercrime marketplace active since 2018.\nKosovar authorities arrested the 33-year-old Liridon Masurica (also known as @blackdb) on December 14th, 2024, and he was extradited to the United States earlier this month, on May 9th.\nMasurica was detained following his court appearance in Tampa on May 12th, where he was brought before United States Magistrate Judge Lindsay Saxe Griffin.\nDuring this hearing, he was charged with five counts of fraudulent use of unauthorized access devices and one count of conspiracy to commit access device fraud.\nAccording to court documents, Masurica was the lead administrator of the online criminal marketplace BlackDB.cc, which has been active for the past seven years, starting in 2018.\nThe Justice Department [said](https:\/\/www.justice.gov\/usao-mdfl\/pr\/administrator-online-criminal-marketplace-extradited-kosovo-united-states) the marketplace illegally offered for sale compromised accounts and server credentials, stolen credit card information, and personally identifiable information (PII) of individuals, most from the United States.\nCybercriminals who purchased these items on the BlackDB marketplace used them in various illegal activities, including credit card fraud, tax fraud, and identity theft.\nThe FBI conducted this investigation in partnership with the Kosovo Police's Cybercrime Investigation Directorate, with support from the FBI's Legal Attach\u00e9 Office in Sofia and the Department of Justice's Office of International Affairs, which assisted in Masurica's arrest and extradition.\nIf convicted on all charges, the BlackDB marketplace admin could face a maximum sentence of 55 years in federal prison.\nIn December, a joint law enforcement operation also [led to the seizure of the Rydox cybercrime marketplace](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/police-shuts-down-rydox-cybercrime-market-arrests-3-admins\/) and the arrest of three Rydox administrators, Kosovo nationals Ardit Kutleshi, Jetmir Kutleshi, and Shpend Sokoli.\nDays earlier, German authorities also arrested key suspects after shutting down [the Manson market](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/police-shuts-down-manson-cybercrime-market-fake-shops-arrests-key-suspects\/) and [Crimenetwork](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/police-seizes-largest-german-online-crime-marketplace-arrests-admin\/), the country's largest online cybercrime marketplace.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[FBI: US lost record $16.6 billion to cybercrime in 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/fbi-us-lost-record-166-billion-to-cybercrime-in-2024\/)\n[CISA warns of hackers targeting critical oil infrastructure](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/cisa-warns-of-hackers-targeting-critical-oil-infrastructure\/)\n[Unofficial Signal app used by Trump officials investigates hack](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/unofficial-signal-app-used-by-trump-officials-investigates-hack\/)\n[FBI seeks help to unmask Salt Typhoon hackers behind telecom breaches](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/fbi-seeks-help-to-unma***REMOVED***\/)\n[MITRE warns that funding for critical CVE program expires today](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/mitre-warns-that-funding-for-critical-cve-program-expires-today\/)\n  * [BlackDB](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/blackdb\/)\n  * [Cybercrime](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/cybercrime\/)\n  * [Kosovo](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/kosovo\/)\n  * [Marketplace](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/marketplace\/)\n  * [USA](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/usa\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n##### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\nSergiu is a news reporter who has covered the latest cybersecurity and technology developments for over a decade. Email or Twitter DMs for tips. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/offer\/deals\/five-years-of-online-privacy-for-just-40-in-this-adguard-vpn-deal\/)\n  * [Next Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/fashion-giant-dior-discloses-cyberattack-warns-of-data-breach\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Sharp Rhino story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/sharp-rhino.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/sharprhino-an-old-new-threat\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trur-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Patch Tuesday](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/) Microsoft May 2025 Patch Tuesday fixes 5 exploited zero-days, 72 flaws ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-may-2025-patch-tuesday-fixes-5-exploited-zero-days-72-flaws\/)\n  * [ ![iClicker](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/) iClicker site hack targeted students with malware via fake CAPTCHA ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/iclicker-hack-targeted-students-with-malware-via-fake-captcha\/)\n  * [ ![Linux](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/) Hackers now testing ClickFix attacks against Linux targets ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/hackers-now-testing-clickfix-attacks-against-linux-targets\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n  * [ ![Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/) Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024 ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/resources\/2024-identity-attacks?utm_campaign=12100141-FY25Q2_Bleeping-Computer-Article&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_content=external-article)\n  * [ ![Identity Cybersecurity Framework passwords authentication](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/) Majority of browser extensions pose critical security risk - learn how to control it ](https:\/\/go.layerxsecurity.com\/enterprise-browser-extension-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=browser_extension_08052025)\n  * [ ![Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers?](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/) Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers? ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/demo\/generative-ai-monitoring?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=validated_phishing_may)\n  * [ ![Cybersecurity Lock World](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/) How to tell if your organization\u2019s credentials have been involved in a breach? ](https:\/\/outpost24.com\/blog\/find-credentials-involved-breach\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=referral_content)\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kosovo-extradites-blackdb-admin-to-face-us-cybercrime-charges\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.8489191712688412)\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n",,
