"markdown": "![hacker digital backgroun](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/large_hacker_digital_73232ff057.jpg)\n[Alexander Martin](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/alexander-martin)May 14th, 2025\n# Google says hackers behind UK retail cyber campaign now also targeting US\nGoogle warned on Wednesday that a hacking group suspected of conducting a series of disruptive cyberattacks on retailers in the United Kingdom has now turned its attention to similar companies in the United States. \nJohn Hultquist, chief analyst at Google Threat Intelligence Group, said: \u201cThe US retail sector is currently being targeted in ransomware and extortion operations that we suspect are linked to UNC3944, also known as Scattered Spider.\u201d \nScattered Spider is the name used to track a loosely affiliated cybercriminal group [previously described](https:\/\/therecord.media\/scattered-spider-challenge-for-FBI) by the FBI as an offshoot of a larger criminal subculture calling itself \u201cthe Community,\u201d or \u201cthe Com.\u201d While Google suspects links between Scattered Spider and the hackers targeting retail, its statement is not a formal attribution. \n\u201cThe actor, which has reportedly targeted retail in the UK following a long hiatus, has a history of focusing their efforts on a single sector at a time, and we anticipate they will continue to target the sector in the near term. US retailers should take note,\u201d said Hultquist. \nIt follows recent incidents affecting [Marks & Spencer](https:\/\/therecord.media\/british-retailer-marks-spencer-insurance), the [Co-op](https:\/\/therecord.media\/co-op-cyberattack-uk-company-fears-hackers-still-in-system), and luxury retailer [Harrods](https:\/\/therecord.media\/harrods-cyberattack-uk-retailer). The group behind these attacks is reported to have attempted to monetize its access to the victims\u2019 networks using the DragonForce ransomware. \nHultquist said: \u201cThese actors are aggressive, creative, and particularly effective at circumventing mature security programs,\u201d adding \u201cthey have had a lot of success with social engineering and leveraging third parties to gain entry to their targets.\u201d \nThe broader Scattered Spider group is believed to be responsible for ransomware attacks two years ago on casino giants [MGM Resorts](https:\/\/therecord.media\/mgm-cyberattack-response) and [Caesars Entertainment](https:\/\/finance.yahoo.com\/news\/caesars-entertainment-paid-millions-ransom-185252473.html), prompting [a warning](https:\/\/therecord.media\/cisa-fbi-warn-of-scattered-spider-cybercrime-group) from U.S. cybersecurity officials about the criminals\u2019 SIM-swapping and social engineering activities. \nLast July, police in the United Kingdom [arrested a teenager](https:\/\/therecord.media\/mgm-hack-teenager-arrest-britain) for his alleged role in the MGM attack. Five other alleged members, all U.S. citizens, were last November [charged](https:\/\/therecord.media\/five-scattered-spider-members-charged-breaches-11-million-theft) for their alleged involvement with the group. \nWhile the group appeared to have disbanded following those arrests, it had caught widespread attention with several high-profile attacks, including on the networks of [Coinbase](https:\/\/therecord.media\/coinbase-explains-how-0ktapus-hacker-accessed-corporate-directory), [Twilio](https:\/\/therecord.media\/twilio-signal-phishing), [Mailchimp](https:\/\/therecord.media\/more-than-100-mailchimp-accounts-accessed-via-social-engineering-cyberattack), [LastPass](https:\/\/therecord.media\/lastpass-attacker-hacked-engineers-home-computer-keylogger), [Riot Games](https:\/\/therecord.media\/riot-games-to-pause-updates-after-social-engineering-attack) and [Reddit](https:\/\/therecord.media\/reddit-suffers-sophisticated-and-highly-targeted-phishing-attack-exposing-source-code). \n  * [](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=&t=Google says hackers behind UK retail cyber campaign now also targeting US)\n  * [](https:\/\/bsky.app\/intent\/compose?text=Google says hackers behind UK retail cyber campaign now also targeting US )\n\n\n  * [Cybercrime](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/cybercrime)\n  * [News](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n  * [News Briefs](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n\n\nGet more insights with the \nRecorded Future\nIntelligence Cloud.\n[Learn more.](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/platform?mtm_campaign=ad-unit-record)\nTags\n  * [Scattered Spider](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/scattered-spider)\n  * [Google](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/google)\n  * [retail](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/retail)\n  * [United States](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/united-states)\n  * [United Kingdom](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/united-kingdom)\n  * [hackers](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/hackers)\n\n\nNo previous article\nNo new articles\n[![Alexander Martin](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/headshot_79eb085f87.jpeg)](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/alexander-martin)\n[Alexander Martin](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/alexander-martin)\nis the UK Editor for Recorded Future News. He was previously a technology reporter for Sky News and is also a fellow at the European Cyber Conflict Research Initiative.\n## Briefs\n  * [Google says hackers behind UK retail cyber campaign now also targeting USMay 14th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/scattered-spider-suspected-retail-hackers-google-alert)\n  * [Cybersecurity incident forces largest US steelmaker to take some operations offlineMay 14th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/cyber-incident-forces-nucor-steel-to-take-systems-offline)\n  * [Russian internet shutdown that disrupted essential services condemned by rights groupsMay 14th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/russian-internet-shutdown-condemned-by-rights-groups)\n  * [Russian military cadet reportedly arrested for selling hacking tool to FSB agentMay 14th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/russian-military-cadet-reportedly-arrested-for-selling-hacking-tool)\n  * [Alabama state government says cyber incident\u2019s effects are limited, but response continuesMay 14th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/alabama-state-government-cyber-incident)\n  * [US extradites Kosovo national charged in operating illegal online marketplaceMay 13th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/us-extradites-kosovo-national-online-marketplace)\n  * [Chinese-speaking hackers disrupt drone supply chains in Taiwan, researchers sayMay 13th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/chinese-hackers-target-taiwan-military-sector)\n  * [EU launches vulnerability database to tackle cybersecurity threatsMay 13th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/eu-launches-vulnerability-database)\n  * [Alabama says \u2018cybersecurity event\u2019 could disrupt state government servicesMay 13th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/alabama-says-cyber-event-could-cause-disruptions)\n\n\n## [Measuring the US-China AI Gap![Measuring the US-China AI Gap](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_ta_2025_0508_Main_Feature_0873ea3526.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/measuring-the-us-china-ai-gap)\n## [TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered![TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/cta_2025_0501_Blog_Main_Feature_55a0e64897.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/terrastealerv2-and-terralogger)\n## [Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting![Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_cta_2025_0429_Main_Feature_e924c36cbd.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/uncovering-mintsloader-with-recorded-future-malware-intelligence-hunting)\n## [Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives![Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/irans_ai_ambitions_balancing_economic_isolation_national_security_imperatives_151fba814d.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/irans-ai-ambitions-balancing-economic-isolation-national-security-imperatives)\n## [2024 Malicious Infrastructure Report![2024 Malicious Infrastructure Report](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/2024_malicious_infrastructure_report_95f6761bdf.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/2024-malicious-infrastructure-report)\n",,
