"summary": "The Australian Human Rights Commission (AHRC) reported a data breach where private documents were unintentionally made available online and indexed by search engines. This incident exposed sensitive information such as names, contact details, health information, and more. The breach affected documents submitted to AHRC between specific periods in 2021 to 2025. Although not caused by a malicious attack, the incident resulted from internal issues, prompting AHRC to request removal of these documents from search engines and suspend web form operations temporarily.",,
