"title": "Coinbase offers $20 million bounty after extortion attempt with stolen data",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/coinbase-extortion-attempt-company-offers-20million-reward",,
"summary": "Coinbase faced an extortion attempt involving stolen customer data and is offering a $20 million bounty for information leading to the arrest and conviction of those responsible. The incident involved cash offers to overseas customer support agents, resulting in the theft of data belonging to less than 1% of the firm's monthly transacting users. The stolen data includes names, contact information, and partially encrypted Social Security and bank account numbers. No login credentials or access to funds were compromised. Coinbase is working with law enforcement and has promised reimbursement to affected customers.",,
