"summary": "Cybercriminals have been using AI-generated voice deepfakes to impersonate U.S. officials in phishing attacks since April 2025. The FBI has issued a public service announcement warning about such voice phishing or 'vishing' attacks targeting senior U.S. officials and their contacts, aiming to gain access to personal accounts and further exploit the compromised information. This threat has been associated with social engineering techniques involving fake audio messages and malicious links.",,
