"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/devsecops-playbook.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/getting-started-with-devsecops?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY25Q4_INB_FORM_DevSecOps-Getting-Started-Playbook&sfcid=701Py00000HwiF6IAJ&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=DevSecOpsPlaybook)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * Leak confirms OpenAI's ChatGPT will integrate MCP\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/)\n\n\n# Leak confirms OpenAI's ChatGPT will integrate MCP\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * May 15, 2025\n  * 07:53 PM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2023\/03\/24\/ChatGPT__headpic.jpg)\nChatGPT is testing support for Model Context Protocol (MCP), which will allow it to connect to third-party services and use them as context.\n[MCP](https:\/\/www.anthropic.com\/news\/model-context-protocol) is an open-source standard that allows developers to expose third-party data through MCP, so AI like ChatGPT could use it to finish tasks.\nFor example, ChatGPT could connect to third-party apps like Gmail to access its information and use it in tasks to help you.\nMCP may not have a lot of use cases for consumers, but it could be a game-changer for enterprises, as it will allow businesses to connect their internal tools to ChatGPT and share data when required.\n![GPT MCP](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/GPT-MPC.jpg)**ChatGPT thiird-party MCP**\nAs by Tibor on X, ChatGPT is testing a new Connectors settings where you can click on Custom, and add a new tool.\n![GPT Connector ](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/GPT-Connector.jpg)**ChatGPT web app tests \"Add Connector\" to link a new MCP**\nOnce done, you can see the form where you enter the name, URL, and description of your custom tool.\nThis allows ChatGPT to connect with your own apps or APIs.\nMCP support is still being tested internally, but OpenAI could formally announce the feature in the coming days or weeks.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/)](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[ChatGPT is finally adding Download as PDF for Deep Research](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/)\n[OpenAI document explains when to use each ChatGPT model](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/)\n[OpenAI tests watermarking for ChatGPT-4o Image Generation model](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-tests-watermarking-for-chatgpt-4o-image-generation-model\/)\n[Google Gemini AI is getting ChatGPT-like Scheduled Actions feature](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-gemini-ai-is-getting-chatgpt-like-scheduled-actions-feature\/)\n[ChatGPT 4.1 early benchmarks compared against Google Gemini](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-41-early-benchmarks-compared-against-google-gemini\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chatgpt\/)\n  * [MCP](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/mcp\/)\n  * [Model Context Protocol](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/model-context-protocol\/)\n  * [OpenAI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/openai\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Delivery Chains](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/delivery-chains.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/advancements-in-delivery-scripting-with-nietzsche\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trun-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Steam](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/) Twilio denies breach following leak of alleged Steam 2FA codes ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/twilio-denies-breach-following-leak-of-alleged-steam-2fa-codes\/)\n  * [ ![Patch Tuesday](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/) Microsoft May 2025 Patch Tuesday fixes 5 exploited zero-days, 72 flaws ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-may-2025-patch-tuesday-fixes-5-exploited-zero-days-72-flaws\/)\n  * [ ![Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/) Windows 11 KB5058411 and KB5058405 cumulative updates released ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-kb5058411-and-kb5058405-cumulative-updates-released\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Identity Cybersecurity Framework passwords authentication](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/) Majority of browser extensions pose critical security risk - learn how to control it ](https:\/\/go.layerxsecurity.com\/enterprise-browser-extension-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=browser_extension_08052025)\n  * [ ![Cybersecurity Lock World](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/) How to tell if your organization\u2019s credentials have been involved in a breach? ](https:\/\/outpost24.com\/blog\/find-credentials-involved-breach\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=referral_content)\n  * [ ![Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers?](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/) Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers? ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/demo\/generative-ai-monitoring?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=validated_phishing_may)\n  * [ ![Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/) Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024 ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/resources\/2024-identity-attacks?utm_campaign=12100141-FY25Q2_Bleeping-Computer-Article&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_content=external-article)\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.13458602002769038)\n",,
