"title": "Lawmakers push for reauthorization of cyber information sharing bill as deadline looms",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/lawmakers-push-for-reauthorization-information-sharing-bill",,
"summary": "A bipartisan group of lawmakers is urging the reauthorization of the Cybersecurity Information Sharing Act (CISA 2015) before its expiration on September 30. The Act has been crucial in enhancing cybersecurity collaboration between industry and government. While it faces challenges like privacy concerns and a crowded legislative agenda, no privacy violations have been reported under the Act. Discussions around the Act's renewal also include broadening security clearances to make cybersecurity efforts more effective.",,
