"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/devsecops-playbook.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/getting-started-with-devsecops?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY25Q4_INB_FORM_DevSecOps-Getting-Started-Playbook&sfcid=701Py00000HwiF6IAJ&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=DevSecOpsPlaybook)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * ChatGPT will soon record, transcribe, and summarize your meetings\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/)\n\n\n# ChatGPT will soon record, transcribe, and summarize your meetings\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * May 15, 2025\n  * 07:09 PM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2023\/03\/24\/ChatGPT-headpic.jpg)\nOpenAI may be planning to challenge Microsoft Teams Copilot integration with a new \"Record\" feature in ChatGPT.\nWhile ChatGPT supports third-party services, it's not yet possible to use it to summarize live meetings or generate an AI-powered transcript. \nAs by X user M1Astra, ChatGPT mobile app code clearly mentions a \u201cRecord\u201d feature for live meetings that supports pausing, resuming, and turning audio into text.\n![GPT Record](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/GPT-Record.jpg)**References to new Record feature in ChatGPT mobile app**\nWhen turned on, you'll be able to \u201cdrag to talk,\u201d get detailed reports, and quickly generate summaries of your meetings.\nChatGPT also asks for mic and system audio access and reminds users to get consent before recording.\nThis clearly confirms OpenAI is planning to take on Microsoft Teams' Copilot integration.\nHowever, it likely works as an overlay inside ChatGPT that records your screen or mic, not as a direct integration with apps like Teams or Zoom.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[ChatGPT is finally adding Download as PDF for Deep Research](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-finally-adding-download-as-pdf-for-deep-research\/)\n[OpenAI document explains when to use each ChatGPT model](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/)\n[Google takes on Cursor with Firebase Studio, its AI builder for vibe coding](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-takes-on-cursor-with-firebase-studio-its-ai-builder-for-vibe-coding\/)\n[OpenAI's $20 ChatGPT Plus is now free for students until the end of May](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-20-chatgpt-plus-is-now-free-for-students-until-the-end-of-may\/)\n[ChatGPT is down worldwide with something went wrong error](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-down-worldwide-with-something-went-wrong-error\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * [Chat-GPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chat-gpt\/)\n  * [ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chatgpt\/)\n  * [Microsoft Teams](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/microsoft-teams\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-10-kb5058379-update-triggering-bitlocker-recovery-after-install\/)\n  * [Next Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Skuld Stealer story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/skuld-stealer.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/tmpn-skuld-stealer-the-dark-side-of-open-source\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trus-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Steam](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/) Twilio denies breach following leak of alleged Steam 2FA codes ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/twilio-denies-breach-following-leak-of-alleged-steam-2fa-codes\/)\n  * [ ![Patch Tuesday](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/) Microsoft May 2025 Patch Tuesday fixes 5 exploited zero-days, 72 flaws ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-may-2025-patch-tuesday-fixes-5-exploited-zero-days-72-flaws\/)\n  * [ ![Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/) Windows 11 KB5058411 and KB5058405 cumulative updates released ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-kb5058411-and-kb5058405-cumulative-updates-released\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Identity Cybersecurity Framework passwords authentication](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/) Majority of browser extensions pose critical security risk - learn how to control it ](https:\/\/go.layerxsecurity.com\/enterprise-browser-extension-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=browser_extension_08052025)\n  * [ ![Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/) Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024 ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/resources\/2024-identity-attacks?utm_campaign=12100141-FY25Q2_Bleeping-Computer-Article&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_content=external-article)\n  * [ ![Cybersecurity Lock World](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/) How to tell if your organization\u2019s credentials have been involved in a breach? ](https:\/\/outpost24.com\/blog\/find-credentials-involved-breach\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=referral_content)\n  * [ ![Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers?](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/) Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers? ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/demo\/generative-ai-monitoring?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=validated_phishing_may)\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.940823687817246)\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/sync.intentiq.com\/profiles_engine\/ProfilesEngineServlet?at=20&mi=10&secure=1&dpi=456059511&iiqidtype=2&iiqpcid=038ede85-221e-46da-93f9-47c382d0e0ae&iiqpciddate=1747353647019&tsrnd=97_1747353647019&vrref=&jsver=5.082)\n",,
