"summary": "The focus of the webinar is on improving the security of modern applications by integrating security practices from code to cloud to Security Operations Center (SOC). The current challenge is the fragmented approach in security where DevSecOps, CloudSec, and SOC teams work in silos, resulting in exploitable gaps. This session, featuring Ory Segal from Palo Alto Networks, promises to demonstrate practical methods to unify security tools and teams, significantly reducing response times and improving application security posture.",,
