"markdown": "[_\ue80a_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\nContact\/Tip Us\n[ _\uf0e0_ Reach out to get featured\u2014contact us to send your exclusive story idea, research, hacks, or ask us a question or leave a comment\/feedback! ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/p\/submit-news.html)\nFollow Us On Social Media\n[_\uf167_](https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/c\/thehackernews?sub_confirmation=1)\n[_\uf09e_ RSS Feeds](https:\/\/feeds.feedburner.com\/TheHackersNews) [_\uf0f3_ Email Alerts](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html#email-outer) [_\uf2c6_ Telegram Channel](https:\/\/t.me\/+wKrQxniFO1Q1OTRk)\n[![Zenith Live 2025](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEiKLqdTf2BnL4fIex_Fj-HhjsQU6HOZ_ao_WyUZ0ELrxsZ4ezufQqD8JfJabnIMeCtgdwKU-y948oMzHGFOP_Ox3vMW1Ymki-zmY4bSHWFP-m4zwD42-Huw3q9eM8VAY9_mL9yzihdsF1YygoUH-dDrY8EzKJb4dslf03xMaGFlYgAy0bA6p7gZ5vr5GHHb\/s728-e300\/team-d.jpg)](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/team-d)\n# [[Webinar] From Code to Cloud to SOC: Learn a Smarter Way to Defend Modern Applications](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html)\n_\ue802_ May 16, 2025 _\ue804_ The Hacker NewsDevSecOps \/ Threat Detection\n[![](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEjLbNLee9VlpBpNmlxQSBF7IHwrQajzAJWYjhcHTIVVqzroGXrpk_x9Sbbua1Xi-QtO9jbcX1canKTWWzfaOshSarJol1Ude7LNQMeV5B2x71gaXxWg_cjEJ3bPuuoyyyMLgWB9hCtZ1PV5j3QOGByinGCAETqul2WWz-mVYiuERYWPVu7ob8lSckM-ocw\/s728-rw-e365\/soc.jpg)](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/code-cloud-soc?source=article)\nModern apps move fast\u2014faster than most security teams can keep up. As businesses rush to build in the cloud, security often lags behind. Teams scan code in isolation, react late to cloud threats, and monitor SOC alerts only after damage is done.\nAttackers don't wait. They exploit vulnerabilities within hours. Yet most organizations take days to respond to critical cloud alerts. That delay isn't just risky\u2014it's an open door.\nThe problem? Security is split across silos. DevSecOps, CloudSec, and SOC teams all work separately. Their tools don't talk. Their data doesn't sync. And in those gaps, 80% of cloud exposures slip through\u2014exploitable, avoidable, and often invisible until it's too late.\nThis free webinar ,\"[Breaking Down Security Silos: Why Application Security Must Span from Code to Cloud to SOC](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/code-cloud-soc?source=article),\" shows you how to fix that. Join Ory Segal, Technical Evangelist at Cortex Cloud (Palo Alto Networks), and discover a practical approach to securing your apps from code to cloud to SOC\u2014all in one connected strategy.\nYou'll learn:\n  * Why code scanning alone isn't enough\n  * Where attackers find your biggest blind spots\n  * How to unify your security tools and teams\n  * How to cut response times from days to hours\n\n\nIf you're in AppSec, CloudOps, DevSecOps, or SOC\u2014you'll walk away with insights you can apply immediately.\n[Watch this Webinar](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/code-cloud-soc?source=article)\nStill relying on just code reviews or siloed tools? That's only part of the picture. Attackers see your whole environment. It's time you did too.\n[![](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html)](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/code-cloud-soc?source=article)\nJoin us and take the first step toward smarter, faster, full-stack security.\nFound this article interesting? This article is a contributed piece from one of our valued partners. Follow us on and to read more exclusive content we post.\nSHARE [_\uf09a_](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html#link_share) [_\uf099_](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html#link_share) [_\uf0e1_](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html#link_share) [_\uf1e0_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\n[_\uf099_ Tweet](https: