earch\/label\/Incident%20response)[Palo Alto Networks](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Palo%20Alto%20Networks)[SOC Operations](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/SOC%20Operations)[threat detection](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/threat%20detection)[vulnerability management](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/vulnerability%20management)\nTrending News\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html) Wormable AirPlay Flaws Enable Zero-Click RCE on Apple Devices via Public Wi-Fi ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/wormable-airplay-flaws-enable-zero.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html) Update ASAP: Google Fixes Android Flaw (CVE-2025-27363) Exploited by Attackers ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/google-fixes-actively-exploited-android.html)\n[ ![NSO Group Fined $168M for Targeting 1,400 WhatsApp Users With Pegasus Spyware](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html) NSO Group Fined $168M for Targeting 1,400 WhatsApp Users With Pegasus Spyware ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/nso-group-fined-168m-for-targeting-1400.html)\n[ ![The Hacker News](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html) \u26a1 Weekly Recap: Nation-State Hacks, Spyware Alerts, Deepfake Malware, Supply Chain Backdoors ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-nation-state-hacks-spyware.html)\n[ ![Google Rolls Out On-Device AI Protections to Detect Scams in Chrome and Android](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html) Google Rolls Out On-Device AI Protections to Detect Scams in Chrome and Android ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/google-rolls-out-on-device-ai.html)\n[ ![Reevaluating SSEs: A Technical Gap Analysis of Last-Mile Protection](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/