2014 Control Effectiveness Does ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/security-tools-alone-dont-protect-you.html)\nPopular Resources\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html) Every Second Counts: Learn How Corelight Detects and Disrupts Threats Before They Escalate ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/corelight-ndr-platform)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html) Take Control of Account Takeovers \u2014 Flare Lets You See and Stop Them Instantly ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/session-takeover-prevention)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html) Drowning in AppSec Alerts? This Report Shows How to Fix the Alert Overload ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/app-security-benchmark)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-code-to-cloud-to-soc-learn-smarter.html) Struggling With AI Data Leaks? This Guide Shows Security Teams What to Fix First. ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/saas-ai-best-practices)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ Secure Faster, Smarter, Together Redesign Security on Your Terms\u2014From Code to Cloud to SOC Cloud attacks move fast\u2014fixes lag. Unite app, cloud, and SOC security to respond quicker and stop breaches early. Register ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/code-cloud-soc?source=below) [ Control AI Before It Controls You Discover the Smartest Way to Secure AI Agents\u2014Before They're Exploited AI agents boost business\u2014but create risks. Learn to prevent leaks, secure AI, and stay protected with expert tips. Register ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-security?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybersecurity Resources\n[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgd_MnxPpQmrmAssYNnhDReESftbJ0IYVVE2JTMZhDAMmdj8TbzBYLv2RhMLaUf1ZsfYCMg4Jc5bpFT7CCdFlD4i00ghnt5eKfghy5W0NVeJ_LBbbiHyNt0r5tfWIAA2AZ_IDaFeNiyU9irbY4R7pbOE3WgZkibStdHReF0FDwuS3KXxe