"markdown": "  * [Featured](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/category\/featured\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/category\/news\/)\n  * [Lifestyle](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/category\/lifestyle\/)\n  * [Travel](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/category\/all-travel\/)\n  * [Food & Drinks](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/category\/foodie\/)\n  * [Entertainment](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/category\/entertainment\/)\n  * [Family & Kids](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/category\/family-friends\/)\n  * [Contest \/ Promotion](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/category\/contest\/)\n\n\n#### **Contact AM Collective** AM Collective:amplify (at) amcollective (dot) comAlvin Lim:alvin (at) alvinology (dot) com\n### Latest Reads\n  * [UNIQLO\u2019s Thank You Festival Returns with Local Flair, Limited Offers, and Exclusive Rewards](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2025\/05\/16\/uniqlos-thank-you-festival-returns-with-local-flair-limited-offers-and-exclusive-rewards\/) May 16, 2025\n  * [StarHub Unveils Next-Gen Flagship Store at Paragon, Blending Tech with Lifestyle](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2025\/05\/16\/starhub-unveils-next-gen-flagship-store-at-paragon-blending-tech-with-lifestyle\/) May 16, 2025\n  * [JW Marriott Debuts in New Zealand with the Opening of JW Marriott Auckland \u2013 A Luxe Urban Retreat Inspired by Nature](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2025\/05\/16\/jw-marriott-debuts-in-new-zealand-with-the-opening-of-jw-marriott-auckland-a-luxe-urban-retreat-inspired-by-nature\/) May 16, 2025\n  * [Lazada Run 2025 Launches POP MART 5KM Category Featuring Fan-Favorite Twinkle Twinkle](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2025\/05\/16\/lazada-run-2025-launches-pop-mart-5km-category-featuring-fan-favorite-twinkle-twinkle\/) May 16, 2025\n  * [Burn the Floor Returns to Ignite Singapore Stage This July](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2025\/05\/16\/burn-the-floor-returns-to-ignite-singapore-stage-this-july\/) May 16, 2025\n\n\n[ ![Alvinology](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/am-logo-new@2x.png) ](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/) [ ![Alvinology](https:\/\/media.alvinology.com\/uploads\/2020\/11\/am-logo-darkmode%402x.png) ](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/)\n![StarHub Unveils Next-Gen Flagship Store at Paragon, Blending Tech with Lifestyle - Alvinology](https:\/\/media.alvinology.com\/uploads\/2025\/05\/StarHub-Paragon.jpg)\n# StarHub Unveils Next-Gen Flagship Store at Paragon, Blending Tech with Lifestyle\n[![](https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/61858b88a11d05ed3f662d10208d46c8?s=26&r=g)byIrone Kim](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/author\/ironexplores\/ \"View all posts by Irone Kim\")\nMay 16, 2025\n2 minute read\n35\nSHARES\n[Weibo](http:\/\/service.weibo.com\/share\/share.php?url=https%3A%2F%2Falvinology.com%2F2025%2F05%2F16%2Fstarhub-unveils-next-gen-flagship-store-at-paragon-blending-tech-with-lifestyle%2F&title=StarHub+Unveils+Next-Gen+Flagship+Store+at+Paragon%2C+Blending+Tech+with+Lifestyle)[Line](http:\/\/line.me\/R\/msg\/text\/?StarHub+Unveils+Next-Gen+Flagship+Store+at+Paragon%2C+Blending+Tech+with+Lifestyle%20https%3A%2F%2Falvinology.com%2F2025%2F05%2F16%2Fstarhub-unveils-next-gen-flagship-store-at-paragon-blending-tech-with-lifestyle%2F)[Telegram](https:\/\/telegram.me\/share\/url?url=https%3A%2F%2Falvinology.com%2F2025%2F05%2F16%2Fstarhub-unveils-next-gen-flagship-store-at-paragon-blending-tech-with-lifestyle%2F&text=StarHub+Unveils+Next-Gen+Flagship+Store+at+Paragon%2C+Blending+Tech+with+Lifestyle)\nStarHub has officially opened its new flagship shop at Paragon along Orchard Road, transforming the telco experience into an inviting lifestyle space that prioritizes comfort, convenience, and connection. Coinciding with its 25th anniversary in Singapore, the launch represents StarHub\u2019s ongoing commitment to making everyday technology simpler, smarter, and more enjoyable.\n## A Lifestyle-Centric Tech Experience\n[![StarHub Unveils Next-Gen Flagship Store at Paragon, Blending Tech with Lifestyle - Alvinology](https:\/\/media.alvinology.com\/uploads\/2025\/05\/StarHub-Paragon-1024x685.jpg)](https:\/\/media.alvinology.com\/uploads\/2025\/05\/StarHub-Paragon.jpg)\nForget the usual counters and queue numbers\u2014StarHub\u2019s Paragon store welcomes visitors with a concierge service and a tranquil, open-concept layout. At the heart of the shop is _The Lawn_ , a cozy lounge surrounded by immersive digital displays showcasing the latest in connectivity, devices, and entertainment.\n[![Dash to Cart](https:\/\/media.alvinology.com\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Dash-to-Cart-4.png)](https:\/\/www.dashtocart.io\/start)\nCustomers are notified via SMS when it\u2019s their turn for service, and appointments can be booked online for added convenience. QR codes scattered throughout the space allow guests to easily access information, exclusive offers, and services at their own pace.\n## Discover, Interact, and Personalize\nTech enthusiasts can test out the latest devices and accessories in the mobile zone or explore cutting-edge home entertainment solutions through interactive displays. A \u201cCustomer Favourites\u201d wall helps highlight trending products in both areas. Platinum customers also enjoy access to an exclusive lounge offering complimentary coffee and priority service in a private setting.\n## Grand Opening Offers (Now\u20138 June 2025)\nTo celebrate the opening, StarHub is offering over $100 worth of exclusive perks at its Paragon location:\n**Mobile Deals:**\n  * $100 Takashimaya vouchers with any mobile trade-in\n  * $100 off devices for new 4G Device Plan XS sign-ups or port-ins\n\n\n**Broadband Offers:**\n  * $100 eCapitaVoucher with 5Gbps or 10Gbps plans\n\n\n**HomeHub Perks:**\n  * $100 eCapitaVoucher with UltraEntertainment Max or Asian plans\n\n\n**Entertainment Bonus:**\n  * Free Disney+ (Standard) for the first 100 Broadband or HomeHub+ sign-ups on 20 May\n\n\n**Extras:**\n  * 2 months free SmartSupport Plus with any mobile plan (worth $19\/month)\n\n\n**Meet Football Legends + In-Store Activations**\nOn 24 May, fans can meet Premier League icons John Barnes and Joe Hart in an exclusive signing session. Additional events throughout May and June include:\n  * Free Galaxy wrap with Samsung Galaxy S25 series purchases\n  * Apple and OPPO-led tech talks on AI and cybersecurity\n  * Mobile health checks courtesy of Asurion\u2019s mobile clinic\n  * Onsite support by Hub Troopers to assist with tech needs\n\n\nVisit **_[StarHub Paragon](https:\/\/www.starhub.com)_** for more details.\n> [Nothing and KEF Join Forces to Redefine Audio Innovation](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2025\/05\/15\/nothing-and-kef-join-forces-to-redefine-audio-innovation\/)\n[ ![](https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/61858b88a11d05ed3f662d10208d46c8?s=100&r=g) ](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/author\/ironexplores\/)\nAuthor\n[ Irone Kim ](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/author\/ironexplores\/)\n### Leave a Reply[Cancel reply](https:\/\/news.google.com\/2025\/05\/16\/starhub-unveils-next-gen-flagship-store-at-paragon-blending-tech-with-lifestyle\/#respond)\nView Comments (0)\n### Connect On Social\n[ 6K ](https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/user\/dragaz)\n[ 171 ](https:\/\/t.me\/alvinologymedia)\n### Contact AM Collective\nPartnerships and Collaborations: amplify (at) amcollective (dot) com\nEditorial: editor (at) alvinology (dot) com\nAlvin Lim: alvin (at) alvinology (dot) com\n### Related Posts\n![HUAWEI MateBook X Pro is available to pre-order on 18 - 24 July with a special gift bundle worth $1,161! - Alvinology](https:\/\/media.alvinology.com\/uploads\/2020\/07\/Huawei-Matebook-X-Pro-1024x538.jpg)\nRead More\n[](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2020\/07\/14\/huawei-matebook-x-pro-is-available-to-pre-order-on-18-24-july-with-a-special-gift-bundle-worth-1161\/)\n## [HUAWEI MateBook X Pro is available to pre-order on 18 \u2013 24 July with a special gift bundle worth $1,161!](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2020\/07\/14\/huawei-matebook-x-pro-is-available-to-pre-order-on-18-24-july-with-a-special-gift-bundle-worth-1161\/)\nMEDIA RELEASE \u2013 Say Hello to Spring with a New Oat Beverage and Refreshing Treats for the Season\u2026 \n[byIrone Kim](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/author\/ironexplores\/ \"View all posts by Irone Kim\")\n![Plant Prosperity This Lunar New Year with Flo\u2019s Plantable Red Packets - Alvinology](https:\/\/media.alvinology.com\/uploads\/2025\/01\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-01-25-at-8.06.02-PM-1024x768.jpeg)\nRead More\n[](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2025\/01\/25\/plant-prosperity-this-lunar-new-year-with-flos-plantable-red-packets\/)\n## [Plant Prosperity This Lunar New Year with Flo\u2019s Plantable Red Packets](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2025\/01\/25\/plant-prosperity-this-lunar-new-year-with-flos-plantable-red-packets\/)\nThis is the most interesting angpow we received this year for the upcoming Lunar New Year \u2013 plantable\u2026 \n[byalvinology](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/author\/alvinology\/ \"View all posts by alvinology\")\n![Hello Kitty 45th Anniversary: Special anniversary activities awaits you in Hello Kitty Land Tokyo - Alvinology](https:\/\/media.alvinology.com\/uploads\/2019\/01\/Hello-Kitty-45th-Anniversary-Catch-these-special-anniversary-activities-in-Hello-Kitty-Land-Tokyo-1024x538.jpg)\nRead More\n[](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2019\/01\/16\/hello-kitty-45th-anniversary-special-anniversary-activities-awaits-you-in-hello-kitty-land-tokyo\/)\n## [Hello Kitty 45th Anniversary: Special anniversary activities awaits you in Hello Kitty Land Tokyo](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2019\/01\/16\/hello-kitty-45th-anniversary-special-anniversary-activities-awaits-you-in-hello-kitty-land-tokyo\/)\nHello Kitty turns 45 and will celebrate in style. Starting from 12th January 2019 until year-end Sanrio Puroland,\u2026 \n[byIrone Kim](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/author\/ironexplores\/ \"View all posts by Irone Kim\")\n![Enjoy 1 + 1 Perfect Pair deals and FREE GIFTS worth $120 on Shopee this Valentine\u2019s Day! - Alvinology](https:\/\/media.alvinology.com\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Shopee_s-2.2-Lovestruck-Sale-1024x546.jpg)\nRead More\n[](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2023\/01\/31\/enjoy-1-1-perfect-pair-deals-and-free-gifts-worth-120-on-shopee-this-valentines-day\/)\n## [Enjoy 1 + 1 Perfect Pair deals and FREE GIFTS worth $120 on Shopee this Valentine\u2019s Day!](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/2023\/01\/31\/enjoy-1-1-perfect-pair-deals-and-free-gifts-worth-120-on-shopee-this-valentines-day\/)\nValentine\u2019s Day is coming right up, and if anyone is gonna be single and date-less on this romantic\u2026 \n[byIrone Kim](https:\/\/alvinology.com\/author\/ironexplores\/ \"View all posts by Irone Kim\")\n[ ](https:\/\/news.google.com\/rss\/articles\?oc=5#top)\n",,
