"summary": "OpenAI has introduced 'Codex' for ChatGPT, an AI agent aimed at automating and delegating programming tasks for software engineers. Although Codex is not positioned to replace junior engineers, it could enhance developer productivity by handling tasks via AI. Codex, based on codex-1, pulls code from GitHub and can write new code, propose pull requests, and monitor its progress in real time. It is available through a Pro subscription.",,
