"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/ai-security-risk-ebook.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/getting-started-with-ai-security-ai-risks-how-to-prevent-them-and-ai-for-defender?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY25Q3_INB_FORM_Getting-Started-with-AI-Security-AI-Risks-How-to-Prevent-Them&sfcid=701Py00000DP3ZaIAL&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AISecurityeBook)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * ChatGPT rolls out Codex, an AI tool for software programming\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/)\n\n\n# ChatGPT rolls out Codex, an AI tool for software programming\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * May 16, 2025\n  * 11:49 AM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2023\/03\/24\/ChatGPT.jpg)\nOpenAI is rolling out 'Codex' for ChatGPT, which is an AI agent that automates and delegates programming tasks for software engineers.\nOpenAI isn't explicitly claiming that Codex will eventually replace junior software engineers.\nInstead, the company states Codex could help developers achieve more by delegating their tasks to different agents.\nThe idea is to move faster with development and become more productive with AI, but how does Codex work?\n![Codex](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/Codex-GPT.jpg)**Codex in ChatGPT**\nAccording to OpenAI, Codex is based on codex-1, which is a new version of ChatGPT based on the existing o3 model, but it has been optimized for coding, which results in increased accuracy.\nCodex pulls codebase from Github and closely mirrors the existing PR style.\nIt can write new code, propose pull requests, and run each task in its own sandbox.\n\"Task completion typically takes between 1 and 30 minutes, depending on complexity, and you can monitor Codex\u2019s progress in real time,\" OpenAI [noted](https:\/\/openai.com\/index\/introducing-codex\/) in a blog post.\n\"Once Codex completes a task, it commits its changes in its environment. Codex provides verifiable evidence of its actions through citations of terminal logs and test outputs, allowing you to trace each step taken during task completion.\"\nCodex is rolling out, but only if you've a Pro subscription, which costs $200 per month.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[OpenAI document explains when to use each ChatGPT model](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-document-explains-when-to-use-each-chatgpt-model\/)\n[OpenAI's $20 ChatGPT Plus is now free for students until the end of May](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-20-chatgpt-plus-is-now-free-for-students-until-the-end-of-may\/)\n[ChatGPT is down worldwide with something went wrong error](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-is-down-worldwide-with-something-went-wrong-error\/)\n[OpenAI says Deep Research is coming to ChatGPT free \"very soon\"](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-says-deep-research-is-coming-to-chatgpt-free-very-soon\/)\n[Leak confirms OpenAI's ChatGPT will integrate MCP](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/)\n  * [AGi](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/agi\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * [ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chatgpt\/)\n  * [OpenAI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/openai\/)\n  * [Vibe Coding](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/vibe-coding\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/hackers-exploit-vmware-esxi-microsoft-sharepoint-zero-days-at-pwn2own\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Astaroth Unleashed story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/Astaroth-unleashed.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/astaroth-unleashed\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trua-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Steam](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/) Twilio denies breach following leak of alleged Steam 2FA codes ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/twilio-denies-breach-following-leak-of-alleged-steam-2fa-codes\/)\n  * [ ![Patch Tuesday](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/) Microsoft May 2025 Patch Tuesday fixes 5 exploited zero-days, 72 flaws ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-may-2025-patch-tuesday-fixes-5-exploited-zero-days-72-flaws\/)\n  * [ ![Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/) Windows 11 KB5058411 and KB5058405 cumulative updates released ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-kb5058411-and-kb5058405-cumulative-updates-released\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n  * [ ![Cybersecurity Lock World](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/) How to tell if your organization\u2019s credentials have been involved in a breach? ](https:\/\/outpost24.com\/blog\/find-credentials-involved-breach\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=referral_content)\n  * [ ![Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers?](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/) Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers? ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/demo\/generative-ai-monitoring?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=validated_phishing_may)\n  * [ ![Identity Cybersecurity Framework passwords authentication](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/) Majority of browser extensions pose critical security risk - learn how to control it ](https:\/\/go.layerxsecurity.com\/enterprise-browser-extension-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=browser_extension_08052025)\n  * [ ![Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/) Learn why identity attacks were the #1 threat facing organizations in 2024 ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/resources\/2024-identity-attacks?utm_campaign=12100141-FY25Q2_Bleeping-Computer-Article&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored&utm_content=external-article)\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ic