"title": "Hack of SEC social media account earns 14-month prison sentence for Alabama man",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/sec-social-media-hack-sentencing",,
"summary": "An Alabama man, Eric Council Jr., received a 14-month prison sentence for a SIM-swap attack on the SEC's social media account causing fraudulent posts that affected the bitcoin market value. His scheme involved impersonating a government user to obtain a replacement SIM card, which allowed unauthorized control over the SEC's social media account on platform X.",,
