"markdown": "[Subscribe from S$9.90\/month](https:\/\/subscribe.sph.com.sg\/btpe-mthlyprepaid\/?utm_campaign=btp99&utm_medium=sph-publication&utm_source=bt&utm_content=subscribebutton-header)\n# StarHub, Trends and Technologies ink MOU to boost digital transformation in the Philippines\nThe partnership will offer enterprises scalable solutions with strong local support\n![Chloe Lim](https:\/\/cassette.sphdigital.com.sg\/image\/businesstimes\/c3172a7484f5d0101639d9df6a0e567ad400781e646c12dc765cbb7f482a2856?q=20&w=3&h=2&f=webp)\n#### [Chloe Lim ](https:\/\/news.google.com\/authors\/chloe-lim)\nPublished Mon, May 19, 2025 \u00b7 04:42 PM\n[StarHub](https:\/\/news.google.com\/keywords\/starhub)\nFollow\n![](data:image\/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2016%2016'%20fill='%232b2b2b'%3e%3cpath%20d='M11.354%201.646a.5.5%200%200%201%200%20.708L5.707%208l5.647%205.646a.5.5%200%200%201-.708.708l-6-6a.5.5%200%200%201%200-.708l6-6a.5.5%200%200%201%20.708%200z'\/%3e%3c\/svg%3e)\n![](data:image\/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2016%2016'%20fill='%232b2b2b'%3e%3cpath%20d='M4.646%201.646a.5.5%200%200%201%20.708%200l6%206a.5.5%200%200%201%200%20.708l-6%206a.5.5%200%200%201-.708-.708L10.293%208%204.646%202.354a.5.5%200%200%201%200-.708z'\/%3e%3c\/svg%3e)\n  * The partnership is part of StarHub's broader strategy to grow its enterprise presence across the region through high-impact local collaborations. PHOTO: STARHUB\n\n\n[SINGAPORE] StarHub signed a memorandum of understanding on Monday (May 19) with Trends and Technologies, a systems integrator and enterprise ICT solutions provider headquartered in the Philippines, to bring digital solutions and services to businesses in the Philippines. \nAt its core, the partnership is focused on delivering practical innovation through a unified go-to-market strategy in the Philippines, and includes co-developed bundled offerings and coordinated sales and marketing efforts.\nIt will deliver integrated solutions built on StarHub\u2019s Modern Digital Infrastructure platform, which is powered by multi-cloud infrastructure Cloud Infinity and its managed services capabilities. \nThis venture is part of the telco\u2019s broader strategy to grow its enterprise presence across the region through high-impact local collaborations. \nBacked by the expertise of Trends and Technologies in cybersecurity, managed services, and systems integration, the partnership will offer enterprises scalable solutions with strong local support. \nThe goal is to accelerate the adoption of transformative technology, empowering enterprises to innovate in a more agile manner. \nSEE ALSO\n[![StarHub's revenue for the three months slid 2.4 per cent on-year to S$540.5 million, from S$553.9 million.](https:\/\/cassette.sphdigital.com.sg\/image\/businesstimes\/093d93bfcf778f85621c904da64d52a1fc247ad4294b6dc2357afab0baf36398?q=20&w=3&h=2&f=webp)](https:\/\/news.google.com\/companies-markets\/telcos-media-tech\/starhub-q1-profit-falls-18-4-s31-8-million)\n### [StarHub Q1 profit falls 18.4% to S$31.8 million](https:\/\/news.google.com\/companies-markets\/telcos-media-tech\/starhub-q1-profit-falls-18-4-s31-8-million \"StarHub Q1 profit falls 18.4% to S$31.8 million\")\n[![The event is conducted in line with the company\u2019s refreshed corporate social responsibility charter where the initiative delivers impactful societal outcomes to address community needs. ](https:\/\/cassette.sphdigital.com.sg\/image\/businesstimes\/f6d80d0b608883f2ebf7bdc5aeee778dc80e496fb10e836eb420180c7503ea9e?q=20&w=3&h=2&f=webp)](https:\/\/news.google.com\/lifestyle\/starhub-spreads-digital-literacy-awareness-among-migrant-workers)\n### [StarHub spreads digital literacy awareness among migrant workers](https:\/\/news.google.com\/lifestyle\/starhub-spreads-digital-literacy-awareness-among-migrant-workers \"StarHub spreads digital literacy awareness among migrant workers\")\n\u201cIn Singapore, we\u2019ve seen how this approach helps organisations simplify transformation and drive meaningful outcomes,\u201d said Tan Kit Yong, head of Enterprise Business Group at StarHub. \u201cTogether with Trends and Technologies, we are bringing that same focus to the Philippines, making innovation more accessible, practical, and connected to real business needs and people.\u201d \nEarlier on May 9, StarHub reported a profit of S$31.8 million for the first quarter ended Mar 31, [a drop of 18.4 per cent from S$38.9 million in the corresponding year-ago period](https:\/\/www.businesstimes.com.sg\/companies-markets\/telcos-media-tech\/starhub-q1-profit-falls-18-4-s31-8-million). Its revenue for the three months fell 2.4 per cent year on year to S$540.5 million, from S$553.9 million. \nAs at 4.29 pm, shares of StarHub were trading 0.9 per cent or S$0.01 lower at S$1.14. \nCopyright SPH Media. All rights reserved.\n[Reuse this content](https:\/\/newspost.newslink.sg\/?publication=BT&title=StarHub%2C%20Trends%20and%20Technologies%20ink%20MOU%20to%20boost%20digital%20transformation%20in%20the%20Philippines&date=2025-05-19T08%3A42%3A01.000Z)[Feedback](https:\/\/bt.sg\/feedback)\n## [more in Companies & Markets](https:\/\/news.google.com\/companies-markets)\n  * ## [Tech stocks could rally on US-China tariff truce, impending tax cuts: Stanchart](https:\/\/news.google.com\/companies-markets\/tech-stocks-could-rally-us-china-tariff-truce-impending-tax-cuts-stanchart)\nMay 19, 2025 04:16 PM\n  * ## [Kwek Poh Heok named new CEO of Business China; Ho Chee Hin exits into public sector ](https:\/\/news.google.com\/companies-markets\/kwek-poh-heok-named-new-ceo-business-china-ho-chee-hin-exits-public-sector)\nMay 19, 2025 03:33 PM\n  * ## [Xiaomi to invest at least 50 billion yuan in chip design: founder ](https:\/\/news.google.com\/companies-markets\/xiaomi-invest-least-50-billion-yuan-chip-design-founder)\nMay 19, 2025 01:17 PM\n  * ## [Qatar Airways posts 28% jump in net profit to record US$2.1 billion](https:\/\/news.google.com\/companies-markets\/transport-logistics\/qatar-airways-posts-28-jump-net-profit-record-us2-1-billion)\nMay 19, 2025 03:13 PM\n  * ## [Hong Kong dollar falls to near one-year low on flush cash conditions](https:\/\/news.google.com\/companies-markets\/banking-finance\/hong-kong-dollar-falls-near-one-year-low-flush-cash-conditions)\nMay 19, 2025 02:59 PM\n  * ## [Ryanair says tariff war top threat to growth; plans buyback](https:\/\/news.google.com\/companies-markets\/transport-logistics\/ryanair-says-tariff-war-top-threat-growth-plans-buyback)\nMay 19, 2025 02:05 PM\n  * ## [Analysts say SIA is fairly valued, with several adjusting target price](https:\/\/news.google.com\/companies-markets\/analysts-say-sia-fairly-valued-several-adjusting-target-price)\nMay 19, 2025 01:44 PM\n  * ## [Nvidia CEO unveils new tech to keep global AI expansion going](https:\/\/news.google.com\/companies-markets\/telcos-media-tech\/nvidia-ceo-unveils-new-tech-keep-global-ai-expansion-going)\nMay 19, 2025 01:16 PM\n\n\n  * Popular Topics\n  * Banks & Currency News\n  * Singapore Companies News\n  * Singapore Economy News\n  * Latest REITs News\n  * Property News\n\n\n[Latest T-bills Treasury Bills Results & Interest News](https:\/\/www.businesstimes.com.sg\/keywords\/singapore-stocks)[Latest SSB Singapore Savings Bonds News](https:\/\/www.businesstimes.com.sg\/keywords\/singapore-savings-bonds)[Latest COE Certificate of Entitlement News](https:\/\/www.businesstimes.com.sg\/keywords\/coe)\n[Latest Johor-Singapore SEZ News](https:\/\/www.businesstimes.com.sg\/keywords\/johor-singapore-sez)[Latest BTO Build To Order & Sales of Balance News](https:\/\/www.businesstimes.com.sg\/keywords\/bto)[Latest STI Straits Times Index News](https:\/\/www.businesstimes.com.sg\/keywords\/straits-times-index)[Latest SGX Dividends, Share Price News](https:\/\/www.businesstimes.com.sg\/keywords\/sgx)[Latest Bonds Market News](https:\/\/www.businesstimes.com.sg\/keywor