"title": "Why CTEM is the Winning Bet for CISOs in 2025",,
"url": "https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/why-ctem-is-winning-bet-for-cisos-in.html",,
"summary": "The article discusses the rise of Continuous Threat Exposure Management (CTEM) as a crucial strategy for CISOs in 2025. CTEM has become a strategic enabler for cybersecurity programs by aligning security efforts with real-world risk. It integrates methodologies such as Adversarial Exposure Validation (AEV), Attack Surface Management (ASM), autonomous penetration testing, red teaming, and Breach and Attack Simulation (BAS) to improve risk visibility and operational efficiency. Emphasizing proactive security, the article notes the increased board expectations and complex cyber threats that necessitate the adoption of CTEM. Gartner predicts that organizations using CTEM will be less likely to suffer breaches by 2026.",,
