ploited; CVSS 10 Bug Impacts Azure DevOps Server](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html) Microsoft Fixes 78 Flaws, 5 Zero-Days Exploited; CVSS 10 Bug Impacts Azure DevOps Server ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/microsoft-fixes-78-flaws-5-zero-days.html)\n[ ![Third Parties and Machine Credentials: The Silent Drivers Behind 2025's Worst Breaches](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html) Third Parties and Machine Credentials: The Silent Drivers Behind 2025's Worst Breaches ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/third-parties-and-machine-credentials.html)\n[ ![Reevaluating SSEs: A Technical Gap Analysis of Last-Mile Protection](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html) Reevaluating SSEs: A Technical Gap Analysis of Last-Mile Protection ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html)\nMore Stories \u25bc\nPopular Resources\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html) Worried About Identity Theft? 6 Simple Steps to Secure Microsoft Entra ID ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/entraid-backup-reasons)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html) Get This Free Pre-Built Workflow to Instantly Automate CVE Alerts ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/tines-security-advisories)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html) Secure Google Workspace Access with Intelligent, AI-Driven Protection ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/material-google-workspace-secops)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html) Free Guide: Master the Essentials of Machine Identity Management ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/managing-machine-identities)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ Secure Faster, Smarter, Together From Code to Cloud to SOC: Learn a Smarter Way to Defend Modern Applications Cloud attacks move fast\u2014fixes lag. Unite app, cloud, and SOC security to respond quicker and stop breaches early. Reserve Your Seat ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/code-cloud-soc?source=below) [ Roadmap, Tools, and Templates Learn to Build a Reasonable Cyber Defense Program Learn how to build a compliant, defensible cybersecurity program using CIS Controls, CSAT Pro, and SecureSuite \u2014 all in one practical, expert-led session. Register for Free ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/cyber-defense-program?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybersecurity Resources\n[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgd_MnxPpQmrmAssYNnhDReESftbJ0IYVVE2JTMZhDAMmdj8TbzBYLv2RhMLaUf1ZsfYCMg4Jc5bpFT7CCdFlD4i00ghnt5eKfghy5W0NVeJ_LBbbiHyNt0r5tfWIAA2AZ_IDaFeNiyU9irbY4R7pbOE3WgZkibStdHReF0FDwuS3KXxe0p6v8U7YrqowBA\/s400-e100\/wiz-native.png)Unite Dev and Sec with ASPMRedefining Secure Development with Application Security Posture Management (ASPM). Unlock the tools and processes that will help developers ship fast and fix fast.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/wiz-devsec-aspm)[![Cybersecurity with Georgetown](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html)Want To Excel as a Cybersecurity Professional?Develop cybersecurity strategies that increase security with Georgetown.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/master-cyber-risk-1)[![Cyber Risk Reporting](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgWCMiLp9gOKtw_nvO40DkXC2mLoKNmggSyZLKCybdqYSPoiFctx2c18VGfyrnXSWdHW6ZskkzPI2f97U7qaXOD9EEgykGmI6BK0yz9G07CaOiQLIAlyYrbA_hc1ENCKeIt_SrE4D0pv4TKvqkm_eQD3_BynaPvHnEjN_BbNo1vbuqzaq8iiFLT4_ZV8eg7\/s400-rw-e365\/ad.png)Hackers Exploit AD Flaws - Fix Them Before They StrikeStop privilege escalation and lateral movement. Get the AD Security Checklist now.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/ad-checklist)[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html)[Download] SaaS Security Guide That Turns Blind Spots Into DefensesA clear, practical guide to help CISOs and IT teams secure SaaS apps, reduce risks, and protect data.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/appomni-saas-guide-dark)\nExpert Insights [Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/) [Videos](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/videos\/)\n[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html) Breach Fatalism is Over: Why Identity Threat Prevention Is the Future of Cybersecurity _\ue802_ May 19, 2025 Read \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/05\/breach-fatalism-is-over-why-identity.html)[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html) Living Off the Land: What We Learned from 700,000 Security Incidents _\ue802_ May 19, 2025 Read \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/05\/living-off-land-what-we-learned-from.html)[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html) JPMorgan CISO Spotlights SaaS Security Concerns. What Now? _\ue802_ May 19, 2025 Read \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/05\/jpmorgan-ciso-spotlights-saas-security.html)[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html) Cover Your SaaS: Why SaaS Data Protection is the Foundation of Modern Business _\ue802_ May 19, 2025 Read \u279d ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/05\/cover-your-saas-why-saas-data.html)\n",,
