"title": "France rejects Telegram CEO's accusations of Romanian election interference",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/france-rejects-durov-telegram-accusations-romania-election",,
"summary": "French officials have dismissed Pavel Durov's claims that France interfered in Romania's presidential election. Durov alleged that French intelligence requested blocking of conservative voices on Telegram. These claims were rejected by the French Foreign Ministry, which called them a diversion from real interference threats, particularly from Russia. The content further notes Durov's earlier arrest in France and his return to Dubai.",,
