"summary": "Chinese threat actor UnsolicitedBooker has been targeting an unnamed international organization in Saudi Arabia using a previously undocumented backdoor called MarsSnake. The attacks primarily leveraged spear-phishing emails with flight ticket decoys to deploy the malware. The campaign spanned over three years, with attempts made in 2023, 2024, and 2025. This group is associated with other malicious entities such as Space Pirates and an unattributed activity cluster known for deploying Zardoor. The backdoors used include Chinoxy, DeedRAT, Poison Ivy, and BeRAT.",,
