)\n[ ![NSO Group Fined $168M for Targeting 1,400 WhatsApp Users With Pegasus Spyware](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/the-crowded-battle-key-insights-from.html) NSO Group Fined $168M for Targeting 1,400 WhatsApp Users With Pegasus Spyware ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/nso-group-fined-168m-for-targeting-1400.html)\nPopular Resources\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/the-crowded-battle-key-insights-from.html) Secure Google Workspace Access with Intelligent, AI-Driven Protection ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/material-google-workspace-secops)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/the-crowded-battle-key-insights-from.html) Worried About Identity Theft? 6 Simple Steps to Secure Microsoft Entra ID ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/entraid-backup-reasons)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/the-crowded-battle-key-insights-from.html) Free Guide: Master the Essentials of Machine Identity Management ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/managing-machine-identities)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/the-crowded-battle-key-insights-from.html) Get This Free Pre-Built Workflow to Instantly Automate CVE Alerts ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/tines-security-advisories)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ Secure Faster, Smarter, Together From Code to Cloud to SOC: Learn a Smarter Way to Defend Modern Applications Cloud attacks move fast\u2014fixes lag. Unite app, cloud, and SOC security to respond quicker and stop breaches early. Register ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/code-cloud-soc?source=below) [ Roadmap, Tools, and Templates Learn to Build a Reasonable Cyber Defense Program Learn how to build a compliant, defensible cybersecurity program using CIS Controls, CSAT Pro, and SecureSuite \u2014 all in one practical, expert-led session. Register ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/cyber-defense-program?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybersecurity Resources\n[![Cybersecurity with Georgetown](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\