"markdown": "May 21, 2025 \n![logoRNA](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/logoRNA.png)\n  * [ About  ](https:\/\/news.google.com\/www.retailnews.asia\/about\/)\n  * [ Advertise  ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/advertise-with-us\/)\n  * [ Contact  ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/contacting-us\/)\n  * [ Community  ](https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/Hx3M2VKFwKiLDgyDZFJjyb)\n\n\n[ ![728x90 wp light 2 months free hosting.png](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/728x90-wp-light-2-months-free-hosting.png.jpeg) ](https:\/\/kinsta.com\/?kaid=MTMEGTZCSBUM)\n#  StarHub and Trends Join Forces to Enhance Enterprise Opportunities in the Philippines \n![StarhubLtd100316 0](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/StarhubLtd100316_0-1024x683.jpg)\n  * May 21, 2025\n\n\nReading Time: 2 minutes\nStarHub is embarking on an exciting journey to bolster its enterprise presence in Southeast Asia, having recently inked a memorandum of understanding (MoU) with the Philippines-based technology firm, Trends and Technologies Inc. This collaboration sets the stage for a unified market strategy in the Philippines, merging StarHub\u2019s cutting-edge digital infrastructure, propelled by Cloud Infinity, with Trends\u2019 expertise in cybersecurity, managed services, and system integration.\n### A Partnership for Progress\nThe dynamic duo of StarHub and Trends is geared towards empowering local businesses to embrace innovative, scalable technologies that enhance user experience (UX), strengthen cybersecurity, and drive digital transformation\u2014all with a firm grounding in local insights. \n\u201cOur partnership is a testament to our dedication to supporting enterprises and citizens where they are, offering secure and scalable solutions that deliver real results,\u201d stated Tan Kit Yong, Head of StarHub\u2019s Enterprise Business Group. \u201cAlongside Trends, we\u2019re making innovation more accessible and aligned with genuine business needs.\u201d\nHasan Fard, Chairman and CEO of Trends and Technologies, expressed his enthusiasm, asserting, \u201cWe\u2019re creating a powerful partnership that enables businesses in the Philippines to streamline operations, fortify their digital foundations, and thrive in a rapidly changing environment.\u201d\nWhat\u2019s on the horizon for this collaboration? With a shared vision for digital progress, it\u2019s clear that StarHub and Trends are on a mission to make waves across the Southeast Asian tech landscape. Who wouldn\u2019t want to buckle up for this thrilling ride into the future of enterprise technology?\n### Questions & Answers\n**What does the partnership between StarHub and Trends aim to achieve?** The partnership seeks to implement a unified market strategy in the Philippines, combining StarHub\u2019s digital infrastructure with Trends\u2019 cybersecurity and managed services to support local businesses.\n**How will this collaboration benefit local businesses?** This collaboration will help local businesses adopt scalable technologies, enhance user experience, strengthen cybersecurity, and facilitate their digital transformation.\n**What are the key statements from the leaders of both companies?** Tan Kit Yong emphasized the partnership\u2019s aim to provide real, accessible solutions, while Hasan Fard highlighted the commitment to simplifying operations and nurturing growth in a fast-evolving landscape.\nShare it: \n[ ![Untitled](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/Untitled.jpeg) ](https:\/\/en.block9.net) [ ![ledger 300 600](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/ledger_300_600.jpg) ](https:\/\/shop.ledger.com\/?r=4d5d0753ff02) [ ![sidebar 3 300x250 1](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/sidebar-3-300x250-1.png) ](https:\/\/www.comarch.com\/trade-and-services\/loyalty-marketing\/resources\/tribal-segmentation\/?utm_source=Retail+in+Asia&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=ebook+The+Road+to+AI-Driven+Tribal+Segmentation&utm_id=RetailinAsia) [ ![siderbar 2 redmart banner 300x250 1](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/siderbar-2-redmart-banner-300x250-1.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.dematic.com) [ ![side bar 1 300x250 1](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/side-bar-1-300x250-1.gif) ](https:\/\/www.msc.com)\n####  Must read \n[ ![Indias Jio](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/Indias-Jio.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/jio-accuses-rivals-unfair-deceptive-practices\/)\n##  [ Jio accuses rivals of \u201cunfair and deceptive\u201d practices ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/jio-accuses-rivals-unfair-deceptive-practices\/)\nApril 13, 2017 \n[ ![tumblr o3x9tsYguE1qf32sfo1 1280](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/tumblr_o3x9tsYguE1qf32sfo1_1280.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/tenant-manila-cafe-surfwear-shop-one\/)\n##  [ Tenant Manila is a cafe and a surfwear shop in one ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/tenant-manila-cafe-surfwear-shop-one\/)\nApril 20, 2016 \n[ ![megaportprospectus](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/08\/megaportprospectus.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/australias-megaport-expands-europe\/)\n##  [ Australia\u2019s Megaport expands to Europe ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/australias-megaport-expands-europe\/)\nAugust 1, 2016 \n[ ![maybank](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/maybank.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/maybank-debuts-wealth-offering-in-philippines\/)\n##  [ Maybank Debuts Wealth Offering in Philippines ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/maybank-debuts-wealth-offering-in-philippines\/)\nAugust 9, 2019 \n[ ![TOT](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/TOT.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/tot-wants-telcos-made-rent-pipes\/)\n##  [ TOT wants telcos to be made to rent its pipes ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/tot-wants-telcos-made-rent-pipes\/)\nSeptember 7, 2017 \n[ ![Sugar Factory Candy store and Restaurant](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/Sugar-Factory-Candy-store-and-Restaurant.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/manila-hosts-sugar-factory-asia-debut\/)\n##  [ Manila hosts Sugar Factory Asia debut ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/manila-hosts-sugar-factory-asia-debut\/)\nFebruary 20, 2017 \n[ ![philippines](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/06\/philippines.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/philippines-publishes-common-tower-rules\/)\n##  [ Philippines publishes common tower rules ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/philippines-publishes-common-tower-rules\/)\nJune 17, 2019 \n[ ![tutuban mall](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/03\/tutuban-mall.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/ayala-land-takes-control-of-tutuban-center\/)\n##  [ Ayala Land takes control of Tutuban Center ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/ayala-land-takes-control-of-tutuban-center\/)\nMarch 8, 2016 \nBehind the Buzz \nRetail News Asia \u2014 Your Daily Fix of What\u2019s Happening in Asian RetailWe\u2019re here to keep you in the loop\u2014every single day. Whether you\u2019re running a small local shop, scaling an online biz, or part of a global brand making moves in Asia, we\u2019ve got something for you.With 50+ fresh stories a week and 13.6 million readers, Retail News Asia isn\u2019t just another news site\u2014it\u2019s the go-to source for all things retail across the region. \n  * [ About  ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/about\/)\n  * [ Advertise  ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/advertise-with-us\/)\n  * [ Contact  ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/contacting-us\/)\n\n\nHot Picks \n[ ![StarhubLtd100316 0](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/StarhubLtd100316_0.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/starhub-and-trends-join-forces-to-enhance-enterprise-opportunities-in-the-philippines\/)\n###  [ StarHub and Trends Join Forces to Enhance Enterprise Opportunities in the Philippines ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/starhub-and-trends-join-forces-to-enhance-enterprise-opportunities-in-the-philippines\/)\n[ ![gold 1](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/04\/gold-1.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/gold-soars-to-11-day-high-marking-a-strong-comeback\/)\n###  [ Gold Soars to 11-Day High, Marking a Strong Comeback ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/gold-soars-to-11-day-high-marking-a-strong-comeback\/)\n[ ![Android Update scaled](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/Android_Update-scaled.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/android-phones-poised-to-introduce-a-feature-rivaling-iphones-most-impressive-trick\/)\n###  [ Android Phones Poised to Introduce a Feature Rivaling iPhone\u2019s Most Impressive Trick ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/android-phones-poised-to-introduce-a-feature-rivaling-iphones-most-impressive-trick\/)\n[ ![Vietjet Aircraft.jpg](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Vietjet-Aircraft.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/vietjet-strengthens-china-vietnam-flight-network-with-new-hanoi-chengdu-and-hanoi-xian-routes-marking-seven-direct-services-to-china-in-the-first-half-of-2025\/)\n###  [ Vietjet Strengthens China\u2013Vietnam Flight Network with New Hanoi\u2013Chengdu and Hanoi\u2013Xi\u2019an Routes, Marking Seven Direct Services to China in the First Half of 2025 ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/vietjet-strengthens-china-vietnam-flight-network-with-new-hanoi-chengdu-and-hanoi-xian-routes-marking-seven-direct-services-to-china-in-the-first-half-of-2025\/)\n[ ![EatKinda](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/EatKinda.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/eatkinda-eyes-us-growth-as-cauliflower-ice-cream-gains-traction\/)\n###  [ EatKinda eyes US growth as cauliflower ice cream gains traction ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/eatkinda-eyes-us-growth-as-cauliflower-ice-cream-gains-traction\/)\nRetail Kitchen \nWe respect your inbox as much as we value your time. That\u2019s why we only send carefully curated weekly updates, packed with the most relevant news, trends, and insights from the retail industry across Asia and beyond. \n  * [ Our Site Rules  ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/our-site-rules\/)\n  * [ Privacy Rules  ](https:\/\/www.retailnews.asia\/privacy-policy\/)\n\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2014 -2025 | \n[ Redwind BV ](https:\/\/www.redwind.nl\/)\n",,
