edentials-involved-breach\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=referral_content)\n  * [ ![Identity Cybersecurity Framework passwords authentication](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/coinbase-says-recent-data-breach-impacts-69-461-customers\/) Majority of browser extensions pose critical security risk - learn how to control it ](https:\/\/go.layerxsecurity.com\/enterprise-browser-extension-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=browser_extension_08052025)\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/coinbase-says-recent-data-breach-impacts-69-461-customers\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/coinbase-says-recent-data-breach-impacts-69-461-customers\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/coinbase-says-recent-data-breach-impacts-69-461-customers\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.06823930834813119)\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/sync.intentiq.com\/profiles_engine\/ProfilesEngineServlet?at=20&mi=10&secure=1&d