"markdown": "![U.K. NCA](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/large_Fuq_ML_3h_X0_AIA_8_N6_fd942dfd55.jpg)\nImage: National Crime Agency \/ X\n[Alexander Martin](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/alexander-martin)May 21st, 2025\n# UK police looking at 'range' of potential perpetrators behind retail cyberattacks\nPaul Foster, the head of the national cybercrime unit at Britain\u2019s National Crime Agency (NCA), said the ongoing investigation into a spate of recent cyberattacks against the retail sector was considering \u201ca range\u201d of different perpetrators who could have been responsible. \nAmong these is an international threat group tracked as Scattered Spider, Foster [acknowledged](https:\/\/www.bbc.co.uk\/news\/articles\/ckgnndrgxv3o) to BBC News, but he stressed the NCA was considering different hypotheses and was going to \u201cfollow the evidence to get to the offenders.\u201d \nThe similarities between attacks previously attributed to Scattered Spider and a spate of incidents impacting British retailers [Marks & Spencer](https:\/\/therecord.media\/british-retailer-marks-spencer-insurance), the [Co-op](https:\/\/therecord.media\/co-op-cyberattack-uk-company-fears-hackers-still-in-system) and the London-based luxury store [Harrods](https:\/\/therecord.media\/harrods-cyberattack-uk-retailer), have prompted speculation that the loosely-affiliated criminal subculture is involved, however there has not yet been a confident assessment from professionals that this is the case. \nThese attacks have led to widespread concern and disruption, with shelves in numerous M&S and Co-op stores running empty due to those companies\u2019 logistics systems either being directly impacted by the hackers or taken offline as a precautionary measure. \nGoogle [warned](https:\/\/therecord.media\/scattered-spider-suspected-retail-hackers-google-alert) last week that while it suspected the attacks were \u201clinked to UNC3944, also known as Scattered Spider,\u201d it could not confirm whether they were part of the same criminal grouping. \nEarlier this month the National Cyber Security Centre said it was \u201cnot yet in a position to say if these attacks are linked, if this is a concerted campaign by a single actor or whether there is no link between them at all.\u201d The agency did not respond to an enquiry on Wednesday regarding whether that was still the case. \n**Read more:** [M&S says cyberattack will hit profits by \u00a3300 million, disruption to last until July](https:\/\/therecord.media\/marks-spencer-cyberattack-hit-to-profits-300m)\nThe broader Scattered Spider group is believed to be responsible for ransomware attacks two years ago on casino giants [MGM Resorts](https:\/\/therecord.media\/mgm-cyberattack-response) and [Caesars Entertainment](https:\/\/finance.yahoo.com\/news\/caesars-entertainment-paid-millions-ransom-185252473.html), prompting [a warning](https:\/\/therecord.media\/cisa-fbi-warn-of-scattered-spider-cybercrime-group) from U.S. cybersecurity officials about the criminals\u2019 SIM-swapping and social engineering activities. \nLast July, police in the United Kingdom [arrested a teenager](https:\/\/therecord.media\/mgm-hack-teenager-arrest-britain) for his alleged role in the MGM attack. Five other alleged members, all U.S. citizens, were last November [charged](https:\/\/therecord.media\/five-scattered-spider-members-charged-breaches-11-million-theft) for their alleged involvement with the group. \nThe group appeared to have disbanded following those arrests, but it had caught widespread attention with several high-profile attacks, including on the networks of [Coinbase](https:\/\/therecord.media\/coinbase-explains-how-0ktapus-hacker-accessed-corporate-directory), [Twilio](https:\/\/therecord.media\/twilio-signal-phishing), [Mailchimp](https:\/\/therecord.media\/more-than-100-mailchimp-accounts-accessed-via-social-engineering-cyberattack), [LastPass](https:\/\/therecord.media\/lastpass-attacker-hacked-engineers-home-computer-keylogger), [Riot Games](https:\/\/therecord.media\/riot-games-to-pause-updates-after-social-engineering-attack) and [Reddit](https:\/\/therecord.media\/reddit-suffers-sophisticated-and-highly-targeted-phishing-attack-exposing-source-code). \n  * [](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=&t=UK police looking at 'range' of potential perpetrators behind retail cyberattacks)\n  * [](https:\/\/bsky.app\/intent\/compose?text=UK police looking at 'range' of potential perpetrators behind retail cyberattacks )\n\n\n  * [Cybercrime](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/cybercrime)\n  * [Industry](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n  * [Government](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/government)\n  * [News](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n\n\nGet more insights with the \nRecorded Future\nIntelligence Cloud.\n[Learn more.](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/platform?mtm_campaign=ad-unit-record)\nTags\n  * [United Kingdom](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/united-kingdom)\n  * [retail](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/retail)\n  * [investigation](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/investigation)\n  * [National Crime Agency (NCA)](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/national-crime-agency)\n  * [Police](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/police)\n  * [Scattered Spider](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/scattered-spider)\n  * [Marks & Spencer (M&S)](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/marks-and-spencer)\n  * [Co-op](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/co-op)\n\n\nNo previous article\nNo new articles\n[![Alexander Martin](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/headshot_79eb085f87.jpeg)](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/alexander-martin)\n[Alexander Martin](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/alexander-martin)\nis the UK Editor for Recorded Future News. He was previously a technology reporter for Sky News and is also a fellow at the European Cyber Conflict Research Initiative.\n## Briefs\n  * [Senators question Noem about CISA cuts, but get few detailsMay 20th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/noem-cisa-cuts-senate-hearing)\n  * [Ohio\u2019s Kettering Health system facing widespread outages after cyberattackMay 20th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/kettering-health-system-ohio-cyberattack)\n  * [Cyberthreat to Alabama state government \u2018neutralized\u2019May 20th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/alabama-cyberattack-neutralized)\n  * [Major Russian state services disrupted, reportedly due to cyberattackMay 20th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/major-russian-state-services-disrupted-ddos)\n  * [Dutch government passes law to criminalize cyber-espionageMay 20th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/netherlands-law-criminalizes-cyber-espionage)\n  * [Hack of SEC social media account earns 14-month prison sentence for Alabama manMay 16th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/sec-social-media-hack-sentencing)\n  * [OPM urged to continue identity protection contracts shielding people affected by 2015 hackMay 16th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/opm-federal-employee-data-protection-contracts-2015-hack-warner)\n  * [EU court rules that tracking-based online ads are illegalMay 16th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/eu-court-rules-tracking-based-ads-illegal)\n  * [UK National Health Service suppliers asked to tackle \u2018endemic\u2019 ransomware attacksMay 16th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/uk-nhs-suppliers-ransomware-letter)\n\n\n## [Measuring the US-China AI Gap![Measuring the US-China AI Gap](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_ta_2025_0508_Main_Feature_0873ea3526.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/measuring-the-us-china-ai-gap)\n## [TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered![TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/cta_2025_0501_Blog_Main_Feature_55a0e64897.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/terrastealerv2-and-terralogger)\n## [Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting![Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_cta_2025_0429_Main_Feature_e924c36cbd.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/uncovering-mintsloader-with-recorded-future-malware-intelligence-hunting)\n## [Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives![Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/irans_ai_ambitions_balancing_economic_isolation_national_security_imperatives_151fba814d.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/irans-ai-ambitions-balancing-economic-isolation-national-security-imperatives)\n## [2024 Malicious Infrastructure Report![2024 Malicious Infrastructure Report](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/2024_malicious_infrastructure_report_95f6761bdf.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/2024-malicious-infrastructure-report)\n",,
