"title": "Russia to enforce location tracking app on all foreigners in Moscow",,
"url": "https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/government\/russia-to-enforce-location-tracking-app-on-all-foreigners-in-moscow\/",,
"summary": "The Russian government has proposed a new law requiring all foreign nationals in the Moscow region to install a tracking app on their smartphones. The app will collect data including residence location, fingerprint, face photograph, and real-time geo-location. The measure is aimed at controlling migrant crimes but excludes diplomats and Belarusian citizens. There are concerns about privacy violations and implementation challenges. The mass-surveillance experiment is scheduled to run until September 2029.",,
