"title": "New Google program targeting children with AI chatbot may violate FTC privacy rules",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/new-google-children-program-gemini",,
"summary": "Google's new AI-powered Gemini chatbot program aimed at children under 13 has sparked concern from privacy and children\u2019s rights advocates due to potential violations of FTC privacy regulations. The program allows children with parent-controlled Google accounts to access the chatbot without requiring verifiable parental consent, which could lead to issues with data collection and privacy. Concerns include potential exposure to unsuitable content and lack of additional safeguards for children's data.",,
