"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/aispm-for-dummies.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/ai-security-posture-management-ai-spm-for-dummies?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY26Q1_INB_FORM_AI-SPM-for-Dummies-eBook&sfcid=701Py00000KWgAHIA1&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AI-SPMDummies)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * Anthropic web config hints at Claude Sonnet 4 and Opus 4\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/anthropic-web-config-hints-at-claude-sonnet-4-and-opus-4\/)\n\n\n# Anthropic web config hints at Claude Sonnet 4 and Opus 4\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * May 21, 2025\n  * 07:01 PM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/anthropic-web-config-hints-at-claude-sonnet-4-and-opus-4\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Claude](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/posts\/2025\/05\/21\/Claude-4.jpg)\nAnthropic is secretly working on new models called Claude Sonnet 4 and Opus 4, which are believed to be the company's most advanced AI models.\nThis is according to Anthropic web configuration files, which were recently with references to Claude Sonnet 4 and Opus 4.\n![Claude 4](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/Claude-4.jpg)\nAs you can see in the above image showing the internal configuration file, Anthropic has specifically [mentioned ](https:\/\/archive.is\/f1ibF)\"Claude 4,\" \"Claude Sonnet 4,\" and \"Claude Opus 4.\"\nThese appear to be part of the Claude 4 series, which we think could be Anthropic\u2019s smartest models yet.\nThe references suggest Claude Sonnet 4 and Opus 4 are being tested or promoted internally, with some warnings like \u201cNot intended for production use\u201d and \u201cstrict rate limits,\u201d meaning they\u2019re still under development or early access.\nThere are also references to features like \"show_raw_thinking,\" which point to reasoning capabilities.\nOn May 22, Anthropic is a 'Code with Claude' event, but we don't know if the event is related to the new models.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[Claude copies ChatGPT with $200 Max plan, but users aren't happy](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/claude-copies-chatgpt-with-200-max-plan-but-users-arent-happy\/)\n[Claude is testing ChatGPT-like Deep Research feature Compass](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/claude-is-testing-chatgpt-like-deep-research-feature-compass\/)\n[OpenAI hints at a big upgrade for ChatGPT Operator Agent](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-hints-at-a-big-upgrade-for-chatgpt-operator-agent\/)\n[OpenAI plans to combine multiple models into GPT-5](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-plans-to-combine-multiple-models-into-gpt-5\/)\n[Leak confirms OpenAI's ChatGPT will integrate MCP](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-confirms-openais-chatgpt-will-integrate-mcp\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [Anthropic](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/anthropic\/)\n  * [Claude](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/claude\/)\n  * [Claude Opus 4](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/claude-opus-4\/)\n  * [Claude Sonnet](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/claude-sonnet\/)\n  * [Claude Sonnet 4](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/claude-sonnet-4\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/anthropic-web-config-hints-at-claude-sonnet-4-and-opus-4\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-hints-at-a-big-upgrade-for-chatgpt-operator-agent\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Delivery Chains](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/delivery-chains.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/advancements-in-delivery-scripting-with-nietzsche\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trun-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/anthropic-web-config-hints-at-claude-sonnet-4-and-opus-4\/) Microsoft confirms new \"Advanced\" Settings for Windows 11 ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-confirms-new-advanced-settings-for-windows-11\/)\n  * [ ![Keepass Hacker](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/anthropic-web-config-hints-at-claude-sonnet-4-and-opus-4\/) Fake KeePass password manager leads to ESXi ransomware attack ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/fake-keepass-password-manager-leads-to-esxi-ransomware-attack\/)\n  * [ ![Windows](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/anthropic-web-config-hints-at-claude-sonnet-4-and-opus-4\/) Windows 10 emergency updates fix BitLocker recovery issues ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-10-emergency-updates-fix-bitlocker-recovery-issues\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Identity Cybersecurity Framework passwords authentication](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/anthropic-web-config-hints-at-claude-sonnet-4-and-opus-4\/) Majority of browser extensions pose critical security risk - learn how to control it ](https:\/\/go.layerxsecurity.com\/enterprise-browser-extension-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=browser_extension_08052025)\n  * [ ![Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers?](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/anthropic-web-config-hints-at-claude-sonnet-4-and-opus-4\/) Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers? ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/demo\/generative-ai-monitoring?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=validated_phishing_may)\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/anthropic-web-config-hints-at-claude-sonnet-4-and-opus-4\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n  * [ ![Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/anthropic-web-config-hints-at-claude-sonnet-4-and-opus-4\/) Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automa