it SAP CVE-2025-31324 to Breach 581 Critical Systems Worldwide ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/china-linked-apts-exploit-sap-cve-2025.html)\n[ ![Security Tools Alone Don't Protect You \u2014 Control Effectiveness Does](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/fbi-and-europol-disrupt-lumma-stealer.html) Security Tools Alone Don't Protect You \u2014 Control Effectiveness Does ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/security-tools-alone-dont-protect-you.html)\n[ ![5 BCDR Essentials for Effective Ransomware Defense](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/fbi-and-europol-disrupt-lumma-stealer.html) 5 BCDR Essentials for Effective Ransomware Defense ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/top-5-bcdr-capabilities-for-ransomware-defense.html)\n[ ![Researchers Expose New Intel CPU Flaws Enabling Memory Leaks and Spectre v2 Attacks](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/fbi-and-europol-disrupt-lumma-stealer.html) Researchers Expose New Intel CPU Flaws Enabling Memory Leaks and Spectre v2 Attacks ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/researchers-expose-new-intel-cpu-flaws.html)\n[ ![Reevaluating SSEs: A Technical Gap Analysis of Last-Mile Protection](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/fbi-and-europol-disrupt-lumma-stealer.html) Reevaluating SSEs: A Technical Gap Analysis of Last-Mile Protection ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html)\n[ ![Fortinet Patches CVE-2025-32756 Zero-Day RCE Flaw Exploited in FortiVoice Systems](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/fbi-and-europol-disrupt-lumma-stealer.html) Fortinet Patches CVE-2025-32756 Zero-Day RCE Flaw Exploited in FortiVoice Systems ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/fortinet-patches-cve-2025-32756-zero.html)\n[ ![Learning How to Hack: Why Offensive Security Training Benefits Your Entire Security Team](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/fbi-and-europol-disrupt-lumma-stealer.html) Learning How to Hack: Why Offensive Security Training Benefits Your Entire Security 