news.com\/search\/label\/Supply%20Chain%20Security)[Vulnerability](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Vulnerability)\nTrending News\n[ ![Learning How to Hack: Why Offensive Security Training Benefits Your Entire Security Team](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Learning How to Hack: Why Offensive Security Training Benefits Your Entire Security Team ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/learning-how-to-hack-why-offensive.html)\n[ ![Malicious npm Package Leverages Unicode Steganography, Google Calendar as C2 Dropper](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Malicious npm Package Leverages Unicode Steganography, Google Calendar as C2 Dropper ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/malicious-npm-package-leverages-unicode.html)\n[ ![\u26a1 Weekly Recap: Zero-Day Exploits, Insider Threats, APT Targeting, Botnets and More](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) \u26a1 Weekly Recap: Zero-Day Exploits, Insider Threats, APT Targeting, Botnets and More ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-zero-day-exploits-insider.html)\n[ ![Security Tools Alone Don't Protect You \u2014 Control Effectiveness Does](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Security Tools Alone Don't Protect You \u2014 Control Effectiveness Does ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/security-tools-alone-dont-protect-you.html)\n[ ![Coinbase Agents Bribed, Data of ~1% Users Leaked; $20M Extortion Attempt Fails](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Coinbase Agents Bribed, Data of ~1% Users Leaked; $20M Extortion Attempt Fails ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/coinbase-agents-bribed-data-of-1-users.html)\n[ ![5 BCDR Essentials for Effective Ransomware Defense](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) 5 BCDR Essentials for Effective Ransomware Defense ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/top-5-bcdr-capabilities-for-ransomware-defense.html)\n[ ![Reevaluating SSEs: A Technical Gap Analysis of Last-Mile Protection](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Reevaluating SSEs: A Technical Gap Analysis of Last-Mile Protection ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/reevaluating-sses-technical-gap.html)\n[ ![China-Linked APTs Exploit SAP CVE-2025-31324 to Breach 581 Critical Systems Worldwide](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) China-Linked APTs Exploit SAP CVE-2025-31324 to Breach 581 Critical Systems Worldwide ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/china-linked-apts-exploit-sap-cve-2025.html)\n[ ![Fortinet Patches CVE-2025-32756 Zero-Day RCE Flaw Exploited in FortiVoice Systems](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Fortinet Patches CVE-2025-32756 Zero-Day RCE Flaw Exploited in FortiVoice Systems ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/fortinet-patches-cve-2025-32756-zero.html)\n[ ![Malicious PyPI Package Posing as Solana Tool Stole Source Code in 761 Downloads](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Malicious PyPI Package Posing as Solana Tool Stole Source Code in 761 Downloads ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/malicious-pypi-package-posing-as-solana.html)\n[ ![Researchers Expose New Intel CPU Flaws Enabling Memory Leaks and Spectre v2 Attacks](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Researchers Expose New Intel CPU Flaws Enabling Memory Leaks and Spectre v2 Attacks ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/researchers-expose-new-intel-cpu-flaws.html)\n[ ![New Chrome Vulnerability Enables Cross-Origin Data Leak via Loader Referrer Policy](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) New Chrome Vulnerability Enables Cross-Origin Data Leak via Loader Referrer Policy ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/new-chrome-vulnerability-enables-cross.html)\n[ ![Microsoft Fixes 78 Flaws, 5 Zero-Days Exploited; CVSS 10 Bug Impacts Azure DevOps Server](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Microsoft Fixes 78 Flaws, 5 Zero-Days Exploited; CVSS 10 Bug Impacts Azure DevOps Server ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/microsoft-fixes-78-flaws-5-zero-days.html)\nPopular Resources\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Free Guide: Master the Essentials of Machine Identity Management ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/managing-machine-identities)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Secure Google Workspace Access with Intelligent, AI-Driven Protection ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/material-google-workspace-secops)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Worried About Identity Theft? 6 Simple Steps to Secure Microsoft Entra ID ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/entraid-backup-reasons)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Get This Free Pre-Built Workflow to Instantly Automate CVE Alerts ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/tines-security-advisories)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ AI Is Fast \u2014 So Are the Threats Learn How Hackers Are Targeting Hidden AI Identity Accounts AI boosts speed and scale\u2014but also risk. Hidden identity accounts can expose your systems if left unsecured. Register ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=below) [ Roadmap, Tools, and Templates Learn to Build a Reasonable Cyber Defense Program Learn how to build a compliant, defensible cybersecurity program using CIS Controls, CSAT Pro, and SecureSuite \u2014 all in one practical, expert-led session. Register ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/cyber-defense-program?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybersecurity Resources\n[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEhA5OIVtyU5AY0ONmLelcfUOwre7wYqO_M411yy8bwoNu-vkGQcwOg9xcWFfjfbfoehomHhnpTY9q4DaT8vws_KVdmCWkV9QKmelygAso9moiFVmxv7G1dKIA8_2dYHCYM2eGZQGMFst8hQr5qZBg8EcFBDPG0WgLDt5EEfY4ifPGiAWnpd62dBZ-Frh-S6\/s400-rw-e365\/5StagesofCTEM.gif)Discover How to Make CTEM a Reality in 2025: Download Your Guide Now!Ensure CTEM success! Download our ebook for practical tips on using XM Cyber to implement your exposure management strategy.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/ctem-stages-gif-2)[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html)[Download] SaaS Security Guide That Turns Blind Spots Into DefensesA clear, practical guide to help CISOs and IT teams secure SaaS apps, reduce risks, and protect data.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/appomni-saas-guide-dark)[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgd_MnxPpQmrmAssYNnhDReESftbJ0IYVVE2JTMZhDAMmdj8TbzBYLv2RhMLaUf1ZsfYCMg4Jc5bpFT7CCdFlD4i00ghnt5eKfghy5W0NVeJ_LBbbiHyNt0r5tfWIAA2AZ_IDaFeNiyU9irbY4R7pbOE3WgZkibStdHReF0FDwuS3KXxe0p6v8U7YrqowBA\/s400-e100\/wiz-native.png)Unite Dev and Sec with ASPMRedefining Secure Development with Application Security Posture Management (ASPM). Unlock the tools and processes that will help developers ship fast and fix fast.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/wiz-devsec-aspm)[![Cybersecurity with Georgetown](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html)Want To Excel as a Cybersecurity Professional?Develop cybersecurity strategies that increase security with Georgetown.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/master-cyber-risk-1)\nExpert Insights [Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/) [Videos](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/videos\/)\n[ ![Expert Insights](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/gitlab-duo-vulnerability-enabled.html) Living Off the Land: What We Learned from 700,000 Security Incidents _\ue802_ May 19, 2025 Read \u279d ](h