"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/aispm-for-dummies.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/ai-security-posture-management-ai-spm-for-dummies?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY26Q1_INB_FORM_AI-SPM-for-Dummies-eBook&sfcid=701Py00000KWgAHIA1&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AI-SPMDummies)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Microsoft](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/)\n  * Windows 11 Notepad gets AI-powered text writing capabilities\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/)\n\n\n# Windows 11 Notepad gets AI-powered text writing capabilities\nBy \n###### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n  * May 23, 2025\n  * 04:26 AM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2024\/02\/23\/AI_robot_Windows_11.jpg)\nMicrosoft is testing a new AI-powered text generation feature in Notepad that can let Windows Insiders create content based on custom prompts.\nDubbed \"Write,\" the new Notepad feature is rolling out to Windows 11 Insiders in the Canary and Dev Channels, who have upgraded to Notepad version 11.2504.46.0.\n\"The new write feature helps you quickly draft text based on your prompt, making it easy to start from a blank page or build upon existing content with AI-powered assistance. To get started, place your cursor where you want to insert new text or select content you'd like to use as a reference,\" [said](https:\/\/blogs.windows.com\/windows-insider\/2025\/05\/22\/paint-snipping-tool-and-notepad-updates-with-new-features-begin-rolling-out-to-windows-insiders\/) Dave Grochocki, Principal Group Product Manager for Windows Inbox Apps.\n\"Then right-click and choose Write, select Write from the Copilot menu, or use the Ctrl + Q keyboard shortcut. Enter your instruction into the dialog and click Send. The AI-generated output will appear directly on the canvas.\"\nYou can add the generated text to the document by clicking the \"Keep text\" button and hitting \"Discard\" if it doesn't fit your requirements. You can also enter additional prompts to refine the output.\nGrochocki added that users must sign in to their Microsoft personal account to use the Writee tool, which will use AI credits linked to their Microsoft 365 Personal, Family, and Copilot Pro subscriptions.\n![Notepad Write](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1109292\/2025\/Notepad_Write.jpg)_Notepad Write (Microsoft)_\nOver the last few years, Microsoft has been actively working to add more AI features to the Windows 11 Notepad application. For example, in November, it included a [new text rewriting tool](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-notepad-to-get-ai-powered-rewriting-tool-on-windows-11\/) called \"Rewrite\" with the release of Notepad version 11.2410.15.0.\nFormerly known as [CoWriter](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/the-new-features-coming-in-windows-11-24h2-expected-this-fall\/#:~:text=unified%20application%20approach.-,Notepad%20with%20AI,-Microsoft%20is%20also), it uses generative AI to rewrite content automatically, and it can rephrase sentences, modify the length of the text, and adjust the tone.\nAdditionally, in December 2023, Microsoft introduced a [built-in character counter](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-a-built-in-character-counter-finally\/), and in July 2024, they rolled out a [spell-check and autocorrect feature](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/notepad-finally-gets-spellcheck-autocorrect-for-all-windows-11-users\/).\nIf you don't want Notepad's AI options in the user interface, you can disable them from the app's settings or uninstall the Notepad app to use the Windows built-in notepad.exe program.\nOn Thursday, the company also started rolling out new AI capabilities for Paint and Snipping Tool users enrolled in the Windows Insider program.\nThose who have installed Paint version 11.2504.451.0 can create custom stickers by clicking the \"Sticker generator button\" in the Copilot menu and isolate individual image elements more easily using an AI-powered selection tool.\nSnipping Tool version 11.2504.38.0 adds perfect screenshot and color picker features, which will automatically resize the current screenshot based on the selected content and select the HEX, RGB, or HSL color code of any pixel on the screen.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[Microsoft unveils Windows AI Foundry for AI-powered PC apps](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-unveils-windows-ai-foundry-for-ai-powered-pc-apps\/)\n[Microsoft starts testing Windows 11 taskbar icon scaling](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-starts-testing-windows-11-taskbar-icon-scaling\/)\n[Microsoft's killing script used to avoid Microsoft Account in Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsofts-killing-script-used-to-avoid-microsoft-account-in-windows-11\/)\n[OpenAI plans to combine multiple models into GPT-5](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-plans-to-combine-multiple-models-into-gpt-5\/)\n[ChatGPT will soon record, transcribe, and summarize your meetings](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-soon-record-transcribe-and-summarize-your-meetings\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * [Microsoft](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/microsoft\/)\n  * [Notepad](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/notepad\/)\n  * [Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/windows-11\/)\n  * [Windows Insider](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/windows-insider\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n##### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\nSergiu is a news reporter who has covered the latest cybersecurity and technology developments for over a decade. Email or Twitter DMs for tips. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/police-takes-down-300-servers-in-ransomware-supply-chain-crackdown\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Astaroth Unleashed story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/Astaroth-unleashed.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/astaroth-unleashed\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trua-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Hacker box](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/) Trojanized RVTools push Bumblebee malware in SEO poisoning campaign ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/trojanized-rvtools-push-bumblebee-malware-in-seo-poisoning-campaign\/)\n  * [ ![School Hacker](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/) PowerSchool hacker pleads guilty to student data extortion scheme ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/powerschool-hacker-pleads-guilty-to-student-data-extortion-scheme\/)\n  * [ ![Russian flag](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/) Russia to enforce location tracking app on all foreigners in Moscow ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/government\/russia-to-enforce-location-tracking-app-on-all-foreigners-in-moscow\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/) Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today ](https:\/\/www.threatlocker.com\/pages\/threatlocker-platform-patch-management?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=sponsor&utm_campaign=patch_management_q2_25&utm_content=patch_management&utm_term=display)\n  * [ ![Identity Cybersecurity Framework passwords authentication](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/) Majority of browser extensions pose critical security risk - learn how to control it ](https:\/\/go.layerxsecurity.com\/enterprise-browser-extension-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=browser_extension_08052025)\n  * [ ![Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers?](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/) Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers? ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/demo\/generative-ai-monitoring?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=validated_phishing_may)\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-notepad-gets-ai-powered-text-writing-capabilities\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.41003277406415417)\n",,
