"markdown": "  * [Blog](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog)\n  * [Palo Alto Networks](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/corporate)\n  * [Announcement](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/category\/announcement\/)\n  * A 3X Leader in Gartner 20... \n\n\n# A 3X Leader in Gartner 2025 Magic Quadrant for SSE\n[ ](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/2025\/05\/3x-leader-gartner-2025-magic-quadrant-sse\/)\nLink copied \nBy [Anupam Upadhyaya](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/author\/anupam-upadhyaya\/ \"Posts by Anupam Upadhyaya\")\nMay 23, 2025\n4 minutes\n... views\n[Announcement](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/category\/announcement\/)\n[News & Events](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/sase\/category\/news-events\/)\n[Product Features](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/sase\/category\/product-features\/)\n[Reports](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/category\/reports\/)\n[Gartner Magic Quadrant](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/tag\/gartner-magic-quadrant\/)\n[SSE](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/tag\/sse\/)\n#### Palo Alto Networks Received the Highest Overall Score for Prisma\u00ae Access in Advanced SSE Use Case in Critical Capabilities\nToday, we\u2019re proud to share that Palo Alto Networks has been named a Leader in the [2025 Gartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for Security Service Edge (SSE](http:\/\/start.paloaltonetworks.com\/gartner-sse-mq-leader-2025.html)) for the third year in a row. We're also ranked the highest by Gartner for the Advanced SSE Critical Capabilities. We believe this recognition reflects the strength of our vision, our commitment to innovation, and the differentiated value[ Prisma Access](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/sase\/access) delivers to you, our customers, across security, user experience and operational efficiency.\n## Consistent Recognition Across Categories\nPalo Alto Networks is proud to be the only vendor recognized as a Leader in all three Gartner Magic Quadrant reports: [2025 Magic Quadrant for SSE](http:\/\/start.paloaltonetworks.com\/gartner-sse-mq-leader-2025.html), [2024 Magic Quadrant for Single-Vendor SASE](https:\/\/start.paloaltonetworks.com\/gartner-sase-mq-2024) and [2024 Magic Quadrant for SD-WAN](https:\/\/start.paloaltonetworks.com\/gartner-sd-wan-mq-2024). We believe this recognition reinforces our strategy that a unified, platform-based approach delivers proven security, exceptional user experiences and operational resiliency, as well as simplicity.\nBy unifying networking and security in the cloud, powered by Precision AI\u00ae and backed by unmatched threat intelligence, Palo Alto Networks helps organizations secure their future of work confidently.\n### **What Sets Prisma Access Apart**\nSecuring access everywhere is what drives our relentless innovation at Palo Alto Networks. With Prisma Access, organizations benefit from best-in-class security powered by Precision AI, delivered through a unified, cloud-native solution that protects all users, applications and data wherever they are.\nWe believe our continued innovation is a result of what Prisma Access provides:\n  * **Best-in-Class Security \u2013** Powered by Precision AI and backed with the industry\u2019s largest wealth of threat intelligence among pure-play cybersecurity vendors, Prisma Access blocks up to _30.9 billion threats every day_ and helps organizations reduce data breaches.\n  * **Operational Resiliency \u2013** With _industry-leading SLAs of 99.999%,_ Prisma Access leverages a massive, multicloud hyperscale backbone to prevent outages and ensure high availability.\n  * **Exceptional User Experience \u2013** Prisma Access _accelerates app performance by up to 5x_ , reduces latency and boosts productivity compared to direct-to-internet connections. With Autonomous Digital Experience Management (ADEM) and real-user monitoring (RUM), Prisma Access enables precise root cause analysis and resolution of app performance issues, ensuring an exceptional user experience.\n\n\nPalo Alto Networks is proud to lead this transformative journey \u2013 empowering organizations to embrace secure digital transformation with confidence. As threats evolve and business demands accelerate, we remain focused on delivering continuous innovation and setting new standards in security. In our opinion, our position as a 3X Leader in the Magic Quadrant is reinforced by the highest rank for Advanced SSE in the 2025 Gartner Critical Capabilities, reflecting our ongoing commitment to driving the future of cybersecurity forward.\n## Get the Report \u2014 Evolving SSE Solutions\nDownload your complimentary copy of the [2025 Gartner Magic Quadrant for Security Service Edge](http:\/\/start.paloaltonetworks.com\/gartner-sse-mq-leader-2025.html) to learn how SSE solutions are evolving and see how Palo Alto Networks and other vendors were evaluated as you begin or continue on your SSE transformation journey.\nGartner, Magic Quadrant for Security Service Edge, 20 May 2025, [Charlie Winckless](https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/analyst\/b9c902be7aa1), [Thomas Lintemuth](https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/analyst\/b0c001bc7e), [Dale Koeppen](https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/analyst\/b9c907b57ca5), [Charanpal Bhogal](https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/analyst\/bcca06bc7e)\nGartner, Magic Quadrant for SD-WAN, 30 September 2024, [Jonathan Forest](https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/analyst\/b0cf07bb73), [Karen Brown](https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/analyst\/b9c903bf7fa2), [Nauman Raja](https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/analyst\/b9c800ba78ae)\nGartner, Magic Quadrant for Single-Vendor SASE, 3 July 2024, [Andrew Lerner](https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/analyst\/bccc04bf7b), [Neil MacDonald](https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/analyst\/bfcb09b4), [Jonathan Forest](https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/analyst\/b0cf07bb73), [Charlie Winckless](https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/analyst\/b9c902be7aa1)\nGARTNER is a registered trademark and service mark of Gartner, Inc., and\/or its affiliates in the U.S. and internationally, and Magic Quadrant is a registered trademark of Gartner, Inc. All rights reserved. Gartner does not endorse any vendor, product or service depicted in its research publications and does not advise technology users to select only those vendors with the highest ratings or other designation. Gartner research publications consist of the opinions of Gartner\u2019s research organization and should not be construed as statements of fact. Gartner disclaims all warranties, express or implied, with respect to this research, including any warranties of merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose.\n## Related Blogs\n###  [Announcement](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/category\/announcement\/), [News & Events](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/sase\/category\/news-events\/), [Product Features](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/sase\/category\/product-features\/), [Products and Services](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/category\/products-and-services\/)\n#### [Palo Alto Networks Named a Leader in 2023 Magic Quadrant for SSE](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/2023\/04\/leader-in-the-2023-gartner-magic-quadrant-for-sse\/)\n###  [Announcement](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/category\/announcement\/), [Reports](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/category\/reports\/), [Unit 42](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/category\/unit42\/)\n#### [\u200b\u200b2025 Unit 42 Incident Response Report \u2014 Attacks Shift to Disruption](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/2025\/02\/incident-response-report-attacks-shift-disruption\/)\n###  [Announcement](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/category\/announcement\/), [IoT Security](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/network-security\/category\/iot-security\/), [Products and Services](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/category\/products-and-services\/), [Reports](https:\/\/www.paloaltonetworks.com\/blog\/category\/reports\/)\n###