"summary": "Hackers have been leveraging TikTok videos to distribute Vidar and StealC malware using the ClickFix technique. The campaign involves tricking users into executing PowerShell commands to compromise their systems, distributing malware as a result. The use of artificial intelligence to generate TikTok videos has been identified in this social engineering attack. The targeted malware makes memory-based execution more difficult to detect and aims at attaining illicit control over systems. Fake Ledger apps targeting Mac users have also been discovered, designed to intercept and steal cryptocurrency data.",,
