"summary": "OpenAI has updated its Operator Agent to use the o3 model, enhancing its reasoning capabilities and improving accuracy and persistence in web task automation. While this upgrade is available to ChatGPT Pro users, OpenAI plans to make Operator accessible to ChatGPT Plus subscribers as well. The article discusses the upgrade but does not directly focus on cybersecurity-related content.",,
