"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/gen-ai-best-practices.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/genai-security-best-practices-cheat-sheet?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY25Q3_INB_FORM_GenAI-Security-Best-Practices-Cheat-Sheet&sfcid=701Py00000ENEjlIAH&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=GenAIBestPractices)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * Leak suggests xAI is getting ready to ship Grok 3.5\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-suggests-xai-is-getting-ready-to-ship-grok-35\/)\n\n\n# Leak suggests xAI is getting ready to ship Grok 3.5\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * May 25, 2025\n  * 05:51 PM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-suggests-xai-is-getting-ready-to-ship-grok-35\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Grok](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/posts\/2025\/05\/25\/Grok-AI.jpg)\nxAI, founded by Elon Musk, is preparing to launch Grok 3.5, the company's next state-of-the-art AI model.\nGrok AI has been around for a year now. While it was late to the game, the Grok model is pretty decent, and it's quite impressive what the company has achieved in a limited time.\nRight now, xAI offers Grok 3 to free and paid customers, but it has been planning to launch Grok 3.5 for a while now.\nIn fact, Grok 3.5 was planned for release in May 2025, but we haven't seen any announcements from the company.\nHowever, it looks like the wait is finally over.\n![Grok 3.5](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/Grok-3_5.jpg)\nAs by some users on X, Grok contains references to \"grok-3-5-api-2k-p2\", which appears to be part of a data or JSON file.\nThough it hasn\u2019t been announced, this kind of reference suggests that Grok 3.5 is coming soon, or already being tested with some users.\nCurrently, Grok AI doesn't do well in coding as much as Gemini and Claude or even GPT, but it's a quite decent tool for image generation, research, PDFs, and for everyday use.\nGrok 3.5 launch could bridge the gap, but it remains to be seen if xAI can even get close to Gemini or Claude for coding.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[ChatGPT Deep Research can now pull data from Dropbox and Box](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-deep-research-can-now-pull-data-from-dropbox-and-box\/)\n[Researchers claim ChatGPT o3 bypassed shutdown in controlled test](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/researchers-claim-chatgpt-o3-bypassed-shutdown-in-controlled-test\/)\n[OpenAI confirms Operator Agent is now more accurate with o3](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-confirms-operator-agent-is-now-more-accurate-with-o3\/)\n[OpenAI hints at a big upgrade for ChatGPT Operator Agent](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-hints-at-a-big-upgrade-for-chatgpt-operator-agent\/)\n[OpenAI plans to combine multiple models into GPT-5](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-plans-to-combine-multiple-models-into-gpt-5\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * [ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chatgpt\/)\n  * [Elon Musk](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/elon-musk\/)\n  * [Grok](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/grok\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-suggests-xai-is-getting-ready-to-ship-grok-35\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-deep-research-can-now-pull-data-from-dropbox-and-box\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Astaroth Unleashed story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/Astaroth-unleashed.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/astaroth-unleashed\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trua-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![TikTok](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-suggests-xai-is-getting-ready-to-ship-grok-35\/) TikTok videos now push infostealer malware in ClickFix attacks ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/tiktok-videos-now-push-infostealer-malware-in-clickfix-attacks\/)\n  * [ ![Panda China Hacker](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-suggests-xai-is-getting-ready-to-