"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/ai-security-risk-ebook.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/getting-started-with-ai-security-ai-risks-how-to-prevent-them-and-ai-for-defender?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY25Q3_INB_FORM_Getting-Started-with-AI-Security-AI-Risks-How-to-Prevent-Them&sfcid=701Py00000DP3ZaIAL&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AISecurityeBook)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * Vibe coding company says Claude 4 reduced syntax errors by 25%\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/)\n\n\n# Vibe coding company says Claude 4 reduced syntax errors by 25%\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * May 25, 2025\n  * 07:04 PM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Claude](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/posts\/2025\/05\/25\/Claude-4.jpg)\nLovable, which is a Vibe coding tool, says Claude 4 has reduced its errors by 25% and made it faster by 40%.\nOn May 22, [Anthropic started rolling out two new models](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/claude-4-benchmarks-show-improvements-but-context-is-still-200k\/): Claude Sonnet 4 and Claude Opus 4. While Sonnet is available for free users, Opus requires a paid subscription and is able to do better than Sonnet when it comes to coding.\nIn a [blog post](https:\/\/www.anthropic.com\/news\/claude-4), Anthropic confirmed that Claude Opus 4 scored 72.5 percent in SWE-bench (SWE is short for Software Engineering Benchmark).\n![Claude 4](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/Claude-benchamrks.jpg)\nIn the tests, Opus 4 delivered sustained performance on long-running tasks that require focused effort and thousands of steps.\nAnthropic also claimed that its newest model worked on the code for seven hours straight.\nVibe coding company Lovable, which uses Claude in its \"AI-powered prompt-based web and apps builder\" tool, has observed similar improvements after upgrading to Claude 4.\nIn a on X, Lovable says it has 25% less errors and be 40% faster overall after deploying Claude 4 for both project creation and edits on all projects (including old projects).\n![Claude 4 on Lovable](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/Claude-4-errors-reduced.jpg)**Claude 4 reduced syntax errors by 25% on Lovable AI**\nIn a , Lovable founder Anton Osika confirmed that \"Claude 4 just erased most of Lovable's errors\" while specifically referring to LLM syntax errors when vibe coding.\n## Claude 4 is a good model for coding\nWhile opinion on Claude 4 remains mixed, I've personally noticed that Claude 4 does produce code with fewer errors than Gemini when I'm working on Dart\/Kotlin apps.\nThis depends on project to project and also context, but in projects where a longer context is not required, Claude 4 did better than Gemini in my tests.\nClaude models have always maintained the reputation of \"best at coding,\" but there has been steep competition from Google lately, which released Gemini 2.5 Pro with a 1 million context window.\nCompared to the 200,000 context window of Claude 4 or older models, the 1 million context window for Gemini 2.5 does give it an advantage. But it doesn't necessarily mean Gemini 2.5 is better than Claude 4 in coding.\nBoth can be surprisingly brilliant and also terrible at the same time, and it also comes down to how you do prompt engineering.\nIt's always nice to mix the models, such as o3 or Gemini for planning and Claude 4 and Gemini for coding.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/)](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[Claude 4 benchmarks show improvements, but context is still 200K](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/claude-4-benchmarks-show-improvements-but-context-is-still-200k\/)\n[Anthropic web config hints at Claude Sonnet 4 and Opus 4](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/anthropic-web-config-hints-at-claude-sonnet-4-and-opus-4\/)\n[Claude copies ChatGPT with $200 Max plan, but users aren't happy](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/claude-copies-chatgpt-with-200-max-plan-but-users-arent-happy\/)\n[Claude is testing ChatGPT-like Deep Research feature Compass](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/claude-is-testing-chatgpt-like-deep-research-feature-compass\/)\n[ChatGPT rolls out Codex, an AI tool for software programming](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/)\n  * [Claude](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/claude\/)\n  * [Claude 3.7](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/claude-37\/)\n  * [Claude Opus 4](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/claude-opus-4\/)\n  * [Claude Sonnet](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/claude-sonnet\/)\n  * [Claude Sonnet 4](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/claude-sonnet-4\/)\n  * [Vibe Coding](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/vibe-coding\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/leak-suggests-xai-is-getting-ready-to-ship-grok-35\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Sharp Rhino story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/sharp-rhino.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/sharprhino-an-old-new-threat\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trur-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![TikTok](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/) TikTok videos now push infostealer malware in ClickFix attacks ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/tiktok-videos-now-push-infostealer-malware-in-clickfix-attacks\/)\n  * [ ![Panda China Hacker](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/) Chinese hackers breach US local governments using Cityworks zero-day ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/chinese-hackers-breach-us-local-governments-using-cityworks-zero-day\/)\n  * [ ![Popular article](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/) Claude 4 benchmarks show improvements, but context is still 200K ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/claude-4-benchmarks-show-improvements-but-context-is-still-200k\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers?](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/) Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers? ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/demo\/generative-ai-monitoring?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=validated_phishing_may)\n  * [ ![Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/) Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today ](https:\/\/www.threatlocker.com\/pages\/threatlocker-platform-patch-management?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=sponsor&utm_campaign=patch_management_q2_25&utm_content=patch_management&utm_term=display)\n  * [ ![Identity Cybersecurity Framework passwords authentication](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/) Majority of browser extensions pose critical security risk - learn how to control it ](https:\/\/go.layerxsecurity.com\/enterprise-browser-extension-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=browser_extension_08052025)\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/vibe-coding-company-says-claude-4-reduced-syntax-errors-by-25-percent\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.9366539848734377)\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/sync.intentiq.com\/profiles_engine\/ProfilesEngineServlet?at=20&mi=10&secure=1&dpi=456059511&iiqidtype=2&iiqpcid=c271e972-8723-40f5-b9f7-568e6a5125ec&iiqpciddate=1748217613314&tsrnd=883_1748217613314&vrref=&jsver=5.082)\n",,
