sing-as-solana.html)\n[ ![Researchers Expose New Intel CPU Flaws Enabling Memory Leaks and Spectre v2 Attacks](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-apt-campaigns-browser.html) Researchers Expose New Intel CPU Flaws Enabling Memory Leaks and Spectre v2 Attacks ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/researchers-expose-new-intel-cpu-flaws.html)\n[ ![New Chrome Vulnerability Enables Cross-Origin Data Leak via Loader Referrer Policy](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-apt-campaigns-browser.html) New Chrome Vulnerability Enables Cross-Origin Data Leak via Loader Referrer Policy ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/new-chrome-vulnerability-enables-cross.html)\n[ ![Coinbase Agents Bribed, Data of ~1% Users Leaked; $20M Extortion Attempt Fails](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-apt-campaigns-browser.html) Coinbase Agents Bribed, Data of ~1% Users Leaked; $20M Extortion Attempt Fails ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/coinbase-agents-bribed-data-of-1-users.html)\n[ ![5 BCDR Essentials for Effective Ransomware Defense](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-apt-campaigns-browser.html) 5 BCDR Essentials for Effective Ransomware Defense ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/top-5-bcdr-capabilities-for-ransomware-defense.html)\n[ ![Microsoft Fixes 78 Flaws, 5 Zero-Days Exploited; CVSS 10 Bug Impacts Azure DevOps Server](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-apt-campaigns-browser.html) Microsoft Fixes 78 Flaws, 5 Zero-Days Exploited; CVSS 10 Bug Impacts Azure DevOps Server ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/microsoft-fixes-78-flaws-5-zero-days.html)\n[ ![Fortinet Patches CVE-2025-32756 Zero-Day RCE Flaw Exploited in FortiVoice Systems](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/weekly-recap-apt-campaigns-browser.html) Fortinet Patches CVE-2025-32756 Zero-Day RCE Flaw Exploited in FortiVoice Systems ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/fortinet-patches-cve-2025-32756-zero.html)\n[ ![Ch