"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/aispm-for-dummies.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/ai-security-posture-management-ai-spm-for-dummies?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY26Q1_INB_FORM_AI-SPM-for-Dummies-eBook&sfcid=701Py00000KWgAHIA1&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AI-SPMDummies)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Google](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/)\n  * Google claims users find ads in AI search 'helpful'\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/)\n\n\n# Google claims users find ads in AI search 'helpful'\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * May 26, 2025\n  * 08:45 AM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Google](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2025\/03\/10\/Google.jpg)\nGoogle AI mode and AI Overviews now have ads, which, according to the search engine giant, are \"helpful.\"\nAt the Google Marketing Live event last week, Google [confirmed ](https:\/\/blog.google\/products\/ads-commerce\/google-marketing-live-2025\/)it has started rolling out ads to AI mode and AI Overviews in the US, which create new \"opportunities for customers.\"\nWhile I haven't seen ads in AI Overviews, some users them last week, and these ads appear below the AI Overviews, followed by the traditional blue links.\n![Google AI ads](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/Google-AI-ads.jpg)**Ads in Google AI overviews (Desktop)**\nIn a [support document](https:\/\/support.google.com\/google-ads\/answer\/16297775#:~:text=Google%20internal%20data%20shows%20that%20people%20have%20been%20finding%20the%20ads%20within%20AI%20Overviews%20helpful) spotted by [SER](https:\/\/www.seroundtable.com\/google-ads-help-doc-ai-overviews-39469.html), Google described ads in AI search results as a new way to find information on the web.\nSEO consultant pointed out an interesting excerpt in the document that claims users find ads in these AI search results helpful.\n\"Google internal data shows that people have been finding the ads within AI Overviews helpful because they can quickly connect with relevant businesses, products, and services to take the next step at the exact moment they need them,\" the company wrote in the document.\nGoogle won't share the numbers or methodology of its \"internal data,\" but it wants you to believe that ads are helpful, especially in AI search results.\nAds aren't necessarily bad, but they're certainly not helpful when they mislead users or appear above the actual content and disrupt the flow.\nGoogle [reported ](https:\/\/www.emarketer.com\/content\/google-posts--96-5-billion-q4-revenue--ad-growth-only-half-of-meta-s#:~:text=Advertising%20revenues)$72.5 billion in advertising revenue in its last quarterly report, and it's expected to increase as ads expand beyond the blue links.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[Google Chrome to use on-device AI to detect tech support scams](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/google-chrome-to-use-on-device-ai-to-detect-tech-support-scams\/)\n[Google NotebookLM is now using Gemini 2.5 Flash](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-notebooklm-is-now-using-gemini-25-flash\/)\n[Google takes on Cursor with Firebase Studio, its AI builder for vibe coding](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-takes-on-cursor-with-firebase-studio-its-ai-builder-for-vibe-coding\/)\n[Google Gemini AI is getting ChatGPT-like Scheduled Actions feature](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-gemini-ai-is-getting-chatgpt-like-scheduled-actions-feature\/)\n[Google begins unifying search country domains to Google.com](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-begins-unifying-search-country-domains-to-googlecom\/)\n  * [Ads](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ads\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [AI Overviews](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai-overviews\/)\n  * [Google](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/google\/)\n  * [Search Engine](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/search-engine\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/offer\/deals\/this-75-refurbished-lenovo-chromebook-makes-for-a-great-extra-computer\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Astaroth Unleashed story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/Astaroth-unleashed.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/astaroth-unleashed\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trua-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/) Researchers claim ChatGPT o3 bypassed shutdown in controlled test ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/researchers-claim-chatgpt-o3-bypassed-shutdown-in-controlled-test\/)\n  * [ ![TikTok](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/) TikTok videos now push infostealer malware in ClickFix attacks ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/tiktok-videos-now-push-infostealer-malware-in-clickfix-attacks\/)\n  * [ ![NPM](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/) Dozens of malicious packages on NPM collect host and network data ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/dozens-of-malicious-packages-on-npm-collect-host-and-network-data\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n  * [ ![Identity Cybersecurity Framework passwords authentication](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/) Majority of browser extensions pose critical security risk - learn how to control it ](https:\/\/go.layerxsecurity.com\/enterprise-browser-extension-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=browser_extension_08052025)\n  * [ ![Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/) Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today ](https:\/\/www.threatlocker.com\/pages\/threatlocker-platform-patch-management?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=sponsor&utm_campaign=patch_management_q2_25&utm_content=patch_management&utm_term=display)\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers?](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/) Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers? ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/demo\/generative-ai-monitoring?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=validated_phishing_may)\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/google\/google-claims-users-find-ads-in-ai-search-helpful\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e