"summary": "Microsoft has released an emergency update for Windows Server 2022 to address an issue causing some Hyper-V virtual machines, particularly Azure confidential VMs, to freeze or restart unexpectedly. The update, identified as KB5061906, must be manually installed and will not be delivered through Windows Update. The issue mainly affects Azure confidential VMs and is not expected to impact standard Hyper-V deployments significantly.",,
