ign=patch_management_q2_25&utm_content=patch_management&utm_term=display)\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/iranian-pleads-guilty-to-robbinhood-ransomware-attacks-faces-30-years\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/iranian-pleads-guilty-to-robbinhood-ransomware-attacks-faces-30-years\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.20798086238397884)\n",,
