-encrypt-customers\/) Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today ](https:\/\/www.threatlocker.com\/pages\/threatlocker-platform-patch-management?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=sponsor&utm_campaign=patch_management_q2_25&utm_content=patch_management&utm_term=display)\n  * [ ![Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers?](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/dragonforce-ransomware-abuses-msps-simplehelp-rmm-to-encrypt-customers\/) Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers? ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/demo\/generative-ai-monitoring?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=validated_phishing_may)\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/dragonforce-ransomware-abuses-msps-simplehelp-rmm-to-encrypt-customers\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/dragonforce-ransomware-abuses-msps-simplehelp-rmm-to-encrypt-customers\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/dragonforce-ransomware-abuses-msps-simplehelp-rmm-to-encrypt-customers\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.38984195379661113)![](https:\/\/sync.intentiq.com\/profiles_engine\/ProfilesEngineServlet?at=20&mi=10&secure=1&dpi=456059511&iiqidtype=2&iiqpcid=042cd8d8-886f-4bce-a780-7d8ef3d2e38c&iiqpciddate=1748386812501&tsrnd=349_1748386812502&vrref=&jsver=5.082)\n",,
