"markdown": "X\n[![Wiz](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/w\/wiz\/ai-security-risk-ebook.png)](https:\/\/www.wiz.io\/lp\/getting-started-with-ai-security-ai-risks-how-to-prevent-them-and-ai-for-defender?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=FY25Q3_INB_FORM_Getting-Started-with-AI-Security-AI-Risks-How-to-Prevent-Them&sfcid=701Py00000DP3ZaIAL&utm_term=FY26Q2-bleepingcomputer-970x250&utm_content=AISecurityeBook)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Microsoft](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/)\n  * Microsoft introduces new Windows backup tool for businesses\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/)\n\n\n# Microsoft introduces new Windows backup tool for businesses\nBy \n###### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n  * May 28, 2025\n  * 09:09 AM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Windows](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2025\/05\/28\/Windows-headpic.jpg)\nMicrosoft has introduced Windows Backup for Organizations, a new backup tool for enterprises that simplifies backups and makes the transition to Windows 11 easier.\nFirst announced at Microsoft Ignite [in November 2024](https:\/\/blogs.windows.com\/windowsexperience\/2024\/11\/19\/microsoft-ignite-2024-embracing-the-future-of-windows-at-work\/#:~:text=of%20the%20year.-,Endpoint%20Modernization,-We%20continue%20to), this tool is now in limited public preview and will help back up and restore a user's Windows settings after resetting or reimaging their device.\n\"You can back up your organization's Windows 10 or Windows 11 settings and restore them on a Microsoft Entra joined device. This capability helps reduce migration overhead, minimize user disruption, and strengthen device resilience against incidents,\" [Microsoft said](https:\/\/learn.microsoft.com\/en-us\/windows\/release-health\/windows-message-center#3562).\n\"Whether you're planning a large-scale upgrade or simply looking to enhance your organization's device continuity strategy, this capability helps reduce migration overhead, minimize user disruption, and strengthen device resilience against incidents.\"\nWindows Backup for Organizations is available for Microsoft Entra joined Windows 10 or Windows 11 systems.\nOrganizations that sign up for this public preview using [this form](http:\/\/aka.ms\/JoinMMCCP) also need an active Microsoft Intune test tenant and Microsoft Intune service administrator permissions to take full advantage of this feature.\n\"Try out Windows Backup for Organizations during the limited public preview,\" the company [urged customers](https:\/\/techcommunity.microsoft.com\/blog\/windows-itpro-blog\/announcing-windows-backup-for-organizations\/4416659) on Tuesday.\n\"This is just the beginning. As we continue to evolve this experience, more enhancements are on the horizon\u2014ensuring your organization is always ready for what's next.\"\nThose who can't upgrade to Windows 11 before Windows 10 reaches the end of service on October 14, 2025, are advised to enroll Windows 10 endpoints in the [Extended Security Updates (ESU) program](https:\/\/learn.microsoft.com\/en-us\/windows\/whats-new\/enable-extended-security-updates) to continue receiving security updates.\nIn December, Microsoft also announced that Windows 10 home users will also be able to [get an extra year](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-to-let-windows-10-home-users-buy-extended-security-updates\/) of security updates through the company's ESU program if they're willing [to pay $30](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-wants-30-if-you-want-to-delay-windows-11-switch\/) to delay the Windows 11 switch.\nThis week, Microsoft also [announced a new update orchestration platform](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-wants-windows-to-update-all-software-on-your-pc\/) built on the Windows Update stack that aims to unify the updating system for all apps, drivers, and system components on Windows systems.\n[ ![Red Report 2025](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/picus\/red-report-in-article.jpg) ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n## [Top 10 MITRE ATT&CK\u00a9 Techniques Behind 93% of Attacks](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\nBased on an analysis of 14M malicious actions, discover the top 10 MITRE ATT&CK techniques behind 93% of attacks and how to defend against them.\n[Read the Red Report 2025](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q039Tm490)\n### Related Articles:\n[Microsoft: New Windows updates fix Active Directory policy issues](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-new-emergency-windows-updates-fix-ad-policy-issues\/)\n[Microsoft adds hotpatching support to Windows 11 Enterprise](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-adds-hotpatching-support-to-windows-11-enterprise\/)\n[Windows Server emergency update fixes Hyper-V VM freezes, restart issues](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-server-emergency-update-fixes-hyper-v-vm-freezes-restart-issues\/)\n[Signal now blocks Microsoft Recall screenshots on Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/signal-now-blocks-microsoft-recall-screenshots-on-windows-11\/)\n[Windows 10 emergency updates fix BitLocker recovery issues](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-10-emergency-updates-fix-bitlocker-recovery-issues\/)\n  * [Backup](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/backup\/)\n  * [Business](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/business\/)\n  * [Enterprise](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/enterprise\/)\n  * [Windows](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/windows\/)\n  * [Windows 10](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/windows-10\/)\n  * [Windows 11](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/windows-11\/)\n  * [Windows Backup](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/windows-backup\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n##### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\nSergiu is a news reporter who has covered the latest cybersecurity and technology developments for over a decade. Email or Twitter DMs for tips. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-wants-windows-to-update-all-software-on-your-pc\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Astaroth Unleashed story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/a\/acronis\/Astaroth-unleashed.jpg)](https:\/\/www.acronis.com\/en-us\/cyber-protection-center\/posts\/astaroth-unleashed\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer-fy25-q2-mixed-amer-en-ba-q2brand-trua-bleeping-d)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/) Researchers claim ChatGPT o3 bypassed shutdown in controlled test ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/researchers-claim-chatgpt-o3-bypassed-shutdown-in-controlled-test\/)\n  * [ ![Windows Server](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/) Windows Server emergency update fixes Hyper-V VM freezes, restart issues ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-server-emergency-update-fixes-hyper-v-vm-freezes-restart-issues\/)\n  * [ ![MathWorks](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/) MATLAB dev confirms ransomware attack behind service outage ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/mathworks-blames-ransomware-attack-for-ongoing-outages\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![CVSS 9.8? It might be harmless. Find out what's truly risky.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/) CVSS 9.8? It might be harmless. Find out what's truly risky. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03nKGps0)\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/) Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today ](https:\/\/www.threatlocker.com\/pages\/threatlocker-platform-patch-management?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=sponsor&utm_campaign=patch_management_q2_25&utm_content=patch_management&utm_term=display)\n  * [ ![Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers?](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/) Do You Know Which AI Tools Are Running in Your Users\u2019 Browsers? ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/demo\/generative-ai-monitoring?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=article&utm_campaign=validated_phishing_may)\n  * [ ![Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-introduces-new-windows-backup-tool-for-businesses\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.26447917665102405)![](https:\/\/sync.intentiq.com\/profiles_engine\/ProfilesEngineServlet?at=20&mi=10&secure=1&dpi=456059511&iiqidtype=2&iiqpcid=00ec72fa-24c2-421e-8334-3ad58284e332&iiqpciddate=1748440812620&tsrnd=890_1748440812621&vrref=&jsver=5.082)\n",,
