"title": "Estonia issues arrest warrant for Moroccan wanted for major pharmacy data breach",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/estonia-arrest-warrant-pharmacy-data-breach",,
"summary": "Estonia has issued an international arrest warrant for Adrar Khalid, a Moroccan suspect in a major data breach at Allium UPI, affecting Estonia's Apotheka pharmacy chain. The breach exposed sensitive information of nearly 700,000 individuals, including identification codes, email addresses, home addresses, and phone numbers. No misuse of the stolen data has been reported so far. The authorities believe Khalid accessed the system using administrator credentials, impacting the customer loyalty system.",,
