"markdown": "![location](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/large_location_nyc_dccf6c7edc.jpg)\nImage: Kobu Agency via Unsplash\n[Suzanne Smalley](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/suzanne-smalley)May 28th, 2025\n# Oregon becomes second state to ban sale of precise geolocation data\nThe Oregon state legislature on Tuesday passed a law banning the sale of precise geolocation data, making it the second state in the country to have greenlit such legislation. \nMaryland passed a similar bill last year that will take effect in October. Both bills also ban the sale of data belonging to children \u2014 Maryland for children under 18, and Oregon for children under 16. Although there is a federal Children\u2019s Online Privacy Protection Act, the two state bills go further than it because the federal law only bans the sale of data for children under age 13, according to Matt Schwartz, a policy analyst at Consumer Reports. \nThe precise geolocation ban in Oregon\u2019s bill also is stringent, banning the sale of data showing an individual\u2019s location within 1,750 feet. The bill strengthens an Oregon comprehensive data privacy law passed in 2023. \nA second state passing such tough data privacy legislation, particularly around geolocation data, could be a significant factor in pushing other states to do the same, Schwartz said. \n\u201cIt shows that lawmakers are taking location privacy very seriously,\u201d he said. \u201cPeople are creeped out by having their precise location data tracked and lawmakers will take action to address that.\u201d \nSimilar bills are now being debated in Maine, Massachusetts and Vermont, Schwartz said. \nHowever, a bill with similar provisions recently failed to advance in the California State Assembly. \nThe governor of Texas also signed an important bill involving children\u2019s online safety on Tuesday despite a lobbying call he [reportedly](https:\/\/www.wsj.com\/tech\/tim-cook-called-texas-governor-to-stop-online-child-safety-legislation-22858ad4?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=ASWzDAjEMKMJvYy0wtDDpiTFxkS98LxtPsTnxBmlXLUeOXy0mFKZUXFEXSCiZcFS8Ic%3D&gaa_ts=68372c02&gaa_sig=j639ZaSWYmXMFKFXBoPl8nWehZowwfP3iG94DM2buJob3D27854gZN4yw0CLYa9KFEcywiGeAlJZLO0TPEKsLg%3D%3D) received from Apple CEO Tim Cook. \nThat bill mandates Apple and Google verify app store customers\u2019 ages, creating red tape for the tech companies. Twenty states have considered similar laws, and in March Utah became the first to pass one. \nTexas Attorney General Ken Paxton [has said](https:\/\/www.bloomberg.com\/news\/articles\/2025-05-27\/texas-adopts-online-child-safety-bill-opposed-by-apple-s-ceo) the bill is designed to put \u201ctools in the hands of parents to make decisions for their own children.\u201d \n  * [](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=&t=Oregon becomes second state to ban sale of precise geolocation data)\n  * [](https:\/\/bsky.app\/intent\/compose?text=Oregon becomes second state to ban sale of precise geolocation data )\n\n\n  * [Government](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/government)\n  * [News](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n  * [News Briefs](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n  * [Privacy](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/privacy)\n\n\nGet more insights with the \nRecorded Future\nIntelligence Cloud.\n[Learn more.](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/platform?mtm_campaign=ad-unit-record)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_300x1050_1_0f2f11757e.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_970x250_1_d144dbf901.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\nTags\n  * [location privacy](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/location-privacy)\n  * [location tracking](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/location-tracking)\n  * [geolocation](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/geolocation)\n  * [Oregon](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/oregon)\n  * [Maryland](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/maryland)\n  * [Children\u2019s Online Privacy Protection Rule (COPPA)](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag-childrens-online-privacy-protection-rule-coppa)\n\n\nNo previous article\nNo new articles\n[![Suzanne Smalley](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/Suzanne_Smalley_27e80bc465.png)](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/suzanne-smalley)\n[Suzanne Smalley](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/suzanne-smalley)\nis a reporter covering privacy, disinformation and cybersecurity policy for The Record. She was previously a cybersecurity reporter at CyberScoop and Reuters. Earlier in her career Suzanne covered the Boston Police Department for the Boston Globe and two presidential campaign cycles for Newsweek. She lives in Washington with her husband and three children.\n## Briefs\n  * [Estonia issues arrest warrant for Moroccan wanted for major pharmacy data breachMay 28th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/estonia-arrest-warrant-pharmacy-data-breach)\n  * [Ukraine detains alleged Russian spies who used dash cams to guide missile strikesMay 28th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ukraine-detains-russian-spies-using-dashcams-missile-strikes)\n  * [Russian hospital programmer gets 14 years for leaking soldier data to UkraineMay 27th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/russian-programmer-gets-14-years-for-leaking-info-to-ukraine)\n  * [Nearly 70,000 impacted by ransomware attack on Sheboygan, WisconsinMay 27th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ransomware-sheboygan-breach-notice)\n  * [China accuses Taiwan-linked group of cyberattack on local tech companyMay 27th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/china-accuses-taiwan-linked-group-of-cyberattacks)\n  * [Apple says it blocked $2 billion in App Store fraud last yearMay 27th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/apple-billions-app-store-fraud)\n  * [MATLAB developer bringing systems back online following ransomware attackMay 27th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/matlab-developer-bringing-systems-online-ransomware)\n  * [Vietnam orders ban on Telegram messaging app over security concernsMay 27th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/vietnam-orders-telegram-messaging-ban)\n  * [DOJ charges man allegedly behind Qakbot malwareMay 22nd, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/doj-charges-man-allegedly-behind-qakbot-malware)\n\n\n## [Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents![Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/recordedfuture_insikt_Main_Featured_Banner_1600x600_2a9d7e6d39.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/russia-aligned-tag-110-targets-tajikistan-with-macro-enabled)\n## [Measuring the US-China AI Gap![Measuring the US-China AI Gap](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_ta_2025_0508_Main_Feature_0873ea3526.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/measuring-the-us-china-ai-gap)\n## [TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered![TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/cta_2025_0501_Blog_Main_Feature_55a0e64897.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/terrastealerv2-and-terralogger)\n## [Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting![Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_cta_2025_0429_Main_Feature_e924c36cbd.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/uncovering-mintsloader-with-recorded-future-malware-intelligence-hunting)\n## [Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives![Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/irans_ai_ambitions_balancing_economic_isolation_national_security_imperatives_151fba814d.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/irans-ai-ambitions-balancing-economic-isolation-national-security-imperatives)\n",,
