"summary": "A critical unpatched security flaw has been disclosed impacting the TI WooCommerce Wishlist plugin for WordPress, which allows unauthenticated attackers to upload arbitrary files. The vulnerability, tracked as CVE-2025-47577 with a CVSS score of 10.0, affects all versions of the plugin up to 2.9.2. This issue enables remote code execution if the WC Fields Factory plugin is active. No patch is currently available, and users are advised to deactivate and delete the plugin.",,
