ps you focus on what\u2019s real.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-windows-11-might-fail-to-start-after-installing-kb5058405\/) Security overwhelm is real. Learn how exposure validation helps you focus on what\u2019s real. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03m1Jw30 )\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-windows-11-might-fail-to-start-after-installing-kb5058405\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-windows-11-might-fail-to-start-after-installing-kb5058405\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.6517735220704339)![](https:\/\/sync.intentiq.com\/profiles_engine\/ProfilesEngineServlet?at=20&mi=10&secure=1&dpi=456059511&iiqidtype=2&iiqpcid=252600ba-96d5-46be-91f7-73ec32066d31&iiqpciddate=1748516412452&tsrnd=781_1748516412453&vrref=&jsver=5.082)\n",,
