"summary": "A civilian IT specialist at the Defense Intelligence Agency, Nathan Vilas Laatsch, was arrested for allegedly attempting to leak classified information to a foreign government. Laatsch worked in the DIA's Insider Threat Division and allegedly reached out to a 'friendly' foreign government claiming discontent with the Trump administration. He exfiltrated and transcribed classified data, communicated with an undercover FBI agent, and attempted data drop-offs containing classified documents. His arrest follows intelligence warnings about increasing recruitment efforts by foreign entities targeting disgruntled U.S. employees.",,
