Computer%20&utm_campaign=Xposure&campaign=Xposure)\n  * [ ![CVSS 9.8? It might be harmless. Find out what's truly risky.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/police-takes-down-avcheck-antivirus-site-used-by-cybercriminals\/) CVSS 9.8? It might be harmless. Find out what's truly risky. ](https:\/\/hubs.li\/Q03nKGps0)\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/police-takes-down-avcheck-antivirus-site-used-by-cybercriminals\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/police-takes-down-avcheck-antivirus-site-used-by-cybercriminals\/) Tired of Patch Tuesday Surprises? Automate it All with ThreatLocker Today ](https:\/\/www.threatlocker.com\/pages\/threatlocker-platform-patch-management?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=sponsor&utm_campaign=patch_management_q2_25&utm_content=patch_management&utm_term=display)\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/police-takes-down-avcheck-antivirus-site-used-by-cybercriminals\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/police-takes-down-avcheck-antivirus-site-used-by-cybercriminals\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.8834364370712089)![](https:\/\/sync.intentiq.com\/profiles_engine\/ProfilesEngineServlet?at=20&mi=10&secure=1&dpi=456059511&iiqidtype=2&iiqpcid=213a001f-497c-415e-9a33-4319e1126a6e&iiqpciddate=1748627110158&tsrnd=760_1748627110158&vrref=&jsver=5.082)\n",,
