"markdown": "![St. Joseph Nashua](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/large_st_joseph_NH_9dba315208.jpg)\nSt. Joseph Hospital in Nashua, New Hampshire. Credit: St. Joseph via LinkedIn \n[Jonathan Greig](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/jonathan-greig)May 30th, 2025\n# Hospitals in Maine, New Hampshire limit services after cyberattack on Catholic health org\nThree hospitals run by Catholic healthcare organization Covenant Health are dealing with a cyberattack that forced the facilities to shut off all access to data systems. \nCovenant Health operates the three hospitals and multiple skilled nursing and rehabilitation centers, assisted living residences, and community-based health and elder care organizations across Maine, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island and Vermont. The organization has nearly 6,000 employees. \nA spokesperson for Covenant Health confirmed that a cyberattack impacted two hospitals in Maine \u2014 St. Joseph Hospital and St. Mary\u2019s Health System \u2014 and one in New Hampshire, which is also called St. Joseph Hospital. \n\u201cOn Monday, May 26, Covenant Health became aware of irregularities impacting connectivity across the organization. Out of an abundance of caution, we immediately discontinued access to all data systems in our hospitals, clinics and provider practices,\u201d the spokesperson said. \nCybersecurity experts have been hired to determine what happened and to restore full system access. \n\u201cWe are working to provide healthcare services as normal. Patients are encouraged to keep all appointments. If patients have questions, they should contact their provider\u2019s office,\u201d they added. \nShe explained the attack has had \u201cminimal impact\u201d on the organization\u2019s post-acute care facilities because they are on a different clinical platform. \nAll of the hospitals on and on their websites notifying patients of technology outages earlier this week. \nThe messages said the hospitals are experiencing system issues affecting phones and internet access, making certain services unavailable. \nSt. Mary\u2019s said care is continuing but noted wait times will be longer than normal and labs are only able to process paper orders or orders that can be shown through the platform MyChart. St. Joseph Hospital in New Hampshire said lab services were only available at the main hospital campus and services could only be provided with a physical order in hand. \nNo cybercriminal group has taken credit for the attack as of Friday. Last year, one of the largest Catholic health systems in the U.S. was [attacked by the Black Basta ransomware gang](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ascension-restoring-network-after-cyberattack). \nThere have already been multiple cyberattacks in 2025 impacting the care at U.S.y hospitals, including an incident last week [affecting facilities in Ohio](https:\/\/therecord.media\/kettering-health-system-ohio-cyberattack). \nA hospital network in Maryland [struggled for weeks](https:\/\/therecord.media\/maryland-healthcare-ransomware-frederick-health) with technological issues after a cyberattack in January and attacks on [a New York blood center](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ransomware-attack-new-york-blood-center-forces-workarounds) as well as [dialysis giant DaVita](https:\/\/therecord.media\/davita-kidney-dialysis-company-ransomware-attack) caused dangerous impacts on patient care. \n  * [](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=&t=Hospitals in Maine, New Hampshire limit services after cyberattack on Catholic health org)\n  * [](https:\/\/bsky.app\/intent\/compose?text=Hospitals in Maine, New Hampshire limit services after cyberattack on Catholic health org )\n\n\n  * [News](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n  * [Cybercrime](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/cybercrime)\n\n\nGet more insights with the \nRecorded Future\nIntelligence Cloud.\n[Learn more.](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/platform?mtm_campaign=ad-unit-record)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_300x1050_1_0f2f11757e.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_970x250_1_d144dbf901.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\nTags\n  * [healthcare](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/healthcare)\n  * [Cyberattack](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/cyberattack)\n  * [Maine](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/maine)\n  * [New Hampshire](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/new-hampshire)\n  * [hospital](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/hospital)\n\n\nNo previous article\nNo new articles\n[![Jonathan Greig](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/DSC_0283_1_a6f4e4e315.jpg)](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/jonathan-greig)\n[Jonathan Greig](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/jonathan-greig)\nis a Breaking News Reporter at Recorded Future News. Jonathan has worked across the globe as a journalist since 2014. Before moving back to New York City, he worked for news outlets in South Africa, Jordan and Cambodia. He previously covered cybersecurity at ZDNet and TechRepublic.\n## Briefs\n  * [Meta says it disrupted influence operations linked to China, Iran, RomaniaMay 30th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/meta-influence-operations-takedown-china-iran-romania)\n  * [DDoS incident disrupts internet for thousands in MoscowMay 30th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/moscow-internet-provider-asvt-ddos-attack)\n  * [Victoria\u2019s Secret website down as company investigates security incidentMay 29th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/victorias-secret-website-down-security-incident)\n  * [China-linked hackers exploit Google Calendar in cyberattacks on governmentsMay 29th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/china-linked-apt41-exploits-google-calendar-in-cyberattacks)\n  * [More than $12 million stolen from crypto platform Cork ProtocolMay 28th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/cork-protocol-defi-12million-crypto-theft)\n  * [Estonia issues arrest warrant for Moroccan wanted for major pharmacy data breachMay 28th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/estonia-arrest-warrant-pharmacy-data-breach)\n  * [Ukraine detains alleged Russian spies who used dash cams to guide missile strikesMay 28th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ukraine-detains-russian-spies-using-dashcams-missile-strikes)\n  * [Russian hospital programmer gets 14 years for leaking soldier data to UkraineMay 27th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/russian-programmer-gets-14-years-for-leaking-info-to-ukraine)\n  * [Nearly 70,000 impacted by ransomware attack on Sheboygan, WisconsinMay 27th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ransomware-sheboygan-breach-notice)\n\n\n## [Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents![Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/recordedfuture_insikt_Main_Featured_Banner_1600x600_2a9d7e6d39.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/russia-aligned-tag-110-targets-tajikistan-with-macro-enabled)\n## [Measuring the US-China AI Gap![Measuring the US-China AI Gap](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_ta_2025_0508_Main_Feature_0873ea3526.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/measuring-the-us-china-ai-gap)\n## [TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered![TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/cta_2025_0501_Blog_Main_Feature_55a0e64897.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/terrastealerv2-and-terralogger)\n## [Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting![Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_cta_2025_0429_Main_Feature_e924c36cbd.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/uncovering-mintsloader-with-recorded-future-malware-intelligence-hunting)\n## [Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives![Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/irans_ai_ambitions_balancing_economic_isolation_national_security_imperatives_151fba814d.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/irans-ai-ambitions-balancing-economic-isolation-national-security-imperatives)\n",,
