"markdown": "This page contains affiliate links. When you purchase through the links provided, we may earn a commission.\n[Watch UCL final with SingTel](https:\/\/singtelsg.sjv.io\/DyAPBy)\n[Anselm Noronha](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/author\/anselm-noronha\/blt20dd691422b13821)\n[Champions League](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/champions-league\/4oogyu6o156iphvdvphwpck10 \"Champions League\")[Paris Saint-Germain](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/team\/paris-saint-germain\/2b3mar72yy8d6uvat1ka6tn3r \"Paris Saint-Germain\")[Inter](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/team\/inter\/3vo5mpj7catp66nrwwqiuhuup \"Inter\")[Paris Saint-Germain vs Inter](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/paris-saint-germain-vs-inter\/K2JK0v-x-VhGCPw0uzk5F \"Paris Saint-Germain vs Inter\")\nHow to watch the UEFA Champions League match between PSG and Inter, as well as kick-off time and team news.\n[**PSG**](https:\/\/www.goal.com\/en\/team\/paris-saint-germain\/2b3mar72yy8d6uvat1ka6tn3r \"Paris Saint-Germain\") and [**Inter**](https:\/\/www.goal.com\/en\/team\/inter\/3vo5mpj7catp66nrwwqiuhuup \"Internazionale\") are set to clash in the [**Champions League**](https:\/\/www.goal.com\/en\/champions-league\/4oogyu6o156iphvdvphwpck10) final at the Allianz Arena in Munich on Saturday.\nThe French giants have been knocking on the door for the past ten years and are eager to claim their first European title. Meanwhile, Inter Milan, a team with a rich history in the competition, is aiming to secure their fourth Champions League trophy.\nHere, **GOAL** brings you everything you need to know about how to watch, including TV channel, streaming details and more.\n## How to watch PSG vs Inter online - TV channels & live streams\n**TV channel & stream:**| beIN Sports, beIN Sports Connect, StarHub TV+  \n---|---  \nViewers in Singapore can watch the 2025 Champions League final live on **beIN Sports** or stream it live on **beIN Sports Connect**. The game between PSG and Inter is also available to watch live on **StarHub TV+**.\nCheck out [**GOAL's Live Match Centre**](https:\/\/www.goal.com\/en-sg\/match\/paris-saint-germain-vs-inter\/K2JK0v-x-VhGCPw0uzk5F) for updates.\n### How to watch anywhere with VPN\nIf you are abroad, you may need to use a virtual private network (VPN) in order to watch games using your usual streaming service. A VPN, such as [**NordVPN**](https:\/\/go.nordvpn.net\/aff_c?offer_id=252&aff_id=105807&url_id=28142), allows you to establish a secure connection online when streaming. If you are not sure which VPN to use, check out **GOAL** 's guide to the [best VPNs for streaming sport](https:\/\/www.goal.com\/en\/lists\/best-vpn-services\/bltac51bd1cc961a015).\n[![logo](https:\/\/eu-images.contentstack.com\/v3\/assets\/bltcc7a7ffd2fbf71f5\/blt3ce243ea115e700a\/65709e2139f29f040aa649f3\/Nord_VPN.png)Stream live anywhere in the world with Nord VPNGet NordVPN](https:\/\/go.nordvpn.net\/aff_c?offer_id=252&aff_id=105807&url_id=28142)\n## PSG vs Inter kick-off time\n[![crest](https:\/\/cdn.sportfeeds.io\/sdl\/images\/competition\/badge\/small\/4oogyu6o156iphvdvphwpck10.png)Champions League - Final Stage](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/champions-league\/fixtures-results\/4oogyu6o156iphvdvphwpck10)\nAllianz Arena\nThe UEFA Champions League final between PSG and Inter will be played at the Allianz Arena in Munich, Germany.\nIt will kick off at 4am SST in Singapore.\n## Team news & squads\n### Paris Saint-Germain vs Inter lineups\nParis Saint-Germain![Home team crest](https:\/\/cdn.sportfeeds.io\/sdl\/images\/team\/crest\/medium\/Gt8F5QmiB3gbYqX46lCUq.png)\n4-3-3\n## Formation\n3-5-2\n![Home team crest](https:\/\/cdn.sportfeeds.io\/sdl\/images\/team\/crest\/medium\/QMLrilrNtKpq2UmCOH9FK.png)INT\n[1G. Donnarumma](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/g-donnarumma\/4cetkl0w2uq40ccti5ka6a4t1)[2A. Hakimi](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/a-hakimi\/1vr896w03yky9kmu8x5tjkicp)\n51\nW. Pacho\n[25N. Mendes](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\