e.com\/en-sg\/player\/n-mendes\/d3dv3vc71981v5oems59892sq)\n  * [5Marquinhos (C)](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/marquinhos\/8z0395s37qe2lqi9qsvyskgk5)\n  * 87\nJ. Neves\n  * 8\nF. Ruiz\n  * [17Vitinha](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/vitinha\/cionsifzpx5rhc8es29wv6i95)\n  * [10O. Dembele](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/o-dembele\/ckaqxlw257qzj8vjdumvwbaad)\n  * 14\nD. Doue\n  * [7K. Kvaratskhelia](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/k-kvaratskhelia\/4zy4d60v2qmaplm9xbe51y1gp)\n\n\n## Substitutes\n  * [9G. Ramos](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/g-ramos\/9v4l7ic3ve6d22c0gs9p1oe3u)\n  * 49\nI. Mbaye\n  * [80A. Tenas](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/a-tenas\/4ffmlhvbjvfjjnhr0byktvt62)\n  * [19K. Lee](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/k-lee\/8b3igmuipfhfzm39ack89de96)\n  * [33W. Zaire-Emery](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/w-zaire-emery\/2s2fzli5c7h9dfcertq2dwxec)\n  * 35\nL. Beraldo\n  * 39\nM. Safonov\n  * [3P. Kimpembe](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/p-kimpembe\/1qywnx1icmb4x7dbhhsck0vrp)\n  * [21L. Hernandez](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/l-hernandez\/c80tzy7t4hoa8fpbek1od4lw5)\n  * [24S. Mayulu](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/s-mayulu\/54mv7lufwxcy2gih8owyr00lw)\n  * [29B. Barcola](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/b-barcola\/a71n80h977h7fu99ftnri5zsa)\n\n\n## Manager\n  * Luis Enrique\n\n\n## \n![](https:\/\/cdn.sportfeeds.io\/sdl\/images\/team\/crest\/medium\/QMLrilrNtKpq2UmCOH9FK.png)INT\n-Line up\n  * [1Y. Sommer](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/y-sommer\/bagn0ce4xunsiz3mezrtqx1p1)\n  * [15F. Acerbi](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/f-acerbi\/ujb2hkujcnwnyrbsgk3ilmtx)\n  * [95A. Bastoni](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/a-bastoni\/q6ns1fyw7w10xkkubh8etfc9)\n  * [28B. Pavard](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/b-pavard\/yq0cm7vwr0tkv7nvt9vo77bp)\n  * [2D. Dumfries](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/d-dumfries\/2r6hs8npijvt4wekd059t6tx)\n  * [20H. Calhanoglu](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/h-calhanoglu\/botfgp0oq4wqlwtcs9m90kded)\n  * [23N. Barella](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/n-barella\/ahgd3on22t4h7gg9ipnj1itw5)\n  * [22H. Mkhitaryan](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/h-mkhitaryan\/1xscywgyfqisqexmpfvbf9g45)\n  * [32F. Dimarco](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/f-dimarco\/19856wqwrmzmvfw9thf0tzrv9)\n  * [10L. Martinez (C)](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/l-martinez\/7r2tgpdrr4v6n9d2gkzwmlazt)\n  * [9M. Thuram](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/m-thuram\/66nvc8a4kd3cyeyj3i474cudx)\n\n\n## Substitutes\n  * [31Y. Bisseck](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/y-bisseck\/280fh7f5q9lud8lk8reyu7fxm)\n  * [7P. Zielinski](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/p-zielinski\/dpcws493fepch23sk26m1a8yd)\n  * [12R. Di Gennaro](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/r-di-gennaro\/1e95np0v66lmp2qysqq8f33rp)\n  * [36M. Darmian](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/m-darmian\/asyzhp3qu95vmzdbau6nmoic5)\n  * [6S. de Vrij](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/s-de-vrij\/by2gxuixij1eciu56k8mb3cgl)\n  * [30C. Augusto](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/c-augusto\/4d17grk2qflzake218uz76uei)\n  * [13J. Martinez](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/j-martinez\/3yqxkw0tqpoucur51ieh9xdrd)\n  * [59N. Zalewski](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/n-zalewski\/du4ciqofpkn3nei5q3huwlnje)\n  * [21K. Asllani](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/k-asllani\/can2l9ha4ufsxdjxdkb739fkk)\n  * [8M. Arnautovic](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/m-arnautovic\/dccxma9p13p00n0gi1cxk1nf9)\n  * [99M. Taremi](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/m-taremi\/97vuoqg0x9nx56dmd9u5e12hh)\n  * [16D. Frattesi](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/player\/d-frattesi\/4qejyummzkrfllds8ord642qx)\n\n\n## Manager\n  * S. Inzaghi\n\n\n### Injuries and Suspended players\n## \n![](https:\/\/cdn.sportfeeds.io\/sdl\/images\/team\/crest\/medium\/Gt8F5QmiB3gbYqX46lCUq.png)\nInjuries and Suspensions\n  * No sidelined players\n\n\n## \n![](https:\/\/cdn.sportfeeds.io\/sdl\/images\/team\/crest\/medium\/QMLrilrNtKpq2UmCOH9FK.png)\nInjuries and Suspensions\n  * No sidelined players\n\n\n### PSG team news\nAside from **Presnel Kimpembe** , who has been out of the picture for most of the season due to a leg injury, PSG boss Luis Enrique has the entire squad available. This means their lineup could look very similar to the one against Arsenal in the semi-finals.\nOne notable difference, however, is that **Ousmane Dembele** , who was a substitute in the second leg against Arsenal, is expected to start this time. Consequently, Enrique will need to decide between starting **Desire Doue** or **Bradley Barcola** , as **Khvicha Kvaratskhelia** is likely to secure a starting position.\n### Inter team news\nBoth **Benjamin Pavard** and **Piotr Zielinski** have returned to training this week and are expected to be part of the squad. Besides, captain **Lautaro Martinez** , who has been resting since the second leg victory over Barca, where he played through pain for 70 minutes, is now fit and available for selection.\nIt is worth noting that Inter manager Simone Inzaghi rested almost the entire first-choice eleven for the Como game last Friday. From that lineup, only **Yann Sommer** , **Federico Dimarco** , and **Hakan Calhanoglu** are likely to retain their places in the side for this upcoming match.\n### Form\n## \n![](https:\/\/cdn.sportfeeds.io\/sdl\/images\/team\/crest\/medium\/Gt8F5QmiB3gbYqX46lCUq.png)PSG\n-Form\nAllHome\n  * [Paris Saint-Germain3-0ReimsW](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/paris-saint-germain-vs-reims\/cSDw09XuV2bJ-AlMKVUBT)\n  * [Paris Saint-Germain3-1AuxerreW](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/paris-saint-germain-vs-auxerre\/hVQXekcE2SuVxrH-A6Rku)\n  * [Montpellier1-4Paris Saint-GermainW](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/montpellier-vs-paris-saint-germain\/utbL_aNX9yiDt0fLDACA3)\n  * [Paris Saint-Germain2-1ArsenalW](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/paris-saint-germain-vs-arsenal\/n5tD_sk2yQDuo7NV_YCFp)\n  * [Strasbourg2-1Paris Saint-GermainL](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/strasbourg-vs-paris-saint-germain\/GStvjVIrLEEioFj-5hu5t)\n\n\n\nGoal Scored (Conceded)\n    13\/5\n\nGames over 2.5 goals\n    5\/5\n\nBoth teams scored\n    4\/5\n## \n![](https:\/\/cdn.sportfeeds.io\/sdl\/images\/team\/crest\/medium\/QMLrilrNtKpq2UmCOH9FK.png)INT\n-Form\nAllAway\n  * [Como0-2InterW](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/como-vs-inter\/7yg71wU7b9IQvFvNAiYxy)\n  * [Inter2-2LazioD](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/inter-vs-lazio\/dzgSaiOBhRN8NP1Jk3lV4)\n  * [Torino0-2InterW](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/torino-vs-inter\/pZQjUBuK88yO4oR4odmsR)\n  * [Inter4-3BarcelonaW](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/inter-vs-barcelona\/639TyuE_jb7BpLTumFe7e)\n  * [Inter1-0VeronaW](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/inter-vs-verona\/lMF3bG2TG5B1-6VTe-xQw)\n\n\n\nGoal Scored (Conceded)\n    11\/5\n\nGames over 2.5 goals\n    2\/5\n\nBoth teams scored\n    2\/5\n### Head-to-Head Record\n![](https:\/\/cdn.sportfeeds.io\/sdl\/images\/team\/crest\/medium\/Gt8F5QmiB3gbYqX46lCUq.png)PSG\nLast 4 matches\n![](https:\/\/cdn.sportfeeds.io\/sdl\/images\/team\/crest\/medium\/QMLrilrNtKpq2UmCOH9FK.png)INT\n2\nWins\n0\nDraws\n2\nWins\n  * [Paris Saint-Germain1-2Inter](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/paris-saint-germain-vs-inter\/3riu6oqcdxbhal55yvmthk74k)\n  * [Paris Saint-Germain1-1Inter](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/paris-saint-germain-vs-inter\/T1JY1Gfa7xE_8dGZLQmJ_)\n  * [Inter0-1Paris Saint-Germain](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/inter-vs-paris-saint-germain\/H82XWeySxsH-Grtk2NAM3)\n  * [Paris Saint-Germain1-0Inter](https:\/\/news.google.com\/en-sg\/match\/paris-saint-germain-vs-inter\/mOMnMqFdWo4QQ9z_uahpD)\n\n\n4\nGoals scored\n3\n\nGames over 2.5 goals\n    1\/4\n