"title": "Supply chain attack hits Gluestack NPM packages with 960k weekly downloads",,
"url": "https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/supply-chain-attack-hits-gluestack-npm-packages-with-960k-weekly-downloads\/",,
"summary": "A supply chain attack compromised 17 popular Gluestack '@react-native-aria' packages on NPM, totaling over 1,020,000 weekly downloads. The malicious code, a remote access trojan, was injected into the 'lib\/index.js' files of these packages. Discovered by Aikido Security, the malware connects to attackers' command and control servers to execute commands and is similar to another NPM compromise. Gluestack has deprecated the affected versions and revoked the compromised access token.",,
