cket ASM](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/malicious-npm-packages-posing-as-utilities-delete-project-directories\/) What exploits are lurking in your attack surface? Find out at no cost with Sprocket ASM ](https:\/\/www.sprocketsecurity.com\/solutions\/attack-surface-management?utm_campaign=Attack%20Surface%20Management%20Launch%203%2F24&utm_source=Bleeping%20Computer)\n  * [ ![Register to attend Xposure, the Exposure Management vSummit, to learn more about Exposure Management ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/malicious-npm-packages-posing-as-utilities-delete-project-directories\/) Register to attend Xposure, the Exposure Management vSummit, to learn more about Exposure Management  ](https:\/\/events.pentera.io\/xposure2025?utm_source=Article%20&source=Article%20&utm_medium=Bleeping%20Computer%20&medium=Bleeping%20Computer%20&utm_campaign=Xposure&campaign=Xposure)\n  * [ ![Learn to build a strong Windows service\u2014protect your systems from malware. Start now!](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/malicious-npm-packages-posing-as-utilities-delete-project-directories\/) Learn to build a strong Windows service\u2014protect your systems from malware. Start now! ](https:\/\/www.threatlocker.com\/?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=sponsor&utm_campaign=build_robust_windows_service_farid_q2_25&utm_content=build_robust_windows_service_farid&utm_term=display)\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/malicious-npm-packages-posing-as-utilities-delete-project-directories\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/malicious-npm-packages-posing-as-utilities-delete-project-directories\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.7510844550293753)\n",,
