"title": "Kettering Health confirms attack by Interlock ransomware group as health record system is restored",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/kettering-health-ohio-interlock-ransomware",,
"summary": "Kettering Health, a major healthcare provider in Ohio operating 14 medical centers and numerous clinics, experienced a ransomware attack attributed to the Interlock group, impacting their electronic health record systems, phone lines, and forcing the cancellation of some medical procedures. The healthcare system has restored many systems and implemented enhanced security measures, although it's unclear if they will pay the ransom or what data has been compromised. Multiple other healthcare systems have been targeted recently.",,
