ere's What to Fix First ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/identity-automation-2025)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/think-your-idp-or-casb-covers-shadow-it.html) Over 23 Million Secrets Exposed on GitHub in 2024 \u2014 Get the Full Report ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/secrets-sprawl-2025)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/think-your-idp-or-casb-covers-shadow-it.html) Stop Bots and Hidden Threats with SafePoint's Open-Source Web Protection ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/safepoint-waf)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ AI Is Fast \u2014 So Are the Threats Learn How Hackers Are Targeting Hidden AI Identity Accounts AI boosts speed and scale\u2014but also risk. Hidden identity accounts can expose your systems if left unsecured. Secure Your Spot ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=below) [ Protect What You Can't See Learn Real Techniques Hackers Use to Stay Hidden Discover how Zscaler's experts detect stealthy LOTS attacks hiding in trusted sites\u2014and how you can too. Secure Your Webinar Access ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/threat-hunting-insights?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybersecurity Resources\n[![Cybersecurity with Georgetown](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/think-your-idp-or-casb-covers-shadow-it.html)Want To Excel as a Cybersecurity Professional?Develop cybersecurity strategies that increase security with Georgetown.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/master-cyber-risk-1)[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgQ5ubVSdBxlvBwgQF4AfTIEB5O8KQ1RZZiH5OSOpLpzxwkK7p9QhWxy_IqzUgRt88HTODTciWNL-FXcaVnX5HhPehXRaA3v2kHCbgMEaCf8OjGvfk95kb1DKfWe3vfj_pp9_rhuzKqcQFRlbsiOK-9ipYgQ7vdIrEHI1HwxvH7sr_OPGf9bsvuYViZOCWN\/s400-e100\/cloud.png) Cloud Data Security Snapshot: Current Exposure Trends Is Your Cloud Data Secure? Wiz Research analyzed over 150,000 cloud accounts to understand how organizations are managing data exposure, access control, and misconfigurations in the cloud.](https: