"markdown": "![Kazakhstan arrests](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/large_kazakhstan_personal_data_theft_raids_june2025_9d4ceea624.png)\nScreenshot from a YouTube video by Kazakhstan's Ministry of Internal Affairs showing raids against a criminal network that sold illegally acquired personal data.\n[Daryna Antoniuk](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/daryna-antoniuk)June 9th, 2025\n# Kazakhstan detains over 140 for allegedly selling citizens\u2019 data via Telegram channels\nKazakh authorities said they busted a network that was using Telegram to illegally sell citizens\u2019 personal data extracted from government databases. \nMore than 140 suspects were arrested in connection with the scheme, including business owners and alleged administrators of Telegram channels used to trade the stolen information, officials [said](https:\/\/www.gov.kz\/memleket\/entities\/qriim\/press\/news\/details\/1013631?lang=kk) on Monday. \nAuthorities reported that some of the extracted data was shared with debt collection agencies, several of which were searched during the operation. The government seized more than 400 computers and other electronic devices believed to have been used in the illegal activity. \nIf convicted, the suspects could face up to five years in prison and a fine. \nThe Ministry of Internal Affairs said it is continuing efforts to identify all parties involved and pledged to strengthen measures to protect digital privacy and combat the illicit trade in personal information. \nAuthorities also [released](https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=TeiEAJMqs5I) a video showing armed officers storming several business centers, searching open-plan offices and escorting detained suspects onto a bus. \nIllegal call centers \u2014 often unlicensed and operating without regulatory oversight \u2014 are common in Eastern Europe, including countries like Russia, Ukraine and Belarus. These centers frequently engage in fraudulent activities. \nIn April, police in Minsk [detained](https:\/\/money.onliner.by\/2025\/04\/03\/v-minske-zaderzhany-37) employees of five fraudulent call centers that had been operating since 2022 under the guise of investment brokerages. The networks primarily targeted Russian citizens, promising high returns on cryptocurrency investments. In reality, victims lost their life savings. \nIn a separate case in December, Russian police [uncovered](https:\/\/tass.ru\/proisshestviya\/22636059) three illegal call centers in Moscow that had defrauded tens of thousands of people across more than 20 countries in Europe and Asia. \n  * [](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=&t=Kazakhstan detains over 140 for allegedly selling citizens\u2019 data via Telegram channels)\n  * [](https:\/\/bsky.app\/intent\/compose?text=Kazakhstan detains over 140 for allegedly selling citizens\u2019 data via Telegram channels )\n\n\n  * [Cybercrime](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/cybercrime)\n  * [News](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n  * [News Briefs](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n\n\nGet more insights with the \nRecorded Future\nIntelligence Cloud.\n[Learn more.](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/platform?mtm_campaign=ad-unit-record)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_300x1050_1_0f2f11757e.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_970x250_1_d144dbf901.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\nTags\n  * [arrests](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/arrests)\n  * [Kazakhstan](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/kazakhstan)\n  * [data breach](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/data-breach)\n  * [Telegram](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/telegram)\n\n\nNo previous article\nNo new articles\n[![Daryna Antoniuk](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/d887de47708acda42945a172d61c0ca2_38f4568326.png)](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/daryna-antoniuk)\n[Daryna Antoniuk](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/daryna-antoniuk)\nis a reporter for Recorded Future News based in Ukraine. She writes about cybersecurity startups, cyberattacks in Eastern Europe and the state of the cyberwar between Ukraine and Russia. She previously was a tech reporter for Forbes Ukraine. Her work has also been published at Sifted, The Kyiv Independent and The Kyiv Post.\n## Briefs\n  * [Kazakhstan detains over 140 for allegedly selling citizens\u2019 data via Telegram channelsJune 9th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/kazakhstan-arrests-suspects-stolen-data-network)\n  * [Off-brand IoT devices are still vulnerable to BadBox botnet, FBI saysJune 6th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/iot-devices-vulnerable-to-badbox-botnet-fbi)\n  * [Ukrainian police arrest hacker who used hosting firm's servers to mine cryptocurrencyJune 5th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ukrainian-police-arrest-hacker-cryptomining)\n  * [UK tax authority reveals scammers stole \u00a347 millionJune 5th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/uk-hmrc-tax-authority-scammers-stole-47million-pounds)\n  * [BidenCash darknet forum taken down by US, Dutch law enforcementJune 4th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/bidencash-cybercrime-darknet-market-takedown-us-netherlands)\n  * [Newspaper giant Lee Enterprises says nearly 40,000 Social Security numbers leaked in ransomware attackJune 4th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/newspaper-lee-enterprises-cyberattack-ssn)\n  * [Ukraine's military intelligence claims cyberattack on Russian strategic bomber makerJune 4th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ukraine-military-russia-strategic-bomber)\n  * [Acreed infostealer poised to replace Lumma after global crackdownJune 4th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/acreed-infostealer-arises-after-lumma-takedown)\n  * [Germany hands Vodafone $51 million fine over data privacy violationsJune 3rd, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/germany-privacy-regulator-fines-vodafone)\n\n\n## [Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents![Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/recordedfuture_insikt_Main_Featured_Banner_1600x600_2a9d7e6d39.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/russia-aligned-tag-110-targets-tajikistan-with-macro-enabled)\n## [Measuring the US-China AI Gap![Measuring the US-China AI Gap](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_ta_2025_0508_Main_Feature_0873ea3526.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/measuring-the-us-china-ai-gap)\n## [TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered![TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/cta_2025_0501_Blog_Main_Feature_55a0e64897.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/terrastealerv2-and-terralogger)\n## [Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting![Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_cta_2025_0429_Main_Feature_e924c36cbd.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/uncovering-mintsloader-with-recorded-future-malware-intelligence-hunting)\n## [Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives![Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/irans_ai_ambitions_balancing_economic_isolation_national_security_imperatives_151fba814d.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/irans-ai-ambitions-balancing-economic-isolation-national-security-imperatives)\n",,
