"markdown": "![groceries](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/large_food_groceries_d58773bf0d.jpg)\nImage: Karsten Winegeart via Unsplash\n[Jonathan Greig](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/jonathan-greig)June 9th, 2025\n# Major food wholesaler says cyberattack impacting distribution systems\nOne of the largest food distributors in the U.S. reported a cyberattack to regulators on Monday, explaining that the incident has disrupted its operations and ability to fulfil customer orders. \nUnited Natural Foods [released](https:\/\/ir.unfi.com\/news\/press-release-details\/2025\/statement\/default.aspx) a public statement and [filed](https:\/\/www.sec.gov\/Archives\/edgar\/data\/1020859\/000102085925000021\/unfi-20250605.htm) documents with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) saying the cyberattack began on June 5. \nThe statement said the Rhode Island-based company identified unauthorized activity on its systems on Thursday, prompting officials to take systems offline. The action \u201chas temporarily impacted the Company\u2019s ability to fulfill and distribute customer orders.\u201d \n\u201cThe incident has caused, and is expected to continue to cause, temporary disruptions to the Company\u2019s business operations,\u201d United Natural Foods said. \u201cThe Company has implemented workarounds for certain operations in order to continue servicing its customers where possible. The Company is continuing to work to restore its systems to safely bring them back online.\u201d \nLaw enforcement has been notified and the company said it has hired a cybersecurity firm to remediate the incident. The investigation into the attack \u201cremains ongoing and is in its early stages.\u201d \nThe press statement published on Monday said the company is working closely with \u201ccustomers, suppliers, and associates\u201d to minimize the disruption. The company did not respond to requests for comment. \nUnited Natural Foods is the main supplier for Whole Foods and is considered the largest health and specialty food distributor in the United States and Canada. The company [reported](https:\/\/ir.unfi.com\/news\/press-release-details\/2025\/United-Natural-Foods-Inc--Reports-Second-Quarter-Fiscal-2025-Results\/default.aspx) $8.2 billion in net sales last quarter. \nCyberattacks and ransomware incidents impacting the food and agriculture sector [continue to be a major concern](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ransomware-attacks-food-and-ag-double-2025) after multiple high profile disruptions over the last four years. \nIn addition to more recent attacks on [large suppliers](https:\/\/therecord.media\/peter-green-chilled-ransomware-uk-logistics-company) and [supermarket chains](https:\/\/therecord.media\/co-op-cyberattack-uk-company-fears-hackers-still-in-system) in the U.K., hundreds of U.S. stores were affected by a [massive cyberattack](https:\/\/therecord.media\/dutch-company-stop-shop-hannaford-cyber) on Dutch conglomerate Ahold Delhaize USA ahead of the Thanksgiving holiday last year. \nThe parent company of Stop & Shop, Hannaford, Food Lion and Giant Food, Ahold Delhaize USA has more than 2,000 stores across the country and in November, shoppers across the country were [unable](https:\/\/www.wmtw.com\/article\/hannaford-network-issue-cybersecurity-ahold-delhaize\/62872914) to [place grocery delivery orders](https:\/\/www.news10.com\/news\/hannaford-supermarkets-experience-cyber-security-issues\/) online and websites for some of the supermarket brands were offline. \nThe [2021 ransomware attack](https:\/\/therecord.media\/fbi-jbs-ransomware-attack-was-carried-out-by-revil) on food distributor JBS was one of the most high-profile incidents to impact the food industry but dozens of other major companies have been affected, including [Dole](https:\/\/therecord.media\/dole-ransomware-attack-north-america), [Sysco](https:\/\/therecord.media\/sysco-data-breach-social-security-numbers), [Mondelez](https:\/\/therecord.media\/bryan-cave-data-breach-mondelez) and [Americold](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ransomware-attack-on-americold-cold-storage). \n  * [](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=&t=Major food wholesaler says cyberattack impacting distribution systems)\n  * [](https:\/\/bsky.app\/intent\/compose?text=Major food wholesaler says cyberattack impacting distribution systems )\n\n\n  * [Cybercrime](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/cybercrime)\n  * [News](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n  * [News Briefs](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n\n\nGet more insights with the \nRecorded Future\nIntelligence Cloud.\n[Learn more.](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/platform?mtm_campaign=ad-unit-record)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_300x1050_1_0f2f11757e.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_970x250_1_d144dbf901.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\nTags\n  * [food](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/food)\n  * [Food and beverage](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n  * [Cyberattack](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/cyberattack)\n  * [Logistics](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n\n\nNo previous article\nNo new articles\n[![Jonathan Greig](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/DSC_0283_1_a6f4e4e315.jpg)](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/jonathan-greig)\n[Jonathan Greig](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/jonathan-greig)\nis a Breaking News Reporter at Recorded Future News. Jonathan has worked across the globe as a journalist since 2014. Before moving back to New York City, he worked for news outlets in South Africa, Jordan and Cambodia. He previously covered cybersecurity at ZDNet and TechRepublic.\n## Briefs\n  * [Major food wholesaler says cyberattack impacting distribution systemsJune 9th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/major-food-wholesaler-cyberattack-impacting-distribution)\n  * [New hacker group uses LockBit ransomware variant to target Russian companiesJune 9th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/new-hacker-group-lockbit-target-russia)\n  * [Kazakhstan detains over 140 for allegedly selling citizens\u2019 data via Telegram channelsJune 9th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/kazakhstan-arrests-suspects-stolen-data-network)\n  * [Off-brand IoT devices are still vulnerable to BadBox botnet, FBI saysJune 6th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/iot-devices-vulnerable-to-badbox-botnet-fbi)\n  * [Ukrainian police arrest hacker who used hosting firm's servers to mine cryptocurrencyJune 5th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ukrainian-police-arrest-hacker-cryptomining)\n  * [UK tax authority reveals scammers stole \u00a347 millionJune 5th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/uk-hmrc-tax-authority-scammers-stole-47million-pounds)\n  * [BidenCash darknet forum taken down by US, Dutch law enforcementJune 4th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/bidencash-cybercrime-darknet-market-takedown-us-netherlands)\n  * [Newspaper giant Lee Enterprises says nearly 40,000 Social Security numbers leaked in ransomware attackJune 4th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/newspaper-lee-enterprises-cyberattack-ssn)\n  * [Ukraine's military intelligence claims cyberattack on Russian strategic bomber makerJune 4th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/ukraine-military-russia-strategic-bomber)\n\n\n## [Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents![Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/recordedfuture_insikt_Main_Featured_Banner_1600x600_2a9d7e6d39.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/russia-aligned-tag-110-targets-tajikistan-with-macro-enabled)\n## [Measuring the US-China AI Gap![Measuring the US-China AI Gap](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_ta_2025_0508_Main_Feature_0873ea3526.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/measuring-the-us-china-ai-gap)\n## [TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered![TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/cta_2025_0501_Blog_Main_Feature_55a0e64897.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/terrastealerv2-and-terralogger)\n## [Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting![Uncovering MintsLoader With Recorded Future Malware Intelligence Hunting](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_cta_2025_0429_Main_Feature_e924c36cbd.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/uncovering-mintsloader-with-recorded-future-malware-intelligence-hunting)\n## [Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives![Iran\u2019s AI Ambitions: Balancing Economic Isolation with National Security Imperatives](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/irans_ai_ambitions_balancing_economic_isolation_national_security_imperatives_151fba814d.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/irans-ai-ambitions-balancing-economic-isolation-national-security-imperatives)\n",,
