224-FY25Q2_Scattered-Spider&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_content=sponsored-ad)\n  * [ ![Register to attend Xposure, the Exposure Management vSummit, to learn more about Exposure Management ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/technology\/linux-foundation-unveils-decentralized-wordpress-plugin-manager\/) Register to attend Xposure, the Exposure Management vSummit, to learn more about Exposure Management  ](https:\/\/events.pentera.io\/xposure2025?utm_source=Article%20&source=Article%20&utm_medium=Bleeping%20Computer%20&medium=Bleeping%20Computer%20&utm_campaign=Xposure&campaign=Xposure)\n  * [ ![Elevate your cyber defense: Learn to design powerful Blue Team playbooks with Wazuh.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/technology\/linux-foundation-unveils-decentralized-wordpress-plugin-manager\/) Elevate your cyber defense: Learn to design powerful Blue Team playbooks with Wazuh. ](https:\/\/wazuh.com\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wazuh_bleepingcomputer)\n  * [ ![Learn to build a strong Windows service\u2014protect your systems from malware. Start now!](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/technology\/linux-foundation-unveils-decentralized-wordpress-plugin-manager\/) Learn to build a strong Windows service\u2014protect your systems from malware. Start now! ](https:\/\/www.threatlocker.com\/?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=sponsor&utm_campaign=build_robust_windows_service_farid_q2_25&utm_content=build_robust_windows_service_farid&utm_term=display)\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/technology\/linux-foundation-unveils-decentralized-wordpress-plugin-manager\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comm