"summary": "The Arkana Security extortion gang temporarily put Ticketmaster data for sale, which was previously stolen in the 2024 Snowflake data theft attacks. This data was advertised as potentially newly breached, creating speculation. The tools and images used imply a resale of previously compromised data, suggesting involvement by the extortion group ShinyHunters. Organizations such as Ticketmaster, Santander, and others were affected during the Snowflake attacks. The widespread breach has led to active extortion attempts. Various companies were confirmed victims, but there are no new vulnerabilities or security patches available at this time.",,
