h this Webinar ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/xmcyber-meaningful-metrics-webinar)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/researchers-uncover-20-configuration.html) Download the Guide Top CISOs Use to Stop Lateral Movement Before It Spreads ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/elisity-microsegmentation-guide)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/researchers-uncover-20-configuration.html) 70% of Data Leaks Happen in the Browser\u2014Read the White Paper to See What DLP Misses ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/layerx-dlp-report-2025)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/researchers-uncover-20-configuration.html) New Phishing Kits Bypass Everything \u2014 See the Proof in this Expert Webinar ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/pushsecurity-phishing-webinar)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ AI Is Fast \u2014 So Are the Threats Learn How Hackers Are Targeting Hidden AI Identity Accounts AI boosts speed and scale\u2014but also risk. Hidden identity accounts can expose your systems if left unsecured. Register for Free ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=below) [ Protect What You Can't See Learn Real Techniques Hackers Use to Stay Hidden Discover how Zscaler's experts detect stealthy LOTS attacks hiding in trusted sites\u2014and how you can too. Secure Your Spot ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/threat-hunting-insights?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybersecurity Resources\n[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgQ5ubVSdBxlvBwgQF4AfTIEB5O8KQ1RZZiH5OSOpLpzxwkK7p9QhWxy_IqzUgRt88HTODTciWNL-FXcaVnX5HhPehXRaA3v2kHCbgMEaCf8OjGvfk95kb1DKfWe3vfj_pp9_rhuzKqcQFRlbsiOK-9ipYgQ7vdIrEHI1HwxvH7sr_OPGf9bsvuYViZOCWN\/s400-e100\/cloud.png) Cloud Data Security Snapshot: Current Exposure Trends Is Your Cloud Data Secure? Wiz Research analyzed over 150,000 cloud accounts to understand how organizations are managing data exposure, access control, and misconfigurations in the cloud.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/clou