"summary": "The article highlights the inadequacy of traditional detection-only strategies in cybersecurity. Modern cyber threats such as living-off-the-land (LOTL) attacks, advanced persistent threats (APTs), and multi-stage phishing are growing increasingly sophisticated, often involving AI-powered methods. These threats expose the limitations of conventional defenses, which typically fail to detect the full scope of an attack. The content discusses the need for security strategies that offer sequence awareness, attacker behavior modeling, contextual detection, and proactive disruption of attack chains. It also emphasizes the effectiveness of AI-powered tools, such as Symantec\u2019s Incident Prediction, which can predict and disrupt attack sequences, improving overall security posture.",,
