"title": "FIN6 Uses AWS-Hosted Fake Resumes on LinkedIn to Deliver More_eggs Malware",,
"url": "https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/fin6-uses-aws-hosted-fake-resumes-on.html",,
"summary": "The cybersecurity threat actor known as FIN6 has been identified utilizing fake resumes hosted on AWS infrastructure to deploy More_eggs malware via LinkedIn interactions. The group, posing as job seekers, engages with recruiters and uses phishing links from seemingly legitimate domains to deliver this malware. The More_eggs malware, developed by the Golden Chickens group, enables credential theft and access for further attacks like ransomware. FIN6 has previously targeted POS systems in the retail sector and utilized JavaScript skimming techniques to extract financial data, impacting e-commerce merchants. They exploit cloud services, such as AWS, to host phishing sites with advanced evasion strategies to bypass security measures.",,
