cles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/rust-based-myth-stealer-malware-spread.html) New Phishing Kits Bypass Everything \u2014 See the Proof in this Expert Webinar ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/pushsecurity-phishing-webinar)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/rust-based-myth-stealer-malware-spread.html) 70% of Data Leaks Happen in the Browser\u2014Read the White Paper to See What DLP Misses ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/layerx-dlp-report-2025)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/rust-based-myth-stealer-malware-spread.html) Download the Guide Top CISOs Use to Stop Lateral Movement Before It Spreads ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/elisity-microsegmentation-guide)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/rust-based-myth-stealer-malware-spread.html) Learn How to Align Security Metrics with Business Goals\u2014Watch this Webinar ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/xmcyber-meaningful-metrics-webinar)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ AI Is Fast \u2014 So Are the Threats Learn How Hackers Are Targeting Hidden AI Identity Accounts AI boosts speed and scale\u2014but also risk. Hidden identity accounts can expose your systems if left unsecured. Register ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=below) [ Protect What You Can't See Learn Real Techniques Hackers Use to Stay Hidden Discover how Zscaler's experts detect stealthy LOTS attacks hiding in trusted sites\u2014and how you can too. Register ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/threat-hunting-insights?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybersecurity Resources\n[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/rust-based-myth-stealer-malware-spread.html)ThreatLabz 2025 AI Security ReportSafely embrace the power of AI: Insights into the latest trends, risks, and security strategies.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/threatlabz-ai-report)[![Cybersecurity with Georgetown](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/rust-based-myth-stealer-malware-spread.html)Want To Excel as a Cybersecuri