"markdown": "X\n[![push](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/push\/Push-Security-Display-Ad-Telemetry.gif)](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/demo?utm_campaign=12905815-FY25_Bleeping+Computer&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored-content&utm_content=telemetry)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Technology](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/technology\/)\n  * Massive Heroku outage impacts web platforms worldwide\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/)\n\n\n# Massive Heroku outage impacts web platforms worldwide\nBy \n###### [Lawrence Abrams](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/lawrence-abrams\/)\n  * June 10, 2025\n  * 10:51 AM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Heroku](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2025\/06\/10\/heroku-white-header.jpg)\nHeroku is suffering a widespread outage that has lasted over six hours, preventing developers from logging into the platform and breaking website functionality.\nHeroku is a platform-as-a-service (PaaS) owned by Salesforce that allows developers to deploy applications to the cloud without managing infrastructure.\nThe outage began early Tuesday morning, with users reporting that Heroku apps no longer worked. Furthermore, the outage prevents developers from logging into the Heroku dashboard and utilizing the CLI tools.\n![Heroku outage preventing access to the dashboard](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/outages\/h\/heroku\/heroku-dashboard.jpg)**Heroku outage preventing access to the dashboard**\nHeroku acknowledged the incident on its [status page](https:\/\/status.heroku.com\/incidents\/2822), stating, \"Beginning at 06:03 UTC, Heroku is having intermittent outages which are currently being investigated.\"\nThe outage impacts a wide range of services from numerous companies and sites, such as SolarWinds, which cannot ingest logs due to the outage.\n\"We are observing an incident with log delivery from Heroku to SolarWinds Observability SaaS due to an ongoing Heroku incident,\" reads [SolarWinds status page](https:\/\/status.cloud.solarwinds.com\/).\nWebsites that utilize Heroku apps for various functionality are also impacted by the outage, with portions of their platform no longer working correctly.\nHeroku has not provided details on the root cause of the outage or when services will be restored.\nBleepingComputer asked Salesforce about the incident and will update the story if we hear back..\n_Update 6\/10\/25:_ Salesforce told BleepingComputer that there is no evidence of malicious activity for today's outage and customers can track updates at <https:\/\/status.salesforce.com\/generalmessages\/10001540>. As of 21:48:25 UTC, Heroku's status page now states:\n\"We have resolved issues with [dashboard.heroku.com](http:\/\/dashboard.heroku.com\/), and the site is now accessible to customers. As a workaround, while we continue implementing fixes, customers still impacted can run the following commands via their Heroku Command Line Interface:\n```\nheroku ps --app \u201d$APP\u201d to get a listing of all dyno names\nheroku ps:stop --dyno-name \u201d$DYNO\u201d --app \u201d$APP\u201d\n```\n\nImportant to note that dynos should be restarted one at a time to avoid a service disruption. Our efforts remain focused on internal testing and validation, and we continue to see incremental improvements in our other products. We will provide a resolution timeline as soon as possible, and we apologize for the continued trouble.\"\n[ ![Tines Needle](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/)](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n## [Why IT teams are ditching manual patch management](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\nPatching used to mean complex scripts, long hours, and endless fire drills. Not anymore.\nIn this new guide, Tines breaks down how modern IT orgs are leveling up with automation. Patch faster, reduce overhead, and focus on strategic work -- no complex scripts required.\n[Get the free guide](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n### Related Articles:\n[OpenAI working to fix ChatGPT outage affecting users worldwide](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/technology\/openai-working-to-fix-chatgpt-outage-affecting-users-worldwide\/)\n[Kettering Health hit by system-wide outage after ransomware attack](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/kettering-health-hit-by-system-wide-outage-after-ransomware-attack\/)\n[Hacker arrested for breaching 5,000 hosting accounts to mine crypto](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/hacker-arrested-for-breaching-5-000-hosting-accounts-to-mine-crypto\/)\n[SentinelOne: Last week\u2019s 7-hour outage caused by software flaw](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/technology\/sentinelone-last-weeks-7-hour-outage-caused-by-software-flaw\/)\n[MATLAB dev confirms ransomware attack behind service outage](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/mathworks-blames-ransomware-attack-for-ongoing-outages\/)\n  * [Cloud](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/cloud\/)\n  * [Heroku](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/heroku\/)\n  * [Outage](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/outage\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/lawrence-abrams\/)\n##### [Lawrence Abrams](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/lawrence-abrams\/)\nLawrence Abrams is the owner and Editor in Chief of BleepingComputer.com. Lawrence's area of expertise includes Windows, malware removal, and computer forensics. Lawrence Abrams is a co-author of the Winternals Defragmentation, Recovery, and Administration Field Guide and the technical editor for Rootkits for Dummies. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/ai-is-a-data-breach-time-bomb-reveals-new-report\/)\n  * [Next Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/ivanti-workspace-control-hardcoded-key-flaws-expose-sql-credentials\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Skuld Stealer story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/g\/gendigital\/Avast_v2_dog.png)](https:\/\/www.avast.com\/lp-free-av?full_trSrc=mmm_blp_dlp_008_407_b&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_campaign=blp_dlp_008_407_b:banner)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![United Natural Foods UNFI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/) Grocery wholesale giant United Natural Foods hit by cyberattack ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/grocery-wholesale-giant-united-natural-foods-hit-by-cyberattack\/)\n  * [ ![Patch Tuesday](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/) Microsoft June 2025 Patch Tuesday fixes exploited zero-day, 66 flaws ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-june-2025-patch-tuesday-fixes-exploited-zero-day-66-flaws\/)\n  * [ ![Chinese Hacker China](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/) SentinelOne shares new details on China-linked breach attempt ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/sentinelone-shares-new-details-on-china-linked-breach-attempt\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Learn about Scattered Spider\u2019s evolving TTPs and how to defend your organization](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/) Learn about Scattered Spider\u2019s evolving TTPs and how to defend your organization ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/webinar\/scatteredspider?utm_campaign=12883224-FY25Q2_Scattered-Spider&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_content=sponsored-ad)\n  * [ ![AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/) AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report ](https:\/\/info.varonis.com\/en\/state-of-data-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Elevate your cyber defense: Learn to design powerful Blue Team playbooks with Wazuh.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/) Elevate your cyber defense: Learn to design powerful Blue Team playbooks with Wazuh. ](https:\/\/wazuh.com\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wazuh_bleepingcomputer)\n  * [ ![Learn to build a strong Windows service\u2014protect your systems from malware. Start now!](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/) Learn to build a strong Windows service\u2014protect your systems from malware. Start now! ](https:\/\/www.threatlocker.com\/?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=sponsor&utm_campaign=build_robust_windows_service_farid_q2_25&utm_content=build_robust_windows_service_farid&utm_term=display)\n\n\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/massive-heroku-outage-impacts-web-platforms-worldwide\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.23661344397773332)\n",,
