"title": "WhatsApp moves to join Apple\u2019s encryption fight with UK government",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/whatsapp-uk-encryption-fight-apple",,
"summary": "WhatsApp announced plans to intervene in a legal case between Apple and the UK government over Apple's requirement to retain access to iCloud users' content for legal compliance. The dispute arose following the UK's demand for Apple to halt its Advanced Data Protection, which provides end-to-end encryption for iCloud, preventing authorities from accessing the data, even with legal warrants. WhatsApp's intervention aims to protect global privacy rights and prevent a precedent that could weaken encryption security globally.",,
