"title": "ChatGPT o3 API 80% price drop has no impact on performance",,
"url": "https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-o3-api-80-percent-price-drop-has-no-impact-on-performance\/",,
"summary": "OpenAI announced an 80% price reduction for the ChatGPT o3 API. Despite this price drop, the performance remains unchanged. The price for o3\u2019s input is now $2 per million tokens and $8 per million tokens for output. The API optimization has reduced costs without impacting performance. No cybersecurity vulnerabilities, malware threats, or threat groups were discussed in the context of the API's price drop. The content focuses on the technical optimization and business implication of the price change without delving into any cybersecurity threats.",,
