"markdown": "X\n[![push](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/push\/Push-Security-Display-Ad-Scattered-Spider.png)](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/webinar\/scatteredspider?utm_campaign=12905815-FY25_Bleeping+Computer&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored-content)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * ChatGPT o3 API 80% price drop has no impact on performance\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-o3-api-80-percent-price-drop-has-no-impact-on-performance\/)\n\n\n# ChatGPT o3 API 80% price drop has no impact on performance\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * June 11, 2025\n  * 08:06 PM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-o3-api-80-percent-price-drop-has-no-impact-on-performance\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2023\/03\/24\/ChatGPT-headpic.jpg)\nChatGPT o3 API is now cheaper for developers, and there's no visible impact on performance.\nOn Wednesday, OpenAI announced it's cutting the price of its best reasoning model, o3, by 80%.\n![o3](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/GPT-o3.jpg)**ChatGPT price reduction**\nThis means o3\u2019s input price is now just $2 per million tokens, while the output price has dropped to $8 per million tokens.\n\"We optimized our inference stack that serves o3. Same exact model\u2014just cheaper,\" OpenAI in a post on X.\nWhile regular users typically don't use ChatGPT models via API, the price drop makes tools relying on the API much cheaper, such as Cursor and Windsurf.\nIn a on X, the independent benchmark community ARC Prize confirmed that the o3-2025-04-16 model\u2019s performance didn\u2019t change after the price reduction.\n\"We compared the retest results with the original results and observed no difference in performance,\" the company said. \nThis confirms that OpenAI did not swap out the o3 model to reduce the price. Instead, the company truly optimized the inference stack that powers the model.\nIn addition, OpenAI rolled out o3-pro model in the API, which uses more compute to deliver better results.\n[ ![Tines Needle](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/t\/tines\/tines-needle.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n## [Why IT teams are ditching manual patch management](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\nPatching used to mean complex scripts, long hours, and endless fire drills. Not anymore.\nIn this new guide, Tines breaks down how modern IT orgs are leveling up with automation. Patch faster, reduce overhead, and focus on strategic work -- no complex scripts required.\n[Get the free guide](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n### Related Articles:\n[ChatGPT prepares o3-pro model for $200 Pro subscribers](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-prepares-o3-pro-model-for-200-pro-subscribers\/)\n[Researchers claim ChatGPT o3 bypassed shutdown in controlled test](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/researchers-claim-chatgpt-o3-bypassed-shutdown-in-controlled-test\/)\n[OpenAI plans to ship an interesting ChatGPT product by 2026](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-plans-to-ship-an-interesting-chatgpt-product-by-2026\/)\n[OpenAI confirms Operator Agent is now more accurate with o3](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-confirms-operator-agent-is-now-more-accurate-with-o3\/)\n[OpenAI plans to combine multiple models into GPT-5](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-plans-to-combine-multiple-models-into-gpt-5\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [Chat-GPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chat-gpt\/)\n  * [ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chatgpt\/)\n  * [GPT o3](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/gpt-o3\/)\n  * [OpenAI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/openai\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-o3-api-80-percent-price-drop-has-no-impact-on-performance\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/smartattack-uses-smartwatches-to-steal-data-from-air-gapped-systems\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Webinar](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/b\/bleepingcomputer\/Webcast-20250709_400x500.jpg)](https:\/\/www.scworld.com\/cybercast\/stolen-credentials-the-new-front-door-to-your-network?utm_source=partner-campaign&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=sc-cybercast-bleepingcomputer-2025-july)\n[![Webinar](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/b\/bleepingcomputer\/Webcast-20250709_400x500.jpg)](https:\/\/www.scworld.com\/cybercast\/stolen-credentials-the-new-front-door-to-your-network?utm_source=partner-campaign&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=sc-cybercast-bleepingcomputer-2025-july)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![United Natural Foods UNFI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-o3-api-80-percent-price-drop-has-no-impact-on-performance\/) Grocery wholesale giant United Natural Foods hit by cyberattack ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/grocery-wholesale-giant-united-natural-foods-hit-by-cyberattack\/)\n  * [ ![Patch Tuesday](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-o3-api-80-percent-price-drop-has-no-impact-on-performance\/) Microsoft June 2025 Patch Tuesday fixes exploited zero-day, 66 flaws ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-june-2025-patch-tuesday-fixes-exploited-zero-day-66-flaws\/)\n  * [ ![CPU Motherboard BIOS](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-o3-api-80-percent-price-drop-has-no-impact-on-performance\/) New Secure Boot flaw lets attackers install bootkit malware, patch now ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/new-secure-boot-flaw-lets-attackers-install-bootkit-malware-patch-now\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-o3-api-80-percent-price-drop-has-no-impact-on-performance\/) AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report ](https:\/\/info.varonis.com\/en\/state-of-data-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Elevate your cyber defense: Learn to design powerful Blue Team playbooks with Wazuh.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatg