"summary": "A new account takeover campaign, codenamed UNK_SneakyStrike by Proofpoint, is exploiting an open-source tool named TeamFiltration to breach Microsoft Entra ID user accounts. Over 80,000 accounts across multiple organizations have been targeted, using techniques such as user enumeration and password spraying. Attackers utilize Microsoft Teams API and Amazon Web Services to facilitate these activities. The campaign has led to unauthorized access to resources and applications like Microsoft Teams, OneDrive, and Outlook.",,
