"title": "AI Agents Run on Secret Accounts \u2014 Learn How to Secure Them in This Webinar",,
"url": "https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html",,
"summary": "The article discusses the security vulnerabilities associated with non-human identities (NHIs) such as API keys, service accounts, and OAuth tokens used by AI agents, chatbots, and automation scripts. These identities often operate without sufficient security oversight, making them targets for attackers who exploit them to move laterally in cloud environments, deploy malware, and exfiltrate data. Traditional identity access management (IAM) tools are insufficient for securing such identities, necessitating new strategies. The piece highlights an upcoming webinar aimed at educating security professionals on identifying and securing these invisible identities.",,
