"markdown": "[_\ue80a_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\nContact\/Tip Us\n[ _\uf0e0_ Reach out to get featured\u2014contact us to send your exclusive story idea, research, hacks, or ask us a question or leave a comment\/feedback! ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/p\/submit-news.html)\nFollow Us On Social Media\n[_\uf167_](https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/c\/thehackernews?sub_confirmation=1)\n[_\uf09e_ RSS Feeds](https:\/\/feeds.feedburner.com\/TheHackersNews) [_\uf0f3_ Email Alerts](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html#email-outer) [_\uf2c6_ Telegram Channel](https:\/\/t.me\/+wKrQxniFO1Q1OTRk)\n[![AWS EKS Security Best Practices](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEg8huJBVEvXupx8-XvBHKiOtZyICMh8wyW8VgfSaZUBvMGFFSrkPoFUpsjZfKnTjzwYBGDtM-ey2i7MA6aNhTFrJiZq55ISkJeKR19Qvwfonlc4YMbyfFbY0W83WtvkcMLRm3N5Z6IJdqtBQtgHjjRAPrlgCYSumFtdWLLk8mogc0Vyo3jjOpVTu5p4lApA\/s728-e100\/header.png)](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/wiz-eks-security-cheat-d)\n# [AI Agents Run on Secret Accounts \u2014 Learn How to Secure Them in This Webinar](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html)\n_\ue802_ Jun 12, 2025 _\ue804_ The Hacker NewsArtificial Intelligence \/ SaaS Security\n[![](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEi2fjX5AkZz5EPTekmdbbywcbvKjjyji1gS1uasZq3sjDhjHszDZ9U_syoOGeCqVepgXIApAjTYMSPYUTHXO_QDV-G5S1Ws7cHuOw9L2tsTQpfVpLcO22VTs15GAa_NqjWQwfSGFPDieZzBfwIU_afoN3ozb9z1TZXq13KrMhHzSRJ5fRwHKmKdRShyNew\/s728-rw-e365\/ai-agents.jpg)](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=article)\nAI is changing everything \u2014 from how we code, to how we sell, to how we secure. But while most conversations focus on what AI _can_ do, this one focuses on what AI _can break_ \u2014 if you're not paying attention.\nBehind every AI agent, chatbot, or automation script lies a growing number of **[non-human identities](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=article)** \u2014 API keys, service accounts, OAuth tokens \u2014 silently operating in the background.\nAnd here's the problem:\n\ud83d\udd10 **They're invisible**\n\ud83e\udde0 **They're powerful**\n\ud83d\udea8 **They're unsecured**\nIn traditional identity security, we protect users. With AI, we've quietly handed over control to software that impersonates users \u2014 often with more access, fewer guardrails, and no oversight.\nThis isn't theoretical. Attackers are already exploiting these identities to:\n  * Move laterally through cloud infrastructure\n  * Deploy malware via automation pipelines\n  * Exfiltrate data \u2014 without triggering a single alert\n\n\nOnce compromised, these identities can silently unlock critical systems. You don't get a second chance to fix what you can't see.\nIf you're building AI tools, deploying LLMs, or integrating automation into your SaaS stack \u2014 you're already depending on NHIs. And chances are, they're not secured. Traditional IAM tools aren't built for this. You need new strategies \u2014 fast.\nThis upcoming webinar, \"[Uncovering the Invisible Identities Behind AI Agents \u2014 and Securing Them](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=article),\" led by **Jonathan Sander** , Field CTO at **Astrix Security** , is not another \"AI hype\" talk. It's a wake-up call \u2014 and a roadmap.\n[![](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html)](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=article)\n### What You'll Learn (and Actually Use)[#](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html#what-you-ll-learn-and-actually-use-)\n  * How AI agents create **unseen identity sprawl**\n  * Real-world attack stories that never made the news\n  * Why traditional IAM tools can't protect NHIs\n  * Simple, scalable ways to **see** , **secure** , and **monitor** these identities\n\n\nMost organizations don't realize how exposed they are \u2014 until it's too late.\n[Watch this Webinar](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=article)\nThis session is essential for security leaders, CTOs, DevOps leads, and AI teams who can't afford silent failure.\nThe sooner you recognize the risk, the faster you can fix it.\nSeats are limited. And attackers aren't waiting. [Reserve Your Spot Now](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=article)\nFound this article interesting? This article is a contributed piece from one of our valued partners. Follow us on and to read more exclusive content we post.\nSHARE [_\uf1e0_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\n_\uf1e0_ Share\n[_\ue80a_](javascript:void\\(0\\)) [_\uf1d4_ Share on Hacker News](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F06%2Fai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html&t=AI%20Agents%20Run%20on%20Secret%20Accounts%20%E2%80%94%20Learn%20How%20to%20Secure%20Them%20in%20This%20Webinar) _\uf0e0_ Share on Email [_\uf232_ Share on WhatsApp](https:\/\/api.whatsapp.com\/send?text=AI%20Agents%20Run%20on%20Secret%20Accounts%20%E2%80%94%20Learn%20How%20to%20Secure%20Them%20in%20This%20Webinar \u2014 https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F06%2Fai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) [![Facebook Messenger](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html)Share on Facebook Messenger](fb-messenger:\/\/share\/?link=https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F06%2Fai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html&app_id=280117418781535) [_\uf2c6_ Share on Telegram](https:\/\/telegram.me\/share\/url?url=https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F06%2Fai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html&text=AI%20Agents%20Run%20on%20Secret%20Accounts%20%E2%80%94%20Learn%20How%20to%20Secure%20Them%20in%20This%20Webinar)\n[SHARE _\uf1e0_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\n[API Security](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/API%20Security)[artificial intelligence](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/artificial%20intelligence)[Cloud security](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Cloud%20security)[cybersecurity](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/cybersecurity)[DevOps](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/DevOps)[Identity Management](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Identity%20Management)[Malware](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Malware)[OAuth](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/OAuth)[SaaS Security](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/SaaS%20Security)[threat detection](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/threat%20detection)[webinar](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/webinar)\n[![c](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEip8d3xFs5d-TnSJCIrBY98bRFXqj0N5ZNQhMx-a3Zx2Fs4f8U3ba831jBtdPBnAEPcx7Z1M2Yq_bc-h6iaiacqX-z757srRYnhC4kEFLIAwHfMogwm4zOnt7gfxoq58kmkp7PSbzonqreYlC9U9tixoaNGcI5gqDZK1aaCXyxCdDPdK3N9Lw33Ea_T84am\/s300-e100\/em-course-4blocks.png)](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/em-course-4blocks)\n[![c](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgf3htno2k3FtYs6xQqRvYIOqrmqOFoTyPa6DkEV_Ep9gaj9Jk4LG66X10Z6104CmB-S1pCY0hnpwwe3JvBMRuZeTlRZbnoDgEpJnY111NJurNHeqUlJ8XSTcvr2Lvy0lGPsN1nU-4msWTfy_Qyn7v5MxxExQXugkSTz5T90lzcmdC0xfVO9WwB2ax8VU0C\/w300-e100\/chain.png)](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/true-cost-cves)\nMost Read News\n[ ![Popular Chrome Extensions Leak API Keys, User Data via HTTP and Hard-Coded Credentials ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) Popular Chrome Extensions Leak API Keys, User Data via HTTP and Hard-Coded Credentials  ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/popular-chrome-extensions-leak-api-keys.html)\n[ ![Redefining Cyber Value: Why Business Impact Should Lead the Security Conversation](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) Redefining Cyber Value: Why Business Impact Should Lead the Security Conversation ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/