tu, RHEL, Fedora ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/new-linux-flaws-allow-password-hash.html)\n[ ![From the 'Department of No' to a 'Culture of Yes': A Healthcare CISO's Journey to Enabling Modern Care](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) From the \"Department of No\" to a \"Culture of Yes\": A Healthcare CISO's Journey to Enabling Modern Care ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-department-of-no-to-culture-of-yes.html)\n[ ![Chinese APT41 Exploits Google Calendar for Malware Command-and-Control Operations](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) Chinese APT41 Exploits Google Calendar for Malware Command-and-Control Operations ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/chinese-apt41-exploits-google-calendar.html)\n[ ![New Chrome Zero-Day Actively Exploited; Google Issues Emergency Out-of-Band Patch](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) New Chrome Zero-Day Actively Exploited; Google Issues Emergency Out-of-Band Patch ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/new-chrome-zero-day-actively-exploited.html)\n[ ![The Secret Defense Strategy of Four Critical Industries Combating Advanced Cyber Threats](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) The Secret Defense Strategy of Four Critical Industries Combating Advanced Cyber Threats ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/the-secret-defense-strategy-of-four.html)\n[ ![Scattered Spider: Understanding Help Desk Scams and How to Defend Your Organization](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) Scattered Spider: Understanding Help Desk Scams and How to Defend Your Organization ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/scattered-spider-understanding-help.html)\nMore Stories \u25bc\nPopular Resources\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) Download the Guide Top CISOs Use to Stop Lateral Movement Before It Spreads ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/elisity-microsegmentation-guide)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) 70% of Data Leaks Happen in the Browser\u2014Read the White Paper to See What DLP Misses ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/layerx-dlp-report-2025)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) Learn How to Align Security Metrics with Business Goals\u2014Watch this Webinar ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/xmcyber-meaningful-metrics-webinar)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html) New Phishing Kits Bypass Everything \u2014 See the Proof in this Expert Webinar ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/pushsecurity-phishing-webinar)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ AI Is Fast \u2014 So Are the Threats Learn How Hackers Are Targeting Hidden AI Identity Accounts AI boosts speed and scale\u2014but also risk. Hidden identity accounts can expose your systems if left unsecured. Claim Your Spot ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=below) [ Protect What You Can't See Learn Real Techniques Hackers Use to Stay Hidden Discover how Zscaler's experts detect stealthy LOTS attacks hiding in trusted sites\u2014and how you can too. Watch This Now ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/threat-hunting-insights?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybersecurity Resources\n[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ai-agents-run-on-secret-accounts-learn.html)ThreatLabz 2025 AI Security ReportSafely embrace the power of AI: Insights into the latest trends, risks, and security strategies.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/threatlabz-ai-report)[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgQ5ubVSdBxlvBwgQF4AfTIEB5O8KQ1RZZiH5OSOpLpzxwkK7p9QhWxy_IqzUgRt88HTODTciWNL-FXcaVnX5HhPehXRaA3v2kHCbgMEaCf8OjGvfk95kb1DKfWe3vfj_pp9_rhuzKqcQFRl