to Stop Lateral Movement Before It Spreads ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/elisity-microsegmentation-guide)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/new-tokenbreak-attack-bypasses-ai.html) 70% of Data Leaks Happen in the Browser\u2014Read the White Paper to See What DLP Misses ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/layerx-dlp-report-2025)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ AI Is Fast \u2014 So Are the Threats Learn How Hackers Are Targeting Hidden AI Identity Accounts AI boosts speed and scale\u2014but also risk. Hidden identity accounts can expose your systems if left unsecured. Join the Webinar ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=below) [ Protect What You Can't See Learn Real Techniques Hackers Use to Stay Hidden Discover how Zscaler's experts detect stealthy LOTS attacks hiding in trusted sites\u2014and how you can too. Reserve Your Seat ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/threat-hunting-insights?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybersecurity Resources\n[![Cybersecurity with Georgetown](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/new-tokenbreak-attack-bypasses-ai.html)Want To Excel as a Cybersecurity Professional?Develop cybersecurity strategies that increase security with Georgetown.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/master-cyber-risk-1)[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/new-tokenbreak-attack-bypasses-ai.html)ThreatLabz 2025 AI Security ReportSafely embrace the power of AI: Insights into the latest trends, risks, and security strategies.](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/threatlabz-ai-report)[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgQ5ubVSdBxlvBwgQF4AfTIEB5O8KQ1RZZiH5OSOpLpzxwkK7p9QhWxy_IqzUgRt88HTODTciWNL-FXcaVnX5HhPehXRaA3v2kHCbgMEaCf8OjGvfk95kb1DKfWe3vfj_pp9_rhuzKqcQFRlbsiOK-9ipYgQ7vdIrEHI1HwxvH7sr_OPGf9bsvuYViZOCWN\/s400-e100\/cloud.png) Cloud Data Security Snapshot: Current Exposure Trends Is Your Cloud Data Secure? Wiz Research analyzed over 150,000 cloud accounts to understand how organizations are mana