: A Healthcare CISO's Journey to Enabling Modern Care ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/from-department-of-no-to-culture-of-yes.html)\n[ ![Popular Chrome Extensions Leak API Keys, User Data via HTTP and Hard-Coded Credentials ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/wordpress-sites-turned-weapon-how.html) Popular Chrome Extensions Leak API Keys, User Data via HTTP and Hard-Coded Credentials  ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/popular-chrome-extensions-leak-api-keys.html)\n[ ![Redefining Cyber Value: Why Business Impact Should Lead the Security Conversation](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/wordpress-sites-turned-weapon-how.html) Redefining Cyber Value: Why Business Impact Should Lead the Security Conversation ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/redefining-cyber-value-why-business.html)\n[ ![Microsoft OneDrive File Picker Flaw Grants Apps Full Cloud Access \u2014 Even When Uploading Just One File](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/wordpress-sites-turned-weapon-how.html) Microsoft OneDrive File Picker Flaw Grants Apps Full Cloud Access \u2014 Even When Uploading Just One File ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/microsoft-onedrive-file-picker-flaw.html)\n[ ![New Linux Flaws Allow Password Hash Theft via Core Dumps in Ubuntu, RHEL, Fedora](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/wordpress-sites-turned-weapon-how.html) New Linux Flaws Allow Password Hash Theft via Core Dumps in Ubuntu, RHEL, Fedora ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/new-linux-flaws-allow-password-hash.html)\nMore Stories \u25bc\nPopular Resources\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/wordpress-sites-turned-weapon-how.html) New Phishing Kits Bypass Everything \u2014 See the Proof in this Expert Webinar ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/pushsecurity-phishing-webinar)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/wordpress-sites-turned-weapon-how.html) 70% of Data Leaks Happen in the Browser\u2014Read the White Paper to See What DLP Misses ](https:\