Calendar for Malware Command-and-Control Operations](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ctem-is-new-soc-shifting-from.html) Chinese APT41 Exploits Google Calendar for Malware Command-and-Control Operations ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/chinese-apt41-exploits-google-calendar.html)\nMore Stories \u25bc\nPopular Resources\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ctem-is-new-soc-shifting-from.html) Download the Guide Top CISOs Use to Stop Lateral Movement Before It Spreads ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/elisity-microsegmentation-guide)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ctem-is-new-soc-shifting-from.html) Learn How to Align Security Metrics with Business Goals\u2014Watch this Webinar ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/xmcyber-meaningful-metrics-webinar)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ctem-is-new-soc-shifting-from.html) New Phishing Kits Bypass Everything \u2014 See the Proof in this Expert Webinar ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/pushsecurity-phishing-webinar)\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/ctem-is-new-soc-shifting-from.html) 70% of Data Leaks Happen in the Browser\u2014Read the White Paper to See What DLP Misses ](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/layerx-dlp-report-2025)\n## Cybersecurity Webinars\n[ AI Is Fast \u2014 So Are the Threats Learn How Hackers Are Targeting Hidden AI Identity Accounts AI boosts speed and scale\u2014but also risk. Hidden identity accounts can expose your systems if left unsecured. Claim Your Spot ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/ai-agents-identities?source=below) [ Protect What You Can't See Learn Real Techniques Hackers Use to Stay Hidden Discover how Zscaler's experts detect stealthy LOTS attacks hiding in trusted sites\u2014and how you can too. Secure Your Spot ](https:\/\/thehacker.news\/threat-hunting-insights?source=below)\nLatest News\nCybersecurity Resources\n[![90 Days as CISO](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgml2SKSW7YRBpTLt7dx7