"title": "Microsoft: KB5060533 update triggers boot errors on Surface Hub v1 devices",,
"url": "https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-kb5060533-update-triggers-boot-errors-on-surface-hub-v1-devices\/",,
"summary": "The KB5060533 update by Microsoft for Windows 10, version 22H2, causes boot errors specifically on Surface Hub v1 devices, leading to Secure Boot violations. The issue is being investigated and a mitigation to prevent further impact was released by Microsoft. The update initially addressed another issue with Hyper-V virtual machines but inadvertently affected the boot process of some Surface Hub v1 systems. This problem does not impact Surface Hub 2S and Surface Hub 3 devices.",,
