"title": "Government offices in North Carolina, Georgia disrupted by cyberattacks",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/thomasville-nc-government-ogeechee-ga-district-cyberattacks",,
"summary": "Recent cyberattacks have disrupted operations at government offices in Thomasville, North Carolina, and the Ogeechee Judicial Circuit District Attorney's Office in Georgia. Thomasville's city systems are offline following an attack on municipal systems, with authorities unsure if sensitive data was accessed. The Ogeechee District experienced phone and internet outages affecting operations, despite incomplete backup system installations. New cybersecurity measures helped limit the attack's impact, preventing significant data loss.",,
