"url": "https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-search-gets-an-upgrade-as-openai-takes-aim-at-google\/",,
"summary": "OpenAI has rolled out an update to the ChatGPT Search feature, aiming to improve the quality of search results and challenge Google's dominance. The new version enhances the natural language interface, provides more up-to-date responses, and includes links for fact-checking. Users can expect smarter answers and better query understanding. Despite improvements, OpenAI acknowledges that occasional errors may still occur, urging users to verify the information.",,
