"markdown": "X\n[![push](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/push\/Push-Security-Display-Ad-Scattered-Spider.png)](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/webinar\/scatteredspider?utm_campaign=12905815-FY25_Bleeping+Computer&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored-content)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * ChatGPT's AI coder Codex now lets you choose the best solution\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/)\n\n\n# ChatGPT's AI coder Codex now lets you choose the best solution\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * June 15, 2025\n  * 03:59 PM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![Codex](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2023\/03\/24\/ChatGPT_headpic.jpg)\nChatGPT's Codex, which is an AI agent that lets you code and delegate programming tasks, is now testing a new feature that lets you choose the best solution.\nOpenAI [launched](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-codex-an-ai-tool-for-software-programming\/) Codex in April, and it's a great tool, but it's nowhere close to replacing entry-level engineers.\nOpenAI insists Codex could help developers achieve more by delegating their tasks to different agents, and a new update brings it closer to the expectations set by the company.\nAs per the [release notes](https:\/\/help.openai.com\/en\/articles\/11428266-codex-changelog), ChatGPT Codex can now generate multiple responses simultaneously for a single task.\nThis means users can now explore multiple solutions, and pick the best approach instead of asking OpenAI to give another approach.\nIn addition, OpenAI has added some keyboard shortcuts and a page to explore them.\nFor example, you can now open Codex by pressing \u2318-\/ on macOS and Ctrl+\/ on other platforms. The update has added a \u201cbranch\u201d query parameter in addition to the existing \u201cenvironment\u201d, \u201cprompt\u201d and \u201ctab=archived\u201d parameters.\nHere's the complete changelog:\n  * Added a loading indicator when downloading a repo during container setup.\n  * Added support for cancelling tasks.\n  * Fixed issues causing tasks to fail during setup.\n  * Fixed issues running followups in environments where the setup script changes files that are gitignored.\n  * Improved how the agent understands and reacts to network access restrictions.\n  * Increased the update rate of text describing what Codex is doing.\n  * Increased the limit for setup script duration to 20 minutes for Pro, Team, and Business users.\n  * Polished code diffs: You can now option-click a code diff header to expand\/collapse all of them.\n\n\nCodex is based on codex-1, which is a new version of ChatGPT based on the existing o3 model, but it has been optimized for coding, which results in increased accuracy.\n![Codex in ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/Codex-GPT.jpg)**Codex in ChatGPT**\nCodex pulls codebase from GitHub, and it can write new code, propose pull requests, and run each task in its own sandbox.\nCodex is available with $20 Plus subscription.\n[ ![Tines Needle](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/t\/tines\/tines-needle.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n## [Why IT teams are ditching manual patch management](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\nPatching used to mean complex scripts, long hours, and endless fire drills. Not anymore.\nIn this new guide, Tines breaks down how modern IT orgs are leveling up with automation. Patch faster, reduce overhead, and focus on strategic work -- no complex scripts required.\n[Get the free guide](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n### Related Articles:\n[OpenAI plans to combine multiple models into GPT-5](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-plans-to-combine-multiple-models-into-gpt-5\/)\n[ChatGPT o3 API 80% price drop has no impact on performance](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-o3-api-80-percent-price-drop-has-no-impact-on-performance\/)\n[ChatGPT prepares o3-pro model for $200 Pro subscribers](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-prepares-o3-pro-model-for-200-pro-subscribers\/)\n[OpenAI is hopeful GPT-5 will compete a little more](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-is-hopeful-gpt-5-will-compete-a-little-more\/)\n[ChatGPT rolls out Memory upgrade for free users](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-rolls-out-memory-upgrade-for-free-users\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * [Chat-GPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chat-gpt\/)\n  * [ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chatgpt\/)\n  * [OpenAI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/openai\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-search-gets-an-upgrade-as-openai-takes-aim-at-google\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Webinar](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/b\/bleepingcomputer\/Webcast-20250709-V02_400x500.jpg)](https:\/\/www.scworld.com\/cybercast\/stolen-credentials-the-new-front-door-to-your-network?utm_source=partner-campaign&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=sc-cybercast-bleepingcomputer-2025-july)\n[![Webinar](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/b\/bleepingcomputer\/Webcast-20250709-V02_400x500.jpg)](https:\/\/www.scworld.com\/cybercast\/stolen-credentials-the-new-front-door-to-your-network?utm_source=partner-campaign&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=sc-cybercast-bleepingcomputer-2025-july)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Globe map DDoS outage](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/) Google Cloud and Cloudflare hit by widespread service outages ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/technology\/google-cloud-and-cloudflare-hit-by-widespread-service-outages\/)\n  * [ ![Microsoft 365](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/) Microsoft confirms auth issues affecting Microsoft 365 users ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-confirms-auth-issues-affecting-microsoft-365-users\/)\n  * [ ![EntraID](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/) Password-spraying attacks target 80,000 Microsoft Entra ID accounts ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/password-spraying-attacks-target-80-000-microsoft-entra-id-accounts\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Learn about Scattered Spider\u2019s evolving TTPs and how to defend your organization](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/) Learn about Scattered Spider\u2019s evolving TTPs and how to defend your organization ](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/webinar\/scatteredspider?utm_campaign=12883224-FY25Q2_Scattered-Spider&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_content=sponsored-ad)\n  * [ ![Learn to build a strong Windows service\u2014protect your systems from malware. Start now!](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/) Learn to build a strong Windows service\u2014protect your systems from malware. Start now! ](https:\/\/www.threatlocker.com\/?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=sponsor&utm_campaign=build_robust_windows_service_farid_q2_25&utm_content=build_robust_windows_service_farid&utm_term=display)\n  * [ ![Elevate your cyber defense: Learn to design powerful Blue Team playbooks with Wazuh.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/) Elevate your cyber defense: Learn to design powerful Blue Team playbooks with Wazuh. ](https:\/\/wazuh.com\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wazuh_bleepingcomputer)\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/) AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report ](https:\/\/info.varonis.com\/en\/state-of-data-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n\n\n[![Picus](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/g\/gendigital\/GD-300-600-Laptop-v1.png)](https:\/\/www.avast.com\/lp-free-av?full_trSrc=mmm_blp_dlp_008_407_d&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_campaign=blp_dlp_008_407_d:sidebar)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250