s with Wazuh.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-june-windows-server-security-updates-cause-dhcp-issues\/) Elevate your cyber defense: Learn to design powerful Blue Team playbooks with Wazuh. ](https:\/\/wazuh.com\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wazuh_bleepingcomputer)\n  * [ ![Learn to build a strong Windows service\u2014protect your systems from malware. Start now!](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-june-windows-server-security-updates-cause-dhcp-issues\/) Learn to build a strong Windows service\u2014protect your systems from malware. Start now! ](https:\/\/www.threatlocker.com\/?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=sponsor&utm_campaign=build_robust_windows_service_farid_q2_25&utm_content=build_robust_windows_service_farid&utm_term=display)\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-june-windows-server-security-updates-cause-dhcp-issues\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n\n\n[![Picus](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/g\/gendigital\/GD-300-600-Laptop-v2.png)](https:\/\/www.avast.com\/lp-free-av?full_trSrc=mmm_blp_dlp_008_407_e&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_campaign=blp_dlp_008_407_e:sidebar)\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-june-windows-server-security-updates-cause-dhcp-issues\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this