"title": "UK appoints first-ever female chief of foreign intelligence service MI6",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/blaise-metreweli-new-mi6-chief",,
"summary": "Blaise Metreweli has been appointed as the first-ever female chief of the UK's foreign intelligence service, MI6. This marks a historic change, as the leadership has been held by 17 men since its founding in 1909. Metreweli has an extensive background in intelligence, previously serving as director general at MI6's Q branch and in a director-level role at MI5. Her appointment follows other historic leadership changes in British intelligence agencies, with females leading GCHQ and MI5. Blaise emphasized the importance of working alongside MI5 and GCHQ to keep the British people safe.",,
