"title": "Bipartisan bill aims to create CISA-HHS liaison for hospital cyberattacks",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/bill-proposes-cisa-hhs-liaison-hospital-cyberattacks",,
"summary": "A bipartisan bill, the Healthcare Cybersecurity Act, has been introduced to establish a liaison between CISA and HHS for better communication and coordination in response to hospital cyberattacks. The bill aims to improve threat analysis, incident response, and cybersecurity training for healthcare workers. It also requires CISA and HHS to conduct vulnerability studies and submit a detailed report to Congress on cybersecurity risks and protections for healthcare sectors.",,
