"markdown": "![Keir Giles](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/large_keir_giles_brussels_press_club_20230911_06dfd634f8.jpg)\nKeir Giles speaks at event at the Brussels Press Club in September 2023. Image: Mieroszewski Centre \/ mieroszewski.pl\n[Alexander Martin](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/alexander-martin)June 16th, 2025\n# Hackers impersonating US government compromise email account of prominent Russia researcher\nKeir Giles, a prominent British researcher on Russia, announced this weekend that several of his email accounts had been targeted \u201cwith a sophisticated account takeover\u201d by hackers impersonating the U.S. State Department. \nIn on LinkedIn, Giles \u2014 the author of \u201cRussia's War on Everybody\u201d and a consulting fellow at the Chatham House think tank \u2014 told his contacts to handle with caution any unexpected emails they received from him. \n\u201cIn our long collective experience with sophisticated account takeovers, there\u2019s a likelihood that anything that the attackers acquired before they were locked out \u2014 including, potentially, messages you or others have sent me, may be included in a future tainted data dump,\u201d he wrote. \nIt follows Giles being [targeted last year](https:\/\/therecord.media\/russian-campaign-impersonating-western-researchers-academics) by hackers working for Russia\u2019s intelligence services who impersonated researchers and academics in an ongoing campaign to gain access to their colleagues\u2019 email accounts. Giles\u2019 accounts were not compromised at that time. \nIndependent analyses of the emails, attachments and credential-harvesting infrastructure targeting Giles were conducted by cybersecurity companies Secureworks and Mandiant. \nBoth companies said they believed the campaign was perpetrated by a state-sponsored threat group tracked variously as [Iron Frontier](https:\/\/www.secureworks.com\/research\/threat-profiles\/iron-frontier), [Calisto](https:\/\/blog.sekoia.io\/calisto-continues-its-credential-harvesting-campaign\/), [Coldriver](https:\/\/blog.google\/threat-analysis-group\/update-on-cyber-activity-in-eastern-europe\/) or [Star Blizzard](https:\/\/therecord.media\/microsoft-disrupts-russia-linked-hacking-group-targeting-defense-and-intelligence-orgs), that the British government has assessed to be operating for the Russian intelligence services. \nThat group was attributed to Center 18 of the Russian Federal Security Service (FSB) by the British government in 2013, which [summoned the Russian ambassador](https:\/\/therecord.media\/uk-names-fsb-unit-behind-hack-and-leak-operation) over the activities of the hacking group as it accused the Kremlin of being behind a \u201csustained but unsuccessful\u201d campaign of hack-and-leak operations designed to undermine democratic institutions. \nAt the same time, the U.S. Department of Justice [charged two Russian nationals](https:\/\/www.justice.gov\/opa\/media\/1327601\/dl?inline) with being part of Center 18\u2019s spearphishing campaigns dating back to 2016: FSB officer Ruslan Aleksandrovich Peretyatko and Andrey Stanislavovich Korinets, who was not described as an FSB officer but as the creator of the fraudulent domains. \nAccording to the British government, Center 18\u2019s previous targets in the United Kingdom include [Sir Richard Dearlove](https:\/\/www.spectator.co.uk\/article\/how-a-pro-brexit-group-was-hacked-by-russia\/), the former head of the Secret Intelligence Service (MI6), and a think tank called the [Institute for Statecraft](https:\/\/news.sky.com\/story\/labour-says-anti-fake-news-charity-spread-fake-news-about-the-party-and-jeremy-corbyn-11577566), which had worked on countering Russian information operations. \n  * [](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=&t=Hackers impersonating US government compromise email account of prominent Russia researcher)\n  * [](https:\/\/bsky.app\/intent\/compose?text=Hackers impersonating US government compromise email account of prominent Russia researcher )\n\n\n  * [People](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/people)\n  * [News](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n  * [Nation-state](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/nation-state)\n\n\nGet more insights with the \nRecorded Future\nIntelligence Cloud.\n[Learn more.](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/platform?mtm_campaign=ad-unit-record)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_300x1050_1_0f2f11757e.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_970x250_1_d144dbf901.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\nTags\n  * [Russia](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/russia)\n  * [think tanks](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/think-tanks)\n  * [Hack](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/hack)\n  * [Cyberattack](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/cyberattack)\n  * [email](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/email)\n  * [Academia](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/academia)\n  * [United Kingdom](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/united-kingdom)\n  * [COLDRIVER](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/coldriver)\n  * [Callisto Group](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/callisto-group)\n  * [FSB](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/fsb)\n\n\nNo previous article\nNo new articles\n[![Alexander Martin](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/headshot_79eb085f87.jpeg)](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/alexander-martin)\n[Alexander Martin](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/alexander-martin)\nis the UK Editor for Recorded Future News. He was previously a technology reporter for Sky News and is also a fellow at the European Cyber Conflict Research Initiative.\n## Briefs\n  * [Hackers impersonating US government compromise email account of prominent Russia researcherJune 16th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/keir-giles-russia-researcher-email-hacked)\n  * [CISA warns of SimpleHelp ransomware compromises after string of retail attacksJune 13th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/cisa-warns-of-simplehelp-ransomware-compromises)\n  * [Predator spotted in Mozambique for first time, another sign of spyware\u2019s availabilityJune 12th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/predator-spyware-mozambique)\n  * [Dozens arrested across Asia in global infostealer malware crackdownJune 11th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/dozens-arrested-infostealer-interpol-crackdown)\n  * [FIN6 cybercriminals pose as job seekers on LinkedIn to hack recruiters June 11th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/fin6-recruitment-scam-malware-campaign)\n  * [Hundreds of Russian devices hit by Rare Werewolf cryptomining attacksJune 10th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/russian-devices-hit-by-rare-werewolf-crypto-mining)\n  * [Nearly 300,000 crash records stolen from Texas transportation departmentJune 9th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/car-crash-records-stolen-texas-transportation-department)\n  * [Major food wholesaler says cyberattack impacting distribution systemsJune 9th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/major-food-wholesaler-cyberattack-impacting-distribution)\n  * [New hacker group uses LockBit ransomware variant to target Russian companiesJune 9th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/new-hacker-group-lockbit-target-russia)\n\n\n## [GrayAlpha Uses Diverse Infection Vectors to Deploy PowerNet Loader and NetSupport RAT![GrayAlpha Uses Diverse Infection Vectors to Deploy PowerNet Loader and NetSupport RAT](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/recordedfuture_insikt_cover_gray_alpha_1600x600_e9dc818048.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/grayalpha-uses-diverse-infection-vectors-deploy-powernet-loader-netsupport-rat)\n## [Predator Still Active, with New Client and Corporate Links Identified![Predator Still Active, with New Client and Corporate Links Identified](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/recordedfuture_insikt_cover_predator_1600x600_2acdebaf2c.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/predator-still-active-new-links-identified)\n## [Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents![Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/recordedfuture_insikt_Main_Featured_Banner_1600x600_2a9d7e6d39.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/russia-aligned-tag-110-targets-tajikistan-with-macro-enabled)\n## [Measuring the US-China AI Gap![Measuring the US-China AI Gap](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/BLOG_ta_2025_0508_Main_Feature_0873ea3526.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/measuring-the-us-china-ai-gap)\n## [TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered![TerraStealerV2 and TerraLogger: Golden Chickens' New Malware Families Discovered](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/cta_2025_0501_Blog_Main_Feature_55a0e64897.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/terrastealerv2-and-terralogger)\n",,
