"title": "Microsoft shares temp fix for Outlook crashes when opening emails",,
"url": "https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-shares-workaround-for-classic-outlook-crashes\/",,
"summary": "Microsoft has provided a workaround for an issue that causes the classic Outlook email client to crash when opening or starting a new message. This issue affects users in the Monthly Enterprise Channel who updated Outlook for Microsoft 365 starting with Version 2504 (Build 18730.20122). The crash occurs due to inability to open the Forms Library and primarily affects virtual desktop infrastructures. A temporary fix involves creating a FORMS2 folder in a specified directory.",,
