"title": "Police dismantle Archetyp dark web drug market, arrest administrator",,
"url": "https:\/\/therecord.media\/archetyp-market-dark-web-takedown-europol",,
"summary": "International law enforcement agencies successfully dismantled the Archetyp Market, a major dark web drug marketplace, by arresting its alleged administrator\u2014a German national\u2014in Barcelona. The operation also targeted moderators, top vendors, and the marketplace's technical infrastructure in several European countries. Investigators seized approximately \u20ac7.8 million in assets, including luxury vehicles and cryptocurrency. Archetyp Market had facilitated the sale of various narcotics and claimed over 600,000 users and extensive transactions. The takedown follows years of financial tracking and architectural mapping, aiming to cut a significant supply line for dangerous substances globally.",,
