"title": "The Ghost of Spectres Past",,
"url": "https:\/\/www.security.com\/expert-perspectives\/ghost-spectres-past",,
"summary": "Spectre is a persistent vulnerability in modern CPUs related to speculative execution, impacting performance and security. The hardware nature of Spectre makes it impossible to fully eliminate, leading to reliance on mitigation strategies like accurate inventory management and patching. Tools like Symantec\u2019s Asset Management Suite assist in managing these challenges.",,
