:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/scattered-spider-understanding-help.html)\n[ ![U.S. DoJ Seizes 4 Domains Supporting Cybercrime Crypting Services in Global Operation](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/veeam-patches-cve-2025-23121-critical.html) U.S. DoJ Seizes 4 Domains Supporting Cybercrime Crypting Services in Global Operation ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/us-doj-seizes-4-domains-supporting.html)\n[ ![New PumaBot Botnet Targets Linux IoT Devices to Steal SSH Credentials and Mine Crypto](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/veeam-patches-cve-2025-23121-critical.html) New PumaBot Botnet Targets Linux IoT Devices to Steal SSH Credentials and Mine Crypto ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/new-pumabot-botnet-targets-linux-iot.html)\n[ ![The Secret Defense Strategy of Four Critical Industries Combating Advanced Cyber Threats](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/veeam-patches-cve-2025-23121-critical.html) The Secret Defense Strategy of Four Critical Industries Combating Advanced Cyber Threats ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/the-secret-defense-strategy-of-four.html)\n[ ![Popular Chrome Extensions Leak API Keys, User Data via HTTP and Hard-Coded Credentials ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/veeam-patches-cve-2025-23121-critical.html) Popular Chrome Extensions Leak API Keys, User Data via HTTP and Hard-Coded Credentials  ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/popular-chrome-extensions-leak-api-keys.html)\n[ ![Chinese APT41 Exploits Google Calendar for Malware Command-and-Control Operations](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/veeam-patches-cve-2025-23121-critical.html) Chinese APT41 Exploits Google Calendar for Malware Command-and-Control Operations ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/chinese-apt41-exploits-google-calendar.html)\nMore Stories \u25bc\nPopular Resources\n[ ![Articles](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/veeam-patches-cve-2025-23121-critical.html) Simplify SaaS Security: One Platform, Zero Complexity, Fu