ith this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/instagram-ads-mimicking-bmo-eq-banks-are-finance-scams\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.7280173057589173)![](https:\/\/sync.intentiq.com\/profiles_engine\/ProfilesEngineServlet?at=20&mi=10&secure=1&dpi=456059511&iiqidtype=2&iiqpcid=b765e4ef-7a34-4837-83ff-77d135928916&iiqpciddate=1750257024145&tsrnd=192_1750257024145&vrref=&jsver=5.082)\n",,
