"markdown": "[_\ue80a_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\nContact\/Tip Us\n[ _\uf0e0_ Reach out to get featured\u2014contact us to send your exclusive story idea, research, hacks, or ask us a question or leave a comment\/feedback! ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/p\/submit-news.html)\nFollow Us On Social Media\n[_\uf167_](https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/c\/thehackernews?sub_confirmation=1)\n[_\uf09e_ RSS Feeds](https:\/\/feeds.feedburner.com\/TheHackersNews) [_\uf0f3_ Email Alerts](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/meta-adds-passkey-login-support-to.html#email-outer) [_\uf2c6_ Telegram Channel](https:\/\/t.me\/+wKrQxniFO1Q1OTRk)\n[![AWS EKS Security Best Practices](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEiZLvfEiF0mIN5JYAVIj4efKgKKH8SaMBLIYVSTIfHTfaA8mpwqvAxp8wWSq73qsUYWQus2_tM5Kzw9weRVdQ0RYavu30YG1Xr0ol0renB6HmhjtI9IvxO1-MCUJ4TnLqnePPgBEe4CqDKmPQvfOXX6nOpNDkewgEAHURtd7YhX1SbyTBVMIVC6GBXwkAOa\/s728-e100\/ai-security-readiness-d.png)](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/ai-security-readiness-d)\n# [Meta Adds Passkey Login Support to Facebook for Android and iOS Users](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/meta-adds-passkey-login-support-to.html)\n_\ue802_ Jun 19, 2025 _\ue804_ Ravie LakshmananMobile Security \/ Passwordless\n[![](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEh1DbBs0i8vK4AVwOjZVymSEeiXG8kc6jjQOvSceklG6u97UEKBsUk7OV5Ge_Ypk1khFx1nfklxXVhuQd6D-Tp5lBt2yeDxtu31837EWDsBx5tdgHZ0e8J6cOcMls7rRFeShpI16avBUW9MBuWrw9yJjZJB30QB2dQWou1Ro87FvR0inWMmAHlLy9Ap3id6\/s728-rw-e365\/meta.jpg)](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEh1DbBs0i8vK4AVwOjZVymSEeiXG8kc6jjQOvSceklG6u97UEKBsUk7OV5Ge_Ypk1khFx1nfklxXVhuQd6D-Tp5lBt2yeDxtu31837EWDsBx5tdgHZ0e8J6cOcMls7rRFeShpI16avBUW9MBuWrw9yJjZJB30QB2dQWou1Ro87FvR0inWMmAHlLy9Ap3id6\/s728-rw-e365\/meta.jpg)\nMeta Platforms on Wednesday announced that it's adding support for passkeys, the next-generation password standard, on Facebook.\n\"Passkeys are a new way to verify your identity and login to your account that's easier and more secure than traditional passwords,\" the tech giant [said](https:\/\/about.fb.com\/news\/2025\/06\/introducing-passkeys-facebook-easier-sign-in\/) in a post.\nSupport for passkeys is expected to be available \"soon\" on Android and iOS mobile devices. The feature is also coming to its Messenger platform in the coming months.\nThe company said passkeys can also be used to auto-fill payment information when making purchases using Meta Pay.\n[![Cybersecurity](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/meta-adds-passkey-login-support-to.html)](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/2025-threat-report-d \"Cybersecurity\")\nMeta previously rolled out passkeys support for in October 2023, and on iOS a in April 2024. There is no word yet on when it plans to bring passkeys to Instagram.\nPasskeys, backed by the FIDO Alliance, is a passwordless authentication solution that allows users to securely sign in to online services by using biometrics or the device lock PIN code.\n[![](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/meta-adds-passkey-login-support-to.html)](https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEgc3uBIpoQlbpUUYGtOfZGdKcLJWCP9DuoYBeUXWdrlVB1fHD76O-2H8iUb7nJELZ9yhzOt3vK-W6HKxaLmAq7gzhg0xWF1CBd-sHTgErQbM1zGNitQ_Qrs1rCIXzwnfFlkwqCCZwSBCqqcqY80stxk7ZQ11Qg36A4cuMnv3He59MYYf_sdXSQjEgHdSLEM\/s728-rw-e365\/fb.gif)\n\"Passkeys are an upgrade in security compared to traditional passwords and one-time SMS codes because they are resistant to guessing or theft by malicious websites or scam links, making them effective against phishing and password spraying attacks,\" Meta said.\nLast month, Microsoft made passkeys the [default sign-in method](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/05\/microsoft-sets-passkeys-default-for-new.html) for new consumer accounts. More recently, Apple [previewed](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/weekly-recap-iphone-spyware-microsoft-0.html#:~:text=Apple%20Updates%20Passwords%20App%20with%20New%20Features) upcoming changes to its Passwords app that allows users to import and export passkeys between participating credential manager apps across iOS, iPadOS, macOS, and visionOS 26.\nFound this article interesting? Follow us on and to read more exclusive content we post.\nSHARE [_\uf1e0_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\n_\uf1e0_ Share\n[_\ue80a_](javascript:void\\(0\\)) [_\uf1d4_ Share on Hacker News](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F06%2Fmeta-adds-passkey-login-support-to.html&t=Meta%20Adds%20Passkey%20Login%20Support%20to%20Facebook%20for%20Android%20and%20iOS%20Users) _\uf0e0_ Share on Email [_\uf232_ Share on WhatsApp](https:\/\/api.whatsapp.com\/send?text=Meta%20Adds%20Passkey%20Login%20Support%20to%20Facebook%20for%20Android%20and%20iOS%20Users \u2014 https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F06%2Fmeta-adds-passkey-login-support-to.html) [![Facebook Messenger](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/meta-adds-passkey-login-support-to.html)Share on Facebook Messenger](fb-messenger:\/\/share\/?link=https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F06%2Fmeta-adds-passkey-login-support-to.html&app_id=280117418781535) [_\uf2c6_ Share on Telegram](https:\/\/telegram.me\/share\/url?url=https%3A%2F%2Fthehackernews.com%2F2025%2F06%2Fmeta-adds-passkey-login-support-to.html&text=Meta%20Adds%20Passkey%20Login%20Support%20to%20Facebook%20for%20Android%20and%20iOS%20Users)\n[SHARE _\uf1e0_](javascript:void\\(0\\))\n[Apple](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Apple)[Authentication](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Authentication)[cybersecurity](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/cybersecurity)[Facebook](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Facebook)[FIDO Alliance](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/FIDO%20Alliance)[Identity Management](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Identity%20Management)[Messenger](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/search\/label\/Messenger)[Meta](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/s