"summary": "DuckDuckGo has enhanced its Scam Blocker tool to shield users from a variety of online scams, including fake e-commerce stores and scam cryptocurrency sites. This privacy-oriented feature has been a part of DuckDuckGo since 2018 and now includes defenses against scareware, survey scams, and malvertising. The tool works primarily by using an updated list from Netcraft and conducting anonymous checks to ensure privacy.",,
