om-scam-hits.html) Think Your IdP or CASB Covers Shadow IT? These 5 Risks Prove Otherwise ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/think-your-idp-or-casb-covers-shadow-it.html)\n[ ![How to Build a Lean Security Model: 5 Lessons from River Island](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/bluenoroff-deepfake-zoom-scam-hits.html) How to Build a Lean Security Model: 5 Lessons from River Island ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/how-to-build-lean-security-model-5.html)\n[ ![Over 269,000 Websites Infected with JSFireTruck JavaScript Malware in One Month](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/bluenoroff-deepfake-zoom-scam-hits.html) Over 269,000 Websites Infected with JSFireTruck JavaScript Malware in One Month ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/over-269000-websites-infected-with.html)\n[ ![Researcher Found Flaw to Discover Phone Numbers Linked to Any Google Account](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/bluenoroff-deepfake-zoom-scam-hits.html) Researcher Found Flaw to Discover Phone Numbers Linked to Any Google Account ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/researcher-found-flaw-to-discover-phone.html)\n[ ![The Hidden Cost of Treating Compliance as an Afterthought](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/bluenoroff-deepfake-zoom-scam-hits.html) The Hidden Cost of Treating Compliance as an Afterthought ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/expert-insights\/2025\/06\/the-hidden-cost-of-treating-compliance.html)\n[ ![Over 80,000 Microsoft Entra ID Accounts Targeted Using Open-Source TeamFiltration Tool](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/bluenoroff-deepfake-zoom-scam-hits.html) Over 80,000 Microsoft Entra ID Accounts Targeted Using Open-Source TeamFiltration Tool ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/over-80000-microsoft-entra-id-accounts.html)\n[ ![New Atomic macOS Stealer Campaign Exploits ClickFix to Target Apple Users](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/bluenoroff-deepfake-zoom-scam-hits.html) New Atomic macOS Stealer Campaign Exploits ClickFix to Target