"markdown": "X\n[![push](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/push\/Push-Security-Display-Ad-Scattered-Spider.png)](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/webinar\/scatteredspider?utm_campaign=12905815-FY25_Bleeping+Computer&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored-content)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * ChatGPT will analyze Gmail emails, manage schedule on Google Calendar\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-analyze-gmail-emails-manage-schedule-on-google-calendar\/)\n\n\n# ChatGPT will analyze Gmail emails, manage schedule on Google Calendar\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * June 19, 2025\n  * 09:29 AM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-analyze-gmail-emails-manage-schedule-on-google-calendar\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2023\/03\/24\/ChatGPT__headpic.jpg)\nChatGPT appears to be testing support for Gmail and Google Calendar integration. This will allow users to summarise emails and create events.\nChatGPT already supports Gmail integration, but it's tied to Deep Research.\nRight now, you can use information from Gmail in your Deep Research reports, but it's not possible to pull up emails from Gmail and summarise them.\nAs by Tibor on X, ChatGPT is now actively testing support for integrating Gmail and Calendar, so you can stay \"organized.\"\n![ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/ChatGPT-Gmail.jpg)\nOnce the feature rolls out, you'll be able to use ChatGPT to analyze email, create a response to the email, turn emails into a story, and then make schedules directly from ChatGPT.\nAI researcher Tibor told me that the feature could be tied to ChatGPT Search feature, as indicated by one of the FAQ pages:\n![Gmail](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/images\/news\/u\/1097497\/AI\/GPT-Gmail.jpg)**ChatGPT FAQ hints at Google services integration for Search**\nOpenAI could formally announce the integration in the coming days.\n[ ![Tines Needle](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-analyze-gmail-emails-manage-schedule-on-google-calendar\/)](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n## [Why IT teams are ditching manual patch management](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\nPatching used to mean complex scripts, long hours, and endless fire drills. Not anymore.\nIn this new guide, Tines breaks down how modern IT orgs are leveling up with automation. Patch faster, reduce overhead, and focus on strategic work -- no complex scripts required.\n[Get the free guide](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n### Related Articles:\n[Google Gemini AI is getting ChatGPT-like Scheduled Actions feature](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/google-gemini-ai-is-getting-chatgpt-like-scheduled-actions-feature\/)\n[OpenAI confirms threat actors use ChatGPT to write malware](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/openai-confirms-threat-actors-use-chatgpt-to-write-malware\/)\n[ChatGPT's AI coder Codex now lets you choose the best solution](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpts-ai-coder-codex-now-lets-you-choose-the-best-solution\/)\n[ChatGPT o3 API 80% price drop has no impact on performance](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-o3-api-80-percent-price-drop-has-no-impact-on-performance\/)\n[ChatGPT prepares o3-pro model for $200 Pro subscribers](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-prepares-o3-pro-model-for-200-pro-subscribers\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chatgpt\/)\n  * [Gmail](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/gmail\/)\n  * [Google](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/google\/)\n  * [Google Calendar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/google-calendar\/)\n  * [OpenAI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/openai\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-analyze-gmail-emails-manage-schedule-on-google-calendar\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/duckduckgo-beefs-up-scam-defense-to-block-fake-stores-crypto-sites\/)\n  * [Next Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/microsoft-unveils-new-security-defaults-for-windows-365-cloud-pcs\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Avast](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/g\/gendigital\/Avast_400x500_v1.png)](https:\/\/www.avast.com\/lp-free-av?full_trSrc=mmm_blp_dlp_008_407_a&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_campaign=blp_dlp_008_407_a:banner )\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Windows Server](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-analyze-gmail-emails-manage-schedule-on-google-calendar\/) Microsoft: June Windows Server security updates cause DHCP issues ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-june-windows-server-security-updates-cause-dhcp-issues\/)\n  * [ ![Ghost Spider](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-analyze-gmail-emails-manage-schedule-on-google-calendar\/) Hackers switch to targeting U.S. insurance companies ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/google-warns-scattered-spider-hackers-now-target-us-insurance-companies\/)\n  * [ ![Veeam](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-analyze-gmail-emails-manage-schedule-on-google-calendar\/) New Veeam RCE flaw lets domain users hack backup servers ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/new-veeam-rce-flaw-lets-domain-users-hack-backup-servers\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![ChainLink Phishing: Designed to Bypass Traditional Defenses. Watch the Webinar. ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-analyze-gmail-emails-manage-schedule-on-google-calendar\/) ChainLink Phishing: Designed to Bypass Traditional Defenses. Watch the Webinar.  ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/resources\/webinars\/chainlink-phishing-the-chained-sequences-of-modern-phishing?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=banner&utm_campaign=chainlink_phishing_june)\n  * [ ![AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-analyze-gmail-emails-manage-schedule-on-google-calendar\/) AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report ](https:\/\/info.varonis.com\/