"title": "How to Build a DLP Program That Delivers",,
"url": "https:\/\/www.security.com\/expert-perspectives\/how-build-dlp-program-delivers",,
"summary": "The content outlines a strategic approach for building a successful Data Loss Prevention (DLP) program through a four-phase method focused on business alignment, data management, policy execution, and governance. Key elements include starting with small changes, obtaining stakeholder buy-in, and addressing challenges related to cost, ownership, and complexity. Symantec DLP is highlighted as a solution offering advanced detection capabilities that reduce false positives and facilitate efficient incident response.",,
