"markdown": "X\n[![push](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/push\/Push-Security-Display-Ad-Scattered-Spider.png)](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/webinar\/scatteredspider?utm_campaign=12905815-FY25_Bleeping+Computer&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored-content)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Artificial Intelligence](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/)\n  * OpenAI\u2019s Sam Altman discusses GPT-5 release date\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-sam-altman-discusses-gpt-5-release-date\/)\n\n\n# OpenAI\u2019s Sam Altman discusses GPT-5 release date\nBy \n###### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n  * June 19, 2025\n  * 11:43 AM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-sam-altman-discusses-gpt-5-release-date\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2023\/03\/24\/ChatGPT.jpg)\nChatGPT's next big upgrade, or the new foundational model 'GPT-5,' is being prepared for public release, but OpenAI won't share the specifics.\nIn a [recent interview](http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?app=desktop&v=DB9mjd-65gw), Sam Altman, CEO and co-founder of OpenAI, confirmed that ChatGPT's GPT-5 model release date is sometime in summer, but it depends on a number of factors.\nOpenAI has internal benchmarks and other standards set for GPT-5, and unless those are met, OpenAI might not release the model to the public.\nSam added that he doesn't know 'exactly when' GPT-5 will be rolled out, but there will be significant improvements.\n\"I don't know exactly when. One thing that we go back and forth on is how much are we supposed to, like, turn up the big number on new models versus what we did with GPT-4o, which is just better and better and better,\" he added.\nOpenAI previously confirmed that GPTs and [Operator will be getting a big upgrade as well](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-hints-at-a-big-upgrade-for-chatgpt-operator-agent\/), and GPT-5 isn't the only model the company is cooking.\n[ ![Tines Needle](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/t\/tines\/tines-needle.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n## [Why IT teams are ditching manual patch management](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\nPatching used to mean complex scripts, long hours, and endless fire drills. Not anymore.\nIn this new guide, Tines breaks down how modern IT orgs are leveling up with automation. Patch faster, reduce overhead, and focus on strategic work -- no complex scripts required.\n[Get the free guide](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n### Related Articles:\n[OpenAI hints at a big upgrade for ChatGPT Operator Agent](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-hints-at-a-big-upgrade-for-chatgpt-operator-agent\/)\n[OpenAI is hopeful GPT-5 will compete a little more](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-is-hopeful-gpt-5-will-compete-a-little-more\/)\n[OpenAI plans to ship an interesting ChatGPT product by 2026](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-plans-to-ship-an-interesting-chatgpt-product-by-2026\/)\n[OpenAI confirms Operator Agent is now more accurate with o3](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openai-confirms-operator-agent-is-now-more-accurate-with-o3\/)\n[ChatGPT will analyze Gmail emails, manage schedule on Google Calendar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/chatgpt-will-analyze-gmail-emails-manage-schedule-on-google-calendar\/)\n  * [AI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ai\/)\n  * [ChatGPT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/chatgpt\/)\n  * [GPT-5](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/gpt-5\/)\n  * [OpenAI](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/openai\/)\n  * [Operator](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/operator\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-sam-altman-discusses-gpt-5-release-date\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\n##### [Mayank Parmar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/mayank-parmar\/)\nMayank Parmar is an technology entrepreneur who is currently pursuing an MBA. At BleepingComputer, he covers technology news with a strong focus on Microsoft and Windows-related stories. He is always poking under the hood of Windows, looking for the latest secrets to reveal. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/legal\/us-recovers-225-million-of-crypto-stolen-in-investment-scams\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Avast](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/g\/gendigital\/Avast_400x500_v1.png)](https:\/\/www.avast.com\/lp-free-av?full_trSrc=mmm_blp_dlp_008_407_a&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_campaign=blp_dlp_008_407_a:banner )\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Windows Server](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-sam-altman-discusses-gpt-5-release-date\/) Microsoft: June Windows Server security updates cause DHCP issues ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-june-windows-server-security-updates-cause-dhcp-issues\/)\n  * [ ![Ghost Spider](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-sam-altman-discusses-gpt-5-release-date\/) Hackers switch to targeting U.S. insurance companies ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/google-warns-scattered-spider-hackers-now-target-us-insurance-companies\/)\n  * [ ![Veeam](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-sam-altman-discusses-gpt-5-release-date\/) New Veeam RCE flaw lets domain users hack backup servers ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/new-veeam-rce-flaw-lets-domain-users-hack-backup-servers\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-sam-altman-discusses-gpt-5-release-date\/) AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report ](https:\/\/info.varonis.com\/en\/state-of-data-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![ChainLink Phishing: Designed to Bypass Traditional Defenses. Watch the Webinar. ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-sam-altman-discusses-gpt-5-release-date\/) ChainLink Phishing: Designed to Bypass Traditional Defenses. Watch the Webinar.  ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/resources\/webinars\/chainlink-phishing-the-chained-sequences-of-modern-phishing?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=banner&utm_campaign=chainlink_phishing_june)\n  * [ ![Elevate your cyber defense: Learn to design powerful Blue Team playbooks with Wazuh.](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/artificial-intelligence\/openais-sam-altman-discusses-gpt-5-release-date\/) Elevate your cyber defense: Learn to design powerful Blue Team playbooks with Wazuh. ](https:\/\/wazuh.com\/?utm_sour