RuZeTlRZbnoDgEpJnY111NJurNHeqUlJ8XSTcvr2Lvy0lGPsN1nU-4msWTfy_Qyn7v5MxxExQXugkSTz5T90lzcmdC0xfVO9WwB2ax8VU0C\/w300-e100\/chain.png)](https:\/\/thehackernews.uk\/true-cost-cves)\nMost Read News\n[ ![Microsoft Patches 67 Vulnerabilities Including WEBDAV Zero-Day Exploited in the Wild](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/67-trojanized-github-repositories-found.html) Microsoft Patches 67 Vulnerabilities Including WEBDAV Zero-Day Exploited in the Wild ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/microsoft-patches-67-vulnerabilities.html)\n[ ![New Atomic macOS Stealer Campaign Exploits ClickFix to Target Apple Users](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/67-trojanized-github-repositories-found.html) New Atomic macOS Stealer Campaign Exploits ClickFix to Target Apple Users ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/new-atomic-macos-stealer-campaign.html)\n[ ![Over 269,000 Websites Infected with JSFireTruck JavaScript Malware in One Month](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/67-trojanized-github-repositories-found.html) Over 269,000 Websites Infected with JSFireTruck JavaScript Malware in One Month ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/over-269000-websites-infected-with.html)\n[ ![The Hidden Threat in Your Stack: Why Non-Human Identity Management is the Next Cybersecurity Frontier](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/67-trojanized-github-repositories-found.html) The Hidden Threat in Your Stack: Why Non-Human Identity Management is the Next Cybersecurity Frontier ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/the-hidden-threat-in-your-stack-why-non.html)\n[ ![Non-Human Identities: How to Address the Expanding Security Risk](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/67-trojanized-github-repositories-found.html) Non-Human Identities: How to Address the Expanding Security Risk ](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/2025\/06\/non-human-identities-how-to-address.html)\n[ ![Over 80,000 Microsoft Entra ID Accounts Targeted Using Open-Source TeamFiltration Tool](https:\/\/thehackernews.com\/20