"markdown": "![island](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/large_martinique_island_77f6ffcb7c.png)\nImage: Pierre Becam\/Photomosh\n[Jonathan Greig](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/jonathan-greig)June 20th, 2025\n# Tonga Ministry of Health hit with cyberattack affecting website, IT systems\nTonga\u2019s top health official warned the island country\u2019s residents that a ransomware attack has taken down its National Health Information System. \nThe Ministry of Health statements on Wednesday explaining that it is dealing with a cyberattack on its IT systems affecting the organization\u2019s website and other tools. \nMinister of Health Ana \u2018Akau\u2019ola then [told](https:\/\/talanoaotonga.to\/health-ministrys-information-system-hit-by-ransomware-attack\/) parliament on Thursday that an unnamed ransomware gang attacked the National Health Information System, demanding millions in ransom to restore the system. \n\u2018Akau\u2019ola said she learned of the incident earlier in the week and explained that cybersecurity experts from Australia arrived on Thursday to help the government resolve the issue. \n\u2018Akau\u2019ola held another press conference on Friday where she said the attack was discovered on June 15. \n\u201cThis system is used to record and register patients at the hospital. It contains the history of all our patients, including their medical records, prescriptions, health risks and future plans for patients,\u201d she [told](https:\/\/matangitonga.to\/2025\/06\/20\/ransomware-attack-takes-down-Tonga-national-health-information-system) reporters, according to local news outlet Matangi Tonga. \n\u201cThis happened on Sunday, I was informed from the hospital that the system was not functioning. Everything we do at the hospital, including ordering pills are all done in this system.\u201d \n\u2018Akau\u2019ola added that officials initially reached out to their IT contractor based in Fiji who confirmed that it was a ransomware attack. The National Health Information System was introduced in 2019 as part of an effort to digitize government records. \nIn its public statement, the Ministry of Health told people to bring cards that list out their prescriptions because doctors do not have access to medical records. Tonga has four hospitals: Vaiola Hospital, Prince Wellington Ngu Hospital, Niu\u2019ui Hospital and Niu\u2019eki Hospital. \nAs of Friday afternoon, the Ministry of Health website is still down. The Polynesian country is made up of some 171 islands and has a population of about 100,000. \nNo hacking group has taken credit for the attack. In 2023, Tonga\u2019s state-owned telecommunications company [was taken down by the Medusa ransomware gang](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tonga-is-the-latest-pacific-island-nation-hit-with-ransomware) \u2014 a group responsible for [more than 300 attacks](https:\/\/therecord.media\/medusa-ransomware-targeting-critical-infrastructure-orgs) in critical infrastructure sectors. \nThree months ago, the Ministry of Health for another Pacific island nation, Palau, was [also taken down by a ransomware attack](https:\/\/therecord.media\/palau-health-ministry-ransomware-recover). \n  * [](https:\/\/news.ycombinator.com\/submitlink?u=&t=Tonga Ministry of Health hit with cyberattack affecting website, IT systems)\n  * [](https:\/\/bsky.app\/intent\/compose?text=Tonga Ministry of Health hit with cyberattack affecting website, IT systems )\n\n\n  * [Cybercrime](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/cybercrime)\n  * [Government](https:\/\/therecord.media\/news\/government)\n  * [News](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n  * [News Briefs](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n\n\nGet more insights with the \nRecorded Future\nIntelligence Cloud.\n[Learn more.](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/platform?mtm_campaign=ad-unit-record)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_300x1050_1_0f2f11757e.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\n[![Recorded Future](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/2025_0514_Record_Ads_970x250_1_d144dbf901.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/?utm_source=therecord&utm_medium=ad)\nTags\n  * [Tonga](https:\/\/therecord.media\/)\n  * [Australia](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/australia)\n  * [local government](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/local-government)\n  * [health department](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tag\/health-department)\n\n\nNo previous article\nNo new articles\n[![Jonathan Greig](https:\/\/cms.therecord.media\/uploads\/format_webp\/DSC_0283_1_a6f4e4e315.jpg)](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/jonathan-greig)\n[Jonathan Greig](https:\/\/therecord.media\/author\/jonathan-greig)\nis a Breaking News Reporter at Recorded Future News. Jonathan has worked across the globe as a journalist since 2014. Before moving back to New York City, he worked for news outlets in South Africa, Jordan and Cambodia. He previously covered cybersecurity at ZDNet and TechRepublic.\n## Briefs\n  * [Tonga Ministry of Health hit with cyberattack affecting website, IT systemsJune 20th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/tonga-ministry-of-health-hit-with-cyberattack)\n  * [Krispy Kreme: Over 160,000 people had data stolen during November 2024 cyberattackJune 20th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/krispy-kreme-reports-data-breach-from-2024-attack)\n  * [Russian dairy supply disrupted by cyberattack on animal certification systemJune 20th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/russia-dairy-supply-disrupted-cyberattack)\n  * [Alleged Ryuk ransomware gang member arrested in Ukraine and extradited to US June 19th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/alleged-ryuk-member-arrest-ukraine-extradited-us)\n  * [Argentina uncovers suspected Russian spy ring behind disinformation campaignsJune 19th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/argentina-russia-spies-disinformation-project-lakhta)\n  * [More than 5 million affected by data breach at healthcare tech firm EpisourceJune 18th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/5-million-affected-episource-data-breach)\n  * [Pro-Cambodian hacktivists launch attacks on Thai government sites amid border disputeJune 17th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/pro-cambodian-hacktivists-target-thai-websites-amid-border-dispute)\n  * [Russia detects first SuperCard malware attacks skimming bank data via NFCJune 17th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/supercard-nfc-banking-malware-russia)\n  * [8.4 million people affected by data breach at Indian car share company ZoomcarJune 16th, 2025](https:\/\/therecord.media\/8-million-affected-zoomcar-data-breach)\n\n\n## [Threats to the 2025 NATO Summit![Threats to the 2025 NATO Summit](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/threats_2025_nato_summit_745b9b78b0.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/threats-2025-nato-summit)\n## [Artificial Eyes: Generative AI in China\u2019s Military Intelligence![Artificial Eyes: Generative AI in China\u2019s Military Intelligence](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/artificial_eyes_generative_ai_chinas_military_intelligence_a374052c6a.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/artificial-eyes-generative-ai-chinas-military-intelligence)\n## [GrayAlpha Uses Diverse Infection Vectors to Deploy PowerNet Loader and NetSupport RAT![GrayAlpha Uses Diverse Infection Vectors to Deploy PowerNet Loader and NetSupport RAT](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/recordedfuture_insikt_cover_gray_alpha_1600x600_e9dc818048.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/grayalpha-uses-diverse-infection-vectors-deploy-powernet-loader-netsupport-rat)\n## [Predator Still Active, with New Client and Corporate Links Identified![Predator Still Active, with New Client and Corporate Links Identified](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/recordedfuture_insikt_cover_predator_1600x600_2acdebaf2c.jpg)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/predator-still-active-new-links-identified)\n## [Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents![Russia-Aligned TAG-110 Targets Tajikistan with Macro-Enabled Word Documents](https:\/\/cms.recordedfuture.com\/uploads\/format_webp\/recordedfuture_insikt_Main_Featured_Banner_1600x600_2a9d7e6d39.png)](https:\/\/www.recordedfuture.com\/research\/russia-aligned-tag-110-targets-tajikistan-with-macro-enabled)\n",,
