"markdown": "X\n[![push](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/p\/push\/Push-Security-Display-Ad-Scattered-Spider.png)](https:\/\/pushsecurity.com\/webinar\/scatteredspider?utm_campaign=12905815-FY25_Bleeping+Computer&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=sponsored-content)\n  * [Home](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/)\n  * [News](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/)\n  * [Microsoft](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/)\n  * Microsoft investigates OneDrive bug that breaks file search\n\n\n  * [ ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/)\n\n\n# Microsoft investigates OneDrive bug that breaks file search\nBy \n###### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n  * June 20, 2025\n  * 12:39 PM\n  * [0](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/#comment_form)\n\n\n![OneDrive](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/content\/hl-images\/2025\/06\/20\/OneDrive.jpg)\n\u200bMicrosoft is investigating a known OneDrive issue that is causing searches to appear blank for some users or return no results even when searching for files they know they've already uploaded.\nIn a [support document](https:\/\/support.microsoft.com\/en-us\/office\/fixes-or-workarounds-for-recent-issues-in-onedrive-36110213-f3f6-490d-8cb7-3833539def0b#id0ebbn=windows) updated this week, the company shared that this bug impacts Windows, Android, iOS, and web users.\n\"Some OneDrive personal account users may notice that search results appear blank or don't return files they know exist. While the files are still present and accessible, they don't appear in search results,\" Microsoft explains in a [support document](https:\/\/support.microsoft.com\/en-us\/office\/fixes-or-workarounds-for-recent-issues-in-onedrive-36110213-f3f6-490d-8cb7-3833539def0b#id0ebbn=windows) published this week.\n\"We're actively investigating the root cause. The issue appears to affect a subset of users, and we're working closely with support teams to better understand the scope.\"\nRedmond is working to discover the root cause of these ongoing search problems that are impacting users across most OneDrive platforms. Microsoft added that there's no known workaround for those affected and no estimated timeline for a fix.\n\"We recognize the impact this issue is having and want to reassure you that we're working with urgency to resolve it as quickly as possible. Thank you for your patience as we work to resolve it,\" the company added.\nMicrosoft is also investigating a separate issue affecting iOS users and causing slo-mo videos uploaded to OneDrive to play at normal speed.\nThe company suggests that those experiencing this share the video from their iOS gallery to OneDrive instead of manually uploading it or adding it to OneDrive through automatic Camera Roll backup.\nEarlier this year, in January, Redmond [fixed another known issue](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-fixes-onedrive-bug-causing-macos-app-freezes\/) causing macOS apps to freeze when opening or saving files in OneDrive.\nAs Redmond explained when it [acknowledged the bug in November](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-issue-causing-macos-app-freezes\/), it only affected systems running Apple's macOS 15 Sequoia operating system.\n[ ![Tines Needle](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/t\/tines\/tines-needle.jpg) ](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n## [Why IT teams are ditching manual patch management](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\nPatching used to mean complex scripts, long hours, and endless fire drills. Not anymore.\nIn this new guide, Tines breaks down how modern IT orgs are leveling up with automation. Patch faster, reduce overhead, and focus on strategic work -- no complex scripts required.\n[Get the free guide](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/unlocking-it-agility-with-automation-patch-management\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=june-in-article-banner)\n### Related Articles:\n[Microsoft: June Windows Server security updates cause DHCP issues](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-june-windows-server-security-updates-cause-dhcp-issues\/)\n[Windows 11 24H2 emergency update fixes Easy Anti-Cheat BSOD issue](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/windows-11-24h2-emergency-update-fixes-easy-anti-cheat-bsod-issue\/)\n[Microsoft creates separate Windows 11 24H2 update for incompatible PCs](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-creates-separate-windows-11-24h2-update-for-incompatible-pcs\/)\n[Microsoft fixes unreachable Windows Server domain controllers](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-fixes-unreachable-windows-server-domain-controllers\/)\n[Microsoft fixes Windows Server auth issues caused by April updates](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-fixes-windows-server-auth-issues-caused-by-april-updates\/)\n  * [Android](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/android\/)\n  * [iOS](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/ios\/)\n  * [Known Issue](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/known-issue\/)\n  * [OneDrive](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/onedrive\/)\n  * [Search](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/search\/)\n  * [Windows](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/tag\/windows\/)\n\n\n  * [](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/ \"Print article\")\n\n\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\n##### [Sergiu Gatlan](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/author\/sergiu-gatlan\/)\nSergiu is a news reporter who has covered the latest cybersecurity and technology developments for over a decade. Email or Twitter DMs for tips. \n  * [ Previous Article ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/cloudflare-blocks-record-73-tbps-ddos-attack-against-hosting-provider\/)\n\n\n##### Post a Comment [Community Rules](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/posting-guidelines\/)\n###### You need to login in order to post a comment\nNot a member yet? [Register Now](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/forums\/index.php?app=core&module=global&section=register)\n### You may also like:\n[![Skuld Stealer story](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/g\/gendigital\/Avast_400x500_v1_dark.png)](https:\/\/www.avast.com\/lp-free-av?full_trSrc=mmm_blp_dlp_008_407_b&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_campaign=blp_dlp_008_407_b:banner)\nPopular Stories\n  * [ ![Angry Cat](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/) No, the 16 billion credentials leak is not a new data breach ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/no-the-16-billion-credentials-leak-is-not-a-new-data-breach\/)\n  * [ ![Linux](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/) New Linux udisks flaw lets attackers get root on major Linux distros ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/linux\/new-linux-udisks-flaw-lets-attackers-get-root-on-major-linux-distros\/)\n  * [ ![Veeam](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/) New Veeam RCE flaw lets domain users hack backup servers ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/new-veeam-rce-flaw-lets-domain-users-hack-backup-servers\/)\n\n\nSponsor Posts\n  * [ ![Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/) Overdue a password health-check? Audit your Active Directory for free ](https:\/\/specopssoft.com\/product\/specops-password-auditor\/?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Still writing scripts in Python? Tines has a better way -- no custom code required](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/) Still writing scripts in Python? Tines has a better way -- no custom code required ](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/tines-vs-python-understanding-alternative-approaches-to-automation\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=article-sidebar)\n  * [ ![AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/) AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report ](https:\/\/info.varonis.com\/en\/state-of-data-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![ChainLink Phishing: Designed to Bypass Traditional Defenses. Watch the Webinar. ](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/) ChainLink Phishing: Designed to Bypass Traditional Defenses. Watch the Webinar.  ](https:\/\/keepaware.com\/resources\/webinars\/chainlink-phishing-the-chained-sequences-of-modern-phishing?utm_source=bleeping_computer&utm_medium=banner&utm_campaign=chainlink_phishing_june)\n  * [ ![Inside the 2025 Verizon DBIR - Register for the Webinar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/) Inside the 2025 Verizon DBIR - Register for the Webinar ](https:\/\/layerx.easywebinar.live\/layerx-verizon-dbir?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=DBIRwebinar26062025)\n\n\n[![Picus](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/g\/gendigital\/300-600-Laptopv1_dark.png)](https:\/\/www.avast.com\/lp-free-av?full_trSrc=mmm_blp_dlp_008_407_f&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_campaign=blp_dlp_008_407_f:banner)\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/microsoft\/microsoft-investigates-onedrive-bug-that-breaks-file-search\/ \"Submit\")\n![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=2)![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/ad-delivery.net\/px.gif?ch=1&e=0.09808109775553431)\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_campaign=branding&utm_medium=stickyFooter&utm_source=bleepingcomputer.com&utm_content=bleepingcomputer_970x90_728x90_320x50_sticky)\n",,
