"title": "BitoPro exchange links Lazarus hackers to $11 million crypto heist",,
"url": "https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/bitopro-exchange-links-lazarus-hackers-to-11-million-crypto-heist\/",,
"summary": "The Taiwanese cryptocurrency exchange BitoPro attributes a cyberattack, resulting in the theft of $11 million in cryptocurrency, to the North Korean hacking group Lazarus. The attack exploited vulnerabilities during a hot wallet system update, allowing hackers to perform unauthorized withdrawals. The attack involved social engineering, malware implantation, and the hijacking of AWS session tokens to bypass multi-factor authentication. Despite mitigating steps, the stolen funds were laundered through DEXs and mixers. BitoPro has confirmed there was no internal involvement and has engaged external cybersecurity experts for investigation.",,
