-heist\/) AI is a data-breach time bomb: Read the new report ](https:\/\/info.varonis.com\/en\/state-of-data-security-report-2025?utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=bleepingcomputer_referral&utm_content=article)\n  * [ ![Inside the 2025 Verizon DBIR - Register for the Webinar](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/bitopro-exchange-links-lazarus-hackers-to-11-million-crypto-heist\/) Inside the 2025 Verizon DBIR - Register for the Webinar ](https:\/\/layerx.easywebinar.live\/layerx-verizon-dbir?utm_source=bleeping&utm_campaign=DBIRwebinar26062025)\n  * [ ![Still writing scripts in Python? Tines has a better way -- no custom code required](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/bitopro-exchange-links-lazarus-hackers-to-11-million-crypto-heist\/) Still writing scripts in Python? Tines has a better way -- no custom code required ](https:\/\/www.tines.com\/access\/guide\/tines-vs-python-understanding-alternative-approaches-to-automation\/?utm_source=BleepingComputer&utm_medium=paid_media&utm_content=article-sidebar)\n\n\n[![Picus](https:\/\/www.bleepstatic.com\/c\/g\/gendigital\/300-600-Laptopv1.png)](https:\/\/www.avast.com\/lp-free-av?full_trSrc=mmm_blp_dlp_008_407_d&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=bleepingcomputer&utm_campaign=blp_dlp_008_407_d:sidebar)\n[](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/bitopro-exchange-links-lazarus-hackers-to-11-million-crypto-heist\/ \"Back to Top\")\n[](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Login\n![](https:\/\/ad.doubleclick.net\/favicon.ico?ad=300x250&ad_box_=1&adnet=1&showad=1&size=250x250)![](https:\/\/widgets.outbrain.com\/images\/widgetIcons\/achoice.svg)\n[ ](javascript:; \"Close\")\n#### Reporter\n###### Help us understand the problem. What is going on with this comment?\nSubmitting...\n[SUBMIT](https:\/\/www.bleepingcomputer.com\/news\/security\/bitopro-exchange-links-lazarus-hackers-to-11-million-crypto-heist\/ \"Submit\")\n[Freestar.com](https:\/\/ads.freestar.com\/?utm_ca