"markdown": "![](https:\/\/news.google.com\/rss\/articles\/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPdmJsYnlSZWN4UFplZUN1T1BHN1VvaEJFdUFEcTBZd0JyellldklOR1FTVS02SmJQUDVkekZCeTd2WEl1RVlfc1pjNXIxWXlBVjExSDk5RWJkanI1Z1RBWk90VFdJT3Rnejd4NVJCTVBNRHJUMUpkWHZMU052MFFwVGRwTmVJSHFtS1dPMzVYOHU0Y2kyY0IyaFdnbkRfNENPNUZRSXBn?oc=5)\n![Award Banner](https:\/\/media.asiaone.com\/creative\/award\/top_placement.png?3)\n![](https:\/\/news.google.com\/rss\/articles\/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPdmJsYnlSZWN4UFplZUN1T1BHN1VvaEJFdUFEcTBZd0JyellldklOR1FTVS02SmJQUDVkekZCeTd2WEl1RVlfc1pjNXIxWXlBVjExSDk5RWJkanI1Z1RBWk90VFdJT3Rnejd4NVJCTVBNRHJUMUpkWHZMU052MFFwVGRwTmVJSHFtS1dPMzVYOHU0Y2kyY0IyaFdnbkRfNENPNUZRSXBn?oc=5)\n![Award Banner](https:\/\/media.asiaone.com\/creative\/award\/top_placement.png?3)\n[entertainment](https:\/\/news.google.com\/showbiz)\n# Lee Joon Gi and Qin Lan win top awards at StarHub Night of Stars\n![Lee Joon Gi and Qin Lan win top awards at StarHub Night of Stars](https:\/\/media.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/styles\/article_top_image\/public\/original_images\/Dec2018\/20181224_joongiqinlan_0.jpg?itok=cDU8HgiS)\nPUBLISHED ON**December 24, 2018 2:33 AM**\n34 artistes from China, Hong Kong, Korea, Taiwan and Singapore lit up the Sands theatre at Marina Bay Sands on Saturday (Dec 22) to celebrate the best of Asian entertainment at StarHub's Night of Stars awards ceremony.\nSouth Korean actor Lee Joon Gi and [Chinese actress Qin Lan](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/entertainment\/qin-lan-shares-what-she-looks-ideal-boyfriend) emerged as the big winners of the night, taking home the 2018 StarHub Best Male and Female Asian Star Awards respectively. \n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545619915.jpg) _Qin Lan_ Photo: StarHub\nAt the start of the show, hosts Dennis Nieh, Lulu Huang and Kate Pang delighted the 1,980-strong crowd with a short opening skit. \n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620887.jpg) _Kate Pang, Dennis Nieh and Lulu entertain the audience._ Photo: StarHub\nThe first award of the night, the 2018 StarHub Best Host Award, was presented to veteran host Pauline Lan for the success of Lady First Singapore, which is now in its sixth season.\n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545619315.jpg) _Pauline Lan_ Photo: StarHub\nVeteran actress Chen Meifeng - who's known as 'Taiwan's hottest obasan (auntie)', was handed the 2018 StarHub Evergreen Artiste Award.\n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545619659.jpg) _Chen Meifeng_ Photo: StarHub ![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545619838.jpg)\nLee Joon Gi\u2019s realistic portrayal of the Lawless Lawyer earned him the 2018 StarHub Best Male Asian Star Award; the series went on to become one of the highest rated Korean dramas in Korea cable television history. \n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620057.jpg) _Lee Joon Gi_ Photo: StarHub\nQin Lan's performance as a warm-hearted, gentle empress in hit drama series Story of Yanxi Palace won the hearts of fans worldwide, winning her the 2018 StarHub Best Female Asian Star Award. \n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620169.jpg) _Qin Lan_ Photo: StarHub\nIn another win for Story of Yanxi Palace, [Singaporean actor Lawrence Wong](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/entertainment\/lawrence-wong-qin-lan-dating-rumours-im-her-little-brother), who played lively general Hai Lan Cha, took home the 2018 StarHub Breakthrough Star Award.\n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620190.jpg) _Lawrence Wong_ Photo: StarHub\nThe talented actor also serenaded the crowd during the event, performing his latest single. \n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620219.jpg) _Lawrence Wong_ Photo: StarHub\nHong Kong actor Joe Ma bagged the 2018 StarHub Best TVB Artiste Award, while actress Rebecca Zhu's portrayal of Sheung Mei Mui, a lively stuntwoman in The Stunt earned her the 2018 StarHub Best TV Drama Character Award.\n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620250.jpg) _Joe Ma_ Photo: StarHub ![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620279.jpg) _Rebecca Zhu_ Photo: StarHub\nPopular [Taiwanese actor Jasper Liu](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/entertainment\/jasper-liu-sends-love-goddess-yoona-and-puff-kuo-who-does-he-want-marry) received the 2018 StarHub Dazzling Star Award, while fellow Taiwanese actor Derek Chang accepted the 2018 StarHub Rising Star Award for his role as a budding designer An Qing Hui in My Dear Boy.\n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620682.jpg) _Jasper greets the crowd._ Photo: StarHub ![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620683.jpg) ![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620559.jpg) _Derek Chang with the 2018 StarHub Rising Star Award._ Photo: StarHub\nIn the music category, South Korean boy band A.C.E nabbed the 2018 StarHub Best Newcomer Award and took centre stage to perform their hit songs Cactus and Take Me Higher. \n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620299.jpg) _A.C.E_ Photo: StarHub ![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620300.jpg) ![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545621903.jpg) ![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620498.jpg) _A.C.E and Lee Joong Gi_ Photo: StarHub\n2018 StarHub Most Charismatic Performance Award winners girl group Cosmic Girls then wowed the crowd with their song and dance items Secret and Save Me, Save You.\n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620347.jpg) _Cosmic Girls_ Photo: StarHub ![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620347_0.jpg) ![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620781.jpg)\nThe audience was also treated to a stellar performance of It\u2019s You, from the original soundtrack of top Korean drama What\u2019s Wrong with Secretary Kim, by the winner of the 2018 StarHub Best Asian Drama OST Award, Korean singer Jeong Sewoon.\n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620385.jpg) _Jeong Sewoon_ Photo: StarHub ![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620449.jpg)\nTaiwanese ballad singer Sam Lee made a special guest appearance and presented Cosmic Girls and Jeong Sewoon with their award, before bringing the house down with his hit classics.\n![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620409.jpg) _Sam Lee_ Photo: StarHub ![](https:\/\/www.asiaone.com\/sites\/default\/files\/inline\/images\/228_1545620471.jpg) _Sam Lee_ Photo: StarHub\n_Viewers can catch the premiere of StarHub Night of Stars on Hub VV Drama (StarHub TV Channel 855) on 13 January 2019,__7pm_ _. The show will also be made available on Hub E City (StarHub TV Channel 111\/825) on 19 January 2019,__8:45pm_ _and 4 February 2019,__4:30pm._\n_asiaone@mm2entertainment.com_\n[Starhub](https:\/\/news.google.com\/tags\/starhub)[Awards and prizes](https:\/\/news.google.com\/tags\/awards-and-prizes)[Film festivals\/awards](https:\/\/news.google.com\/tags\/film-festivalsawards)\nShare this article\nThis website is best viewed using the latest versions of web browsers.\n",,
